 finns inom Malmö stad i linjeformat. Lagret innehåller existerande järnvägar som ägs och driftas av olika aktörer."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2023-06-26T10:59:02.875309"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-16T12:22:39.741496"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Planlagte jernbaner"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Planned railways"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Planerade järnvägar"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:0df1eaa701c81d5f1c7747ed3a549a9a1bb659115f39fa555e2768551b937a3c_b3n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:0df1eaa701c81d5f1c7747ed3a549a9a1bb659115f39fa555e2768551b937a3c"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:1091571fdabe8eb69562281ba64014037ac1bf8ad3e122e5913959d404dc434e_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/31bef806-a038-4148-8408-114c043ab0f4","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/31bef806-a038-4148-8408-114c043ab0f4/resource/09de2d85-80ca-495c-ac6a-a9d646e87e58"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/31bef806-a038-4148-8408-114c043ab0f4/resource/53828d82-3da9-4cb9-8ae7-91ab7dc8abcb"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/31bef806-a038-4148-8408-114c043ab0f4/resource/6730378b-f155-4346-ab5e-5e41bb9cc3bc"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/31bef806-a038-4148-8408-114c043ab0f4/resource/6d6b412d-1996-45e8-8a4c-6fdeb9e4634c"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/31bef806-a038-4148-8408-114c043ab0f4/resource/7f9fa1f4-8084-4e05-b012-48d541e70f02"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/31bef806-a038-4148-8408-114c043ab0f4/resource/9ef816cd-876a-4bcb-b5af-4ea37e7dbc7c"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/31bef806-a038-4148-8408-114c043ab0f4/resource/b97f5fb7-34db-4d5d-8769-42b6eb753e9f"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/31bef806-a038-4148-8408-114c043ab0f4/resource/cb623299-ecdb-41be-b2db-66d1974828c5"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/31bef806-a038-4148-8408-114c043ab0f4/resource/ccb56bb4-cc5b-4a0e-8dbc-31c058152389"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","politik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Data om valgresultater fra kommunalvalgene i Malmø fra 1994 og fremefter.\n\nStatistik i procent.\n\n**Mere information** :\nhttps://malmo.se/Service/Om%2dMalmo%2dstad/Politik%2dbeslut%2doch%2dpaverkan.html\n\n**Kolada kommune og amtsråds database**  \nDisse åbne data er hentet fra Kolada-databasen over kommuner og amtsråd, som\nindeholder sammenlignelige nøgletal for alle Sveriges kommuner og amtsråd.\nNøgletallene er baseret på data fra en lang række myndigheder og\norganisationer såsom Statistikcentralen, Skolstyrelsen, Valstyrelsen,\nErhvervsstyrelsen, Skolstyrelsen, Socialstyrelsen og BRÅ.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Data on election results from the municipal council elections in Malmö from\n1994 onwards.\n\nStatistics in percentage.\n\n**More information** :\nhttps://malmo.se/Service/Om%2dMalmo%2dstad/Politik%2dbeslut%2doch%2dpaverkan.html\n\n**Kolada municipality and county council database**  \nThis open data is taken from the Kolada database of municipalities and county\ncouncils, which contains comparable key figures for all of Sweden's\nmunicipalities and county councils. The key figures are based on data from a\nlarge number of authorities and organizations such as Statistics Sweden, the\nSwedish National Agency for Education, the Swedish Election Authority, the\nSwedish Companies Registration Office, the Swedish National Agency for\nEducation, the Swedish National Board of Health and Welfare, and BRÅ.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Data över valresultatet från kommunfullmäktigevalet i Malmö från 1994 och framåt. \n\nStatistiken i procent.\n\n__Mer information__: https://malmo.se/Service/Om-Malmo-stad/Politik-beslut-och-paverkan.html\n\n__Kommun- och landstingsdatabasen Kolada__  \nDen här öppna datan hämtas från Kommun- och landstingsdatabasen Kolada som innehåller jämförbara nyckeltal om alla Sveriges kommuner och landsting. Nyckeltalen baseras på data från ett stort antal myndigheter och organisationer som exempelvis SCB, SKL, Valmyndigheten, Bolagsverket, Skolverket, Socialstyrelsen och BRÅ. "}],"dct:identifier":"31bef806-a038-4148-8408-114c043ab0f4","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-11-24"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-07-01T11:40:42.103456"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:1091571fdabe8eb69562281ba64014037ac1bf8ad3e122e5913959d404dc434e_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Valgresultater"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Election results"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Valresultat"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/31bef806-a038-4148-8408-114c043ab0f4/resource/09de2d85-80ca-495c-ac6a-a9d646e87e58","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N05809"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Antal stemmer for andre partier ved det seneste kommunalvalg divideret med\nantallet af gyldige stemmer ved det seneste kommunalvalg, ganget med 100.\nAndre partier henviser til partier, der ikke er repræsenteret i Riksdagen.\nKilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Number of votes for other parties in the last municipal election divided by\nthe number of valid votes in the last municipal election, multiplied by 100.\nOther parties refer to parties that are not represented in the Riksdag.\nSource: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal röster på övriga partier i senaste kommunvalet dividerat med antalet giltiga röster i senaste kommunvalet, multiplicerat med 100. Med övriga partiet avses de partier som ej är representerade i riksdagen. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-19T07:32:15.263853"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T06:54:39.110502"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Stemmer på andre partier ved det seneste kommunalvalg, andel (%) (N05809)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Votes for other parties in the last municipal election, share (%) (N05809)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Röster på övriga partier i senaste kommunvalet, andel (%) (N05809)"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/31bef806-a038-4148-8408-114c043ab0f4/resource/53828d82-3da9-4cb9-8ae7-91ab7dc8abcb","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N05807"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Antal stemmer for Centerpartiet ved det seneste kommunalvalg divideret med\nantallet af gyldige stemmer ved det seneste kommunalvalg, ganget med 100.\nKilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Number of votes for the Center Party in the last municipal election divided by\nthe number of valid votes in the last municipal election, multiplied by 100.\nSource: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal röster på Centerpartiet i senaste kommunvalet dividerat med antalet giltiga röster i senaste kommunvalet, multiplicerat med 100. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-19T06:53:55.552265"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T06:54:13.546826"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Stemmer på Centerpartiet ved det seneste kommunalvalg, andel (%) (N05807)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Votes for the Center Party in the last municipal election, share (%) (N05807)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Röster på Centerpartiet i senaste kommunvalet, andel (%) (N05807)"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/31bef806-a038-4148-8408-114c043ab0f4/resource/6730378b-f155-4346-ab5e-5e41bb9cc3bc","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N05808"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Antal stemmer til Kristendemokraterne ved det seneste kommunalvalg divideret\nmed antallet af gyldige stemmer ved det seneste kommunalvalg, ganget med 100.\nKilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Number of votes for the Christian Democrats in the last municipal election\ndivided by the number of valid votes in the last municipal election,\nmultiplied by 100. Source: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal röster på Kristdemokraterna i senaste kommunvalet dividerat med antalet giltiga röster i senaste kommunvalet, multiplicerat med 100. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-19T07:28:24.284425"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T06:54:39.110414"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Stemmer til Kristendemokraterne ved det seneste kommunalvalg, andel (%) (N05808)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Votes for the Christian Democrats in the last municipal election, share (%) (N05808)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Röster på Kristdemokraterna i senaste kommunvalet, andel (%) (N05808)"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/31bef806-a038-4148-8408-114c043ab0f4/resource/6d6b412d-1996-45e8-8a4c-6fdeb9e4634c","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N05802"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Antal stemmer for Venstrepartiet ved det seneste kommunalvalg divideret med\nantallet af gyldige stemmer ved det seneste kommunalvalg, ganget med 100.\nKilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Number of votes for the Left Party in the last municipal election divided by\nthe number of valid votes in the last municipal election, multiplied by 100.\nSource: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal röster på Vänsterpartiet i senaste kommunvalet dividerat med antalet giltiga röster i senaste kommunvalet, multiplicerat med 100. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-19T05:51:52.564589"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T06:51:58.004983"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Stemmer på Ven