5,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Karl McShane","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:karl.mcshane@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/ab00da3c-3fc0-4363-aed0-658b640b4aaf","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/ab00da3c-3fc0-4363-aed0-658b640b4aaf/resource/152acd48-9d80-4baa-a86c-eebc7e13e2da"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/ab00da3c-3fc0-4363-aed0-658b640b4aaf/resource/d85efeb0-5b06-4ab6-af3c-3b9f8456b597"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Viser, i hvilken branche de erhvervsaktive personer, der bor i området,\narbejder. Opdelingen følger Standarden for svensk industriklassificering (SNI)\n2007. Kategorierne O (ukendt), A (landbrug, jagt og skovbrug), B (udvinding af\nmaterialer), D (forsyning af el, gas, varme og køling), E (vandforsyning\nosv.), T (husholdningsproduktion osv.) og U (aktivitet i internationale\norganisationer) er blevet slået sammen til kategorien \"Andet\" på grund af det\nlave antal personer, der arbejder i disse brancher. Variablen viser også det\nsamlede antal personer, der arbejder i området. Kun personer, der arbejder i\nSverige, tælles med. Variablen er opdelt efter køn. Den vises for befolkningen\ni alderen 16-74 år. Den er baseret på statistik fra SCB RAMS (\"Registerbaseret\narbejdsmarkedsstatistik\"). Statistikken omfatter alle personer mellem 16 og 74\når, der er registreret i Sverige den 31. december. Fra og med referenceåret\n2019 bruger Statistiska Centralen (SCB) en ny datakilde og metode til at\nklassificere erhvervsaktive personer i RAMS. Ændringen i kilde og metode\nbetyder, at sammenligninger af statistikker for 2019 og tidligere referenceår\nskal foretages med stor forsigtighed. Læs mere på SCB.se\n\n**Variabelbeskrivelse**  \nDu finder det\n[her](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**API'er**  \nVed at bruge API-kaldet\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics_\nkan du hente alle datasæt, der indeholder statistiske data for Malmøs områder,\ni JSON-format.  \nI hver forekomst af result/results i JSON-resultatet er der en \"id\"-egenskab\nfor hver ressource. Værdien af ​​\"id\" kan bruges til at hente dataene for den\nrespektive statistikvariabel (i henhold til værdien af ​​egenskaben \"name\").\nAPI-kald til at hente statistikdataene:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-\nværdi]_\n\nBrug gerne tallene, men angiv \"Bykontoret, Malmö Kommune\" som kilde.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Shows in which industry the gainfully employed people living in the area work.\nThe division follows the Standard for Swedish Industrial Classification (SNI)\n2007. The categories O (unknown), A (agriculture, hunting and forestry), B\n(extraction of materials), D (supply of electricity, gas, heating and\ncooling), E (water supply, etc.), T (household production, etc.) and U\n(activity at international organizations) have been merged into the category\n\"Other\" due to the low number of people working in these industries. The\nvariable also shows the total number of people working in the area. Only\npeople working in Sweden are counted. The variable is divided by gender. It is\nshown for the population aged 16–74. It is based on statistics from SCB RAMS\n(\"Register-based labour market statistics\"). The statistics include all\nindividuals between 16 and 74 who are registered in Sweden on 31 December.\nStarting with reference year 2019, Statistics Sweden uses a new data source\nand method to classify gainfully employed persons in RAMS. The change in\nsource and method means that comparisons of statistics for 2019 and previous\nreference years must be made with great caution. Read more at SCB.se\n\n**Variable description**  \nYou find it\n[here](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**APIs**  \nUsing the API call\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics,_\nyou can retrieve all data sets that contain statistical data for Malmö's areas\nin JSON format.  \nIn each instance of result/results in the JSON result, there is an \"id\"\nproperty for each resource. The value of \"id\" can be used to retrieve the data\nfor the respective statistics variable (according to the value of the \"name\"\nproperty). API call to retrieve the statistics data:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id\nvalue]_\n\nFeel free to use the numbers, but cite “City Office, Malmö City” as the\nsource.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visar inom vilken industri de förvärvsarbetande som bor inom området arbetar. Uppdelningen följer Standard för svensk näringsgrensindelning (SNI) 2007. Kategorierna O (okänd), A (jordbruk, jakt och skogsbruk), B (utvinning av material), D (försörjning av el, gas, värme och kyla), E (vattenförsörjning m.m.), T (hushållens produktion med mera) och U (verksamhet vid internationella organisationer) har slagits ihop till kategorin ”Övriga” på grund av det låga antalet arbetande i dessa industrier. Variabeln visar även totalt antal arbetande som bor i området. Endast personer som arbetar i Sverige räknas med. Variabeln finns uppdelad på kön. Visas för befolkningen 16–74 år. Bygger på statistik från SCB RAMS (”Registerbaserad arbetsmarknadsstatistik”). I statistiken ingår samtliga individer mellan 16 och 74 som är folkbokförda i Sverige den 31 december. Från och med referensår 2019 använder SCB en ny datakälla och metod för att klassificera förvärvsarbetande i RAMS. Bytet av källa och metod innebär att jämförelser av statistik avseende 2019 och tidigare referensår måste göras med stor försiktighet. Läs mer på SCB.se\n\n__Variabelbeskrivning__  \nHittar du [här](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)!  \n                     \n__API__  \nMed hjälp av API-anropet *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistik* får man i JSON-format fram samtliga datamängder som innehåller statistikunderlag för Malmös områden.  \nI varje instans av result/results i JSON-resultatet finns för varje resurs en egenskap \"id\". Värdet för \"id\" kan användas för att hämta datan för respektive statistikvariabel (enligt värdet för egenskapen \"name\").\nAPI-anrop för att hämta statistikdatan: *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-värdet]*   \n\nAnvänd gärna siffrorna, men ange “Stadskontoret, Malmö stad” som källa."}],"dct:identifier":"ab00da3c-3fc0-4363-aed0-658b640b4aaf","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-16"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:04:16.412827"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:351621f3633c0aa5eb833281af230ca36abc6750f2bc452978f970444eeb7638_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Natbefolkning ifølge SNI 2007, 2019-2021 - Statistiske data for Malmøs områder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Nighttime population according to SNI 2007, 2019 - 2021 - Statistical data for Malmö's areas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nattbefolkning efter SNI 2007, 2019 - 2021 - Statistikunderlag för Malmös områden"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/ab00da3c-3fc0-4363-aed0-658b640b4aaf/resource/152acd48-9d80-4baa-a86c-eebc7e13e2da","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/ab00da3c-3fc0-4363-aed0-658b640b4aaf/resource/152acd48-9d80-4baa-a86c-eebc7e13e2da/download/nattbefolkning-efter-sni-2007-2019-2021.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"3188672"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø statistik - Natbefolkning ifølge SNI 2007, 2019-2021\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Nighttime population according to SNI 2007, 2019 - 2021\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Nattbefolkning efter SNI 2007, 2019 - 2021"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2024-08-22T07:56:02.019506"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:04:16.418888"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Natbefolkning efter SNI 2007, 2019-2021"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Nighttime population by SNI 2007, 2019 - 2021"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nattbefolkning efter SNI 2007, 2019 - 2021"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:351621f3633c0aa5eb833281af230ca36abc6750f2bc452978f970444eeb7638_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/ab00da3c-3fc0-4363-aed0-658b640b4aaf/resource/d85efeb0-5b06-4ab6-af3c-3b9f8456b597","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/action/datastore_search?resource_id=152acd48-9d80-4baa-a86c-eebc7e13e2da"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø statistik - Natbefolkning ifølge SNI 2007, 2019-2021\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Nighttime population according to SNI 2007, 2019 - 2021\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Nattbefolkning efter SNI 2007, 2019 - 2021"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2024-08-22T07:56:03.388368"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-13T23:04:19.333268"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Natbefolkning efter SNI 2007, 2019-2021"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Nighttime population by SNI 2007, 2019 - 2021"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nattbefolkning efter SNI 2007, 2019 - 2021"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:351621f3633c0aa5eb833281af230ca36abc6750f2bc452978f970444eeb7638"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:355ccada1530fddfae9a956ba6b49cfc7b358b7879e2fa14a2110b074b64dcd3_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"b2082e1d62f542def185f74a607b33ca"},{"@id":"_:355ccada1530fddfae9a956ba6b49cfc7b358b7879e2fa14a2110b074b64dcd3_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Karl McShane","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:karl.mcshane@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/7cf0a6b3-c884-4ccd-b7ef-671764fc3cd1","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/7cf0a6b3-c884-4ccd-b7ef-671764fc3cd1/resource/72351097-a3fc-4169-847a-b416c6482766"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/7cf0a6b3-c884-4ccd-b7ef-671764fc3cd1/resource/85c06917-68eb-4b5d-a23d-e7d681c5a022"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Viser den branche, hvor de beskæftigede i området arbejder. Opdelingen følger\nStandarden for svensk brancheklassificering (SNI) 2007. Kategorierne O\n(ukendt), A (landbrug, jagt og skovbrug), B (udvinding af materialer), D\n(forsyning af el, gas, varme og køling), E (vandforsyning mv.), T\n(husholdningsproduktion mv.) og U (aktivitet i internationale organisationer)\ner blevet slået sammen til kategorien \"Andet\" på grund af det lave antal\npersoner, der arbejder i disse brancher. Variablen viser også det samlede\nantal personer, der arbejder i området. Variablen er opdelt efter køn.\nStatistikken omfatter alle personer mellem 15 og 74 år, der er registreret i\nSverige den 31. december. Et stort antal personer, der arbejder i et område,\ner nødvendigt for at kunne opdele gruppen i de forskellige SNI-kategorier.\nSNI-kategorierne kan derfor kun rapporteres for et par delområder. Baseret på\nstatistik fra BAS (\"Arbejdsmarkedsstatus for befolkningen\"). Fra og med\nreferenceåret 2022 anvendes en ny datakilde, da SCB skifter datakilde til BAS\nfra den tidligere RAMS (\"Registerbaseret arbejdsmarkedsstatistik\"). Der er\nforskelle mellem, hvordan RAMS definerer erhvervsaktive, og hvordan BAS\ndefinerer beskæftigede. For eksempel klassificerer RAMS dem, der arbejder i\nDanmark, som ikke-erhvervsaktive, mens de i BAS tælles som beskæftigede under\nvisse omstændigheder. Der er derfor et tidsseriebrud for denne tidsserie\nstartende med data fra 2022. Ændringen af ​​kilde og metode betyder, at\nsammenligninger af statistikker vedrørende dagbefolkningen i 2022 og tidligere\nreferenceår skal foretages med stor forsigtighed. Læs mere på SCB.se.\n\n**Variabelbeskrivelse**  \nDu finder det\n[her](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**API'er**  \nVed at bruge API-kaldet\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics_\nkan du hente alle datasæt, der indeholder statistiske data for Malmøs områder,\ni JSON-format.  \nI hver forekomst af result/results i JSON-resultatet er der en \"id\"-egenskab\nfor hver ressource. Værdien af ​​\"id\" kan bruges til at hente dataene for den\nrespektive statistikvariabel (i henhold til værdien af ​​egenskaben \"name\").\nAPI-kald til at hente statistikdataene:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-\nværdi]_\n\nBrug gerne tallene, men angiv \"Bykontoret, Malmö Kommune\" som kilde.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Shows the industry in which the employed people working in the area work. The\ndivision follows the Standard for Swedish Industrial Classification (SNI)\n2007. The categories O (unknown), A (agriculture, hunting and forestry), B\n(extraction of materials), D (supply of electricity, gas, heating and\ncooling), E (water supply etc.), T (household production etc.) and U (activity\nat international organizations) have been merged into the category \"Other\" due\nto the low number of people working in these industries. The variable also\nshows the total number of people working in the area. The variable is divided\nby gender. The statistics include all individuals between 15 and 74 who are\nregistered in Sweden on 31 December. A large number of people working in an\narea are required to be able to break down the group into the different SNI\ncategories. The SNI categories can therefore only be reported for a few sub-\nareas. Based on statistics from BAS (\"Labour Market Status of the\nPopulation\"). Starting with the reference year 2022, a new data source is used\nas SCB switches data source to BAS from the previous RAMS (\"Register-based\nlabour market statistics\"). There are differences between how RAMS defines\ngainfully employed and how BAS defines employed. For example, RAMS classifies\nthose who work in Denmark as not gainfully employed, while in BAS they are\ncounted as employed under certain circumstances. There is therefore a time\nseries break for this time series starting with data from 2022. The change of\nsource and method means that comparisons of statistics regarding daytime\npopulation in 2022 and previous reference years must be made with great\ncaution. Read more at SCB.se.\n\n**Variable description**  \nYou find it\n[here](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**APIs**  \nUsing the API call\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics,_\nyou can retrieve all data sets that contain statistical data for Malmö's areas\nin JSON format.  \nIn each instance of result/results in the JSON result, there is an \"id\"\nproperty for each resource. The value of \"id\" can be used to retrieve the data\nfor the respective statistics variable (according to the value of the \"name\"\nproperty). API call to retrieve the statistics data:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id\nvalue]_\n\nFeel free to use the numbers, but cite “City Office, Malmö City” as the\nsource.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visar inom vilken industri de sysselsatta som arbetar inom området arbetar. Uppdelningen följer Standard för svensk näringsgrensindelning (SNI) 2007. Kategorierna O (okänd), A (jordbruk, jakt och skogsbruk), B (utvinning av material), D (försörjning av el, gas, värme och kyla), E (vattenförsörjning m.m.), T (hushållens produktion med mera) och U (verksamhet vid internationella organisationer) har slagits ihop till kategorin ”Övriga” på grund av det låga antalet arbetande i dessa industrier. Variabeln visar även totalt antalet som arbetar i området. Variabeln finns uppdelad på kön.  I statistiken ingår samtliga individer mellan 15 och 74 som är folkbokförda i Sverige den 31 december. Det krävs ett stort antal arbetande inom ett område för att kunna bryta ner gruppen i de olika SNI-kategorierna. SNI-kategorierna kan därför bara redovisas för ett fåtal delområden. Bygger på statistik från BAS (”Befolkningens Arbetsmarknadsstatus\"). Från och med referensår 2022 används en ny datakälla då SCB byter datakälla till BAS från tidigare RAMS (\"Registerbaserad arbetsmarknadsstatistik\"). Det finns skillnader mellan hur RAMS definierar förvärvsarbetande och hur BAS definierar sysselsatta. Till exempel klassar RAMS de som arbetar i Danmark som ej förvärvsarbetande medan de i BAS under vissa omständigheter räknas som sysselsatta. Det sker därför ett tidsseriebrott för denna tidsserie med start med data från 2022. Bytet av källa och metod innebär att jämförelser av statistik avseende dagbefolkning 2022 och tidigare referensår måste göras med stor försiktighet. Läs mer på SCB.se. \n\n__Variabelbeskrivning__  \nHittar du [här](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)!  \n                     \n__API__  \nMed hjälp av API-anropet *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistik* får man i JSON-format fram samtliga datamängder som innehåller statistikunderlag för Malmös områden.  \nI varje instans av result/results i JSON-resultatet finns för varje resurs en egenskap \"id\". Värdet för \"id\" kan användas för att hämta datan för respektive statistikvariabel (enligt värdet för egenskapen \"name\").\nAPI-anrop för att hämta statistikdatan: *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-värdet]*   \n\nAnvänd gärna siffrorna, men ange “Stadskontoret, Malmö stad” som källa."}],"dct:identifier":"7cf0a6b3-c884-4ccd-b7ef-671764fc3cd1","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-16"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:03:53.212847"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:355ccada1530fddfae9a956ba6b49cfc7b358b7879e2fa14a2110b074b64dcd3_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Dagbefolkning (antal arbejdspladser) ifølge SNI 2007, 2022- - Statistiske data for Malmøs områder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Daytime population (number of workplaces) according to SNI 2007, 2022- - Statistical data for Malmö's areas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dagbefolkning (antal arbetsplatser) efter SNI 2007, 2022- - Statistikunderlag för Malmös områden"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/7cf0a6b3-c884-4ccd-b7ef-671764fc3cd1/resource/72351097-a3fc-4169-847a-b416c6482766","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/7cf0a6b3-c884-4ccd-b7ef-671764fc3cd1/resource/72351097-a3fc-4169-847a-b416c6482766/download/dagbefolkning-antal-arbetsplatser-efter-sni-2007-2022-.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"2897539"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø-statistik - Dagbefolkning (antal arbejdspladser) efter SNI 2007, 2022-\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Daytime population (number of workplaces) by SNI 2007,\n2022-\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Dagbefolkning (antal arbetsplatser) efter SNI 2007, 2022-"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2024-08-22T07:55:53.609646"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:03:53.234604"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Dagbefolkning (antal arbejdspladser) efter SNI 2007, 2022-"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Daytime population (number of workplaces) by SNI 2007, 2022-"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dagbefolkning (antal arbetsplatser) efter SNI 2007, 2022-"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:355ccada1530fddfae9a956ba6b49cfc7b358b7879e2fa14a2110b074b64dcd3_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/7cf0a6b3-c884-4ccd-b7ef-671764fc3cd1/resource/85c06917-68eb-4b5d-a23d-e7d681c5a022","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/action/datastore_search?resource_id=72351097-a3fc-4169-847a-b416c6482766"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø-statistik - Dagbefolkning (antal arbejdspladser) efter SNI 2007, 2022-\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Daytime population (number of workplaces) by SNI 2007,\n2022-\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Dagbefolkning (antal arbetsplatser) efter SNI 2007, 2022-"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2024-08-22T07:55:54.632071"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-01T11:09:35.305345"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Dagbefolkning (antal arbejdspladser) efter SNI 2007, 2022-"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Daytime population (number of workplaces) by SNI 2007, 2022-"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dagbefolkning (antal arbetsplatser) efter SNI 2007, 2022-"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:355ccada1530fddfae9a956ba6b49cfc7b358b7879e2fa14a2110b074b64dcd3"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:36ca494e764b1287f501722384409f953a423d13c6d6236f2c516009ba7de8ca_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"93953092110436955369cb652d07a603"},{"@id":"_:36ca494e764b1287f501722384409f953a423d13c6d6236f2c516009ba7de8ca_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/abd7da407bcfbc956fd6c0e91189412f","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Fastighets- och gatukontoret","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:gis.fgk@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/198f6c06-9ff9-4a81-8efe-edc9ded7c2cc","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/abd7da407bcfbc956fd6c0e91189412f"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/198f6c06-9ff9-4a81-8efe-edc9ded7c2cc/resource/cffa4c12-4fda-4b63-babc-5892d3c57b9b"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","Skånetrafiken","geodata","gis","karta","map","väghållning"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/WEEKLY"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"**Offentlige transportruter i Malmø by**  \nDatasættet omfatter Torups rekreative område¹ og bruges af Ejendoms- og\nVejkontoret som grundlag for prioriteret vejvedligeholdelse.  \nDataene indeholder delmængder af linjepositioner, der ligger inden for de ydre\ngrænser af Malmø by og Torup rekreationsområde.\n\n**Attribut**\n\n`service_type` [servicetype]  \n`service_name_short` [kort navn på tjeneste, f.eks. et linjenummer]  \n`service_name_long` [langt navn på ruten, f.eks. startsted - stop -\nslutdestination]  \n`service_id` [unikt id for tjenesten]  \n`direction` [0 eller 1 (rund eller retur)]  \n`distance` [samlet tilbagelagt afstand af tjenesten i meter]  \n`date_processed` [dato for sidste behandling af Malmø by²]\n\n**Geometri**  \nType: MultiLineString  \nCRS: WGS84\n\n¹ I 1970 købte Malmø Kommune Torup-godsområdet for at sikre adgang til dette\nfriluftsområde. Området har været et naturreservat siden 2019. Malmø Kommunes\nEjendoms- og Vejkontor har aktiviteter, der arbejder med vedligeholdelse af\nbygninger, jord og organisering af arrangementer i Torup.  \n² Behandlede åbne data fra Samtrafiken/Trafiklab (trafiklab.se) er blevet\nbrugt til at producere dette datasæt.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"**Public transport routes in Malmö city**  \nThe data set includes Torup's recreation area¹ and is used by the Property and\nStreet Office as a basis for prioritized road maintenance.  \nThe data contains the subsets of the line positions that lie within the outer\nboundaries of the city of Malmö and the Torup recreation area.\n\n**Attribute**\n\n`service_type` [service type]  \n`service_name_short` [short name of service, e.g. a line number]  \n`service_name_long` [long name of service, e.g. starting point - stop - final\ndestination]  \n`service_id` [unique id for the service]  \n`direction` [0 or 1 (round or return)]  \n`distance` [total distance traveled by the service in meters]  \n`date_processed` [date of last processing of Malmö city²]\n\n**Geometry**  \nType: MultiLineString  \nCRS: WGS84\n\n¹ In 1970, the City of Malmö purchased the Torup estate area to ensure access\nto this outdoor recreation area. The area has been a nature reserve since\n2019. The Property and Street Office of the City of Malmö has operations that\nwork with maintaining buildings, land and organizing events in Torup.  \n² Processed open data from Samtrafiken/Trafiklab (trafiklab.se) has been used\nto produce this dataset.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"__Kollektivtrafiklinjesträckningar i Malmö stad__   \nDatamängden innefattar Torups rekreationsområde¹ och används av Fastighets- och gatukontoret som underlag för prioriterad väghållning.  \nDatan innehåller de delmängder av linjesträckningarnas positioner som ligger inom Malmö stads och Torups rekreationsområdes yttre avgränsningar.  \n  \n__Attribut__   \n  \n`service_type` [servicetyp]  \n`service_name_short` [kort namn på service, t ex ett linjenummer]  \n`service_name_long` [långt namn på service, t ex startpunkt - stopp - slutdestination]  \n`service_id` [unikt id för servicen]  \n`direction` [0 eller 1 (tur eller retur)]  \n`distance` [servicens totala färdsträcka i meter]  \n`date_processed` [datum för senaste bearbetning av Malmö stad²]  \n  \n__Geometri__  \nTyp: MultiLineString  \nCRS: WGS84  \n  \n¹ År 1970 köpte Malmö stad området Torups gods, för att säkerställa tillgången till detta frilufts- och rekreationsområde. Området är naturreservat sedan år 2019. Fastighets- och gatukontoret i Malmö stad har verksamheter som arbetar med att underhålla byggnader, mark och att anordna evenemang i Torup.  \n² Bearbetad öppen data från Samtrafiken/Trafiklab (trafiklab.se) har använts för att producera denna datamängd."}],"dct:identifier":"198f6c06-9ff9-4a81-8efe-edc9ded7c2cc","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-08-14"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-12T02:00:48.931639"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:source":{"@id":"https://www.trafiklab.se/api/gtfs-datasets/gtfs-regional/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:36ca494e764b1287f501722384409f953a423d13c6d6236f2c516009ba7de8ca_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Offentlig transport i Malmø by"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Public transport in Malmö city"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kollektivtrafik i Malmö stad"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/198f6c06-9ff9-4a81-8efe-edc9ded7c2cc/resource/cffa4c12-4fda-4b63-babc-5892d3c57b9b","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/198f6c06-9ff9-4a81-8efe-edc9ded7c2cc/resource/cffa4c12-4fda-4b63-babc-5892d3c57b9b/download/malmolinjer.geojson"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"1964524"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Offentlig transport i Malmø by\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Public transport in Malmö city\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kollektivtrafik i Malmö stad"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/GEOJSON"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2024-08-14T11:26:19.049548"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-12T02:00:45.388761"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Offentlig transport i Malmø by"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Public transport in Malmö city"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kollektivtrafik i Malmö stad"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:36ca494e764b1287f501722384409f953a423d13c6d6236f2c516009ba7de8ca_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:36ca494e764b1287f501722384409f953a423d13c6d6236f2c516009ba7de8ca"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:387373cd6c5922dede3a1a213edb356e9cae6cdb4d4db7e0ccb0e11542aab9ca_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/86b521fe-6371-4dfa-8b1c-f4b4cbdbe943","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/86b521fe-6371-4dfa-8b1c-f4b4cbdbe943/resource/218e71d6-881a-48a9-9224-89e86fd04cfc"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ECON"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Beskriver kommunens betalingsevne på kort sigt; ved en værdi på 100 kan den\nlige akkurat opfylde sine kortsigtede økonomiske forpligtelser.\n\nOmsætningsaktiver minus lager, lager og driftsaktiver divideret med\nkortfristede forpligtelser.\n\nStatistik i procenter fra 1998.\n\nKilde: Statistiska Centralbyrån.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Describes the municipality's ability to pay in the short term; at a value of\n100, it can just about meet its short-term financial obligations.\n\nCurrent assets minus inventory, warehouse and operating assets divided by\ncurrent liabilities.\n\nStatistics in percentages from 1998.\n\nSource: Statistics Sweden.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Beskriver kommunens betalningsförmåga på kort sikt, vid värdet 100 klarar man precis sina kortfristiga ekonomiska åtaganden. \n\nOmsättningstillgångarna minus förråds-, lager- och exploateringstillgångar dividerade med kortfristiga skulder. \n\nStatistik i procent från 1998.\n\nKälla: SCB."}],"dct:identifier":"86b521fe-6371-4dfa-8b1c-f4b4cbdbe943","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-15"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:41:18.841592"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:387373cd6c5922dede3a1a213edb356e9cae6cdb4d4db7e0ccb0e11542aab9ca_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Kommunens likviditet"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Cash liquidity of the municipality"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kassalikviditet kommunen"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/86b521fe-6371-4dfa-8b1c-f4b4cbdbe943/resource/218e71d6-881a-48a9-9224-89e86fd04cfc","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N03105"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Omsætningsaktiver minus lagerbeholdning, lagerbeholdning og udviklingsaktiver\ndivideret med kortfristede forpligtelser. Beskriver kommunens betalingsevne på\nkort sigt; ved en værdi på 100 er kommunen i stand til at opfylde sine\nkortfristede økonomiske forpligtelser. Kilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Current assets minus inventory, warehouse and development assets divided by\ncurrent liabilities. Describes the municipality's ability to pay in the short\nterm; at a value of 100, the municipality is able to meet its short-term\nfinancial obligations. Source: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Omsättningstillgångarna minus förråds-, lager- och exploateringstillgångar dividerade med kortfristiga skulder. Beskriver kommunens betalningsförmåga på kort sikt, vid värdet 100 klarar man precis sina kortfristiga ekonomiska åtaganden. Källa: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-07-08T06:30:38.965434"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:41:18.846374"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Kommunens likviditet (%) (N03105)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Cash liquidity of the municipality, (%) (N03105)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kassalikviditet kommunen, (%) (N03105)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:387373cd6c5922dede3a1a213edb356e9cae6cdb4d4db7e0ccb0e11542aab9ca"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:3999dc3da170faee1c993aceadfdff41281ecd4251bbf77996608fac2f7fe366_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"d383bf2b7fbb6ced69b0a0f05fb0e155"},{"@id":"_:3999dc3da170faee1c993aceadfdff41281ecd4251bbf77996608fac2f7fe366_b1n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"d383bf2b7fbb6ced69b0a0f05fb0e155"},{"@id":"_:3999dc3da170faee1c993aceadfdff41281ecd4251bbf77996608fac2f7fe366_b2n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"81923e9b2f95b77b160be3e29420e779"},{"@id":"_:3999dc3da170faee1c993aceadfdff41281ecd4251bbf77996608fac2f7fe366_b3n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/590e717ed624870c5e5af379a019ac72","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"GIS-enheten, Stadsbyggnadskontoret, Malmö stad","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:sbk.geodata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/276d8ab5-18f6-4cf6-8d16-c947781388cc","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/590e717ed624870c5e5af379a019ac72"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/276d8ab5-18f6-4cf6-8d16-c947781388cc/resource/3552b9ca-5d43-41cd-987f-c23b739101c0"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/276d8ab5-18f6-4cf6-8d16-c947781388cc/resource/368b0a2b-c6e5-4f86-81f4-48ebbf4a9301"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/276d8ab5-18f6-4cf6-8d16-c947781388cc/resource/696b53d8-9d3c-4218-9253-a545f20bfecf"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/276d8ab5-18f6-4cf6-8d16-c947781388cc/resource/a2d1274d-ed1b-4211-b950-322d98eabbf4"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/276d8ab5-18f6-4cf6-8d16-c947781388cc/resource/cb293f0c-72b5-4b17-a70a-1bb0b8671fff"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/276d8ab5-18f6-4cf6-8d16-c947781388cc/resource/dd24a7b9-109b-449a-8aa0-cb52c758fdab"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/276d8ab5-18f6-4cf6-8d16-c947781388cc/resource/eb390606-f546-44fc-82c3-f04836c74e91"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/276d8ab5-18f6-4cf6-8d16-c947781388cc/resource/ff193dfb-fecb-49ba-bf93-efaef663e966"}],"dcat:keyword":["Administrativ indelning","GIS","Geodata","Karta","Malmö stad","Map","Stadsområde","stadsområden"],"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/NEVER"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Kortlag, der viser byområder i Malmø Kommune. Byområder var en politisk\nbesluttet opdeling baseret på det geografiske virkeområde for\nbyområdeforvaltningerne i byen. Opdelingen var gyldig fra 2013 til 2017. For\nden nuværende geografiske opdeling af byen henvises til delområder. Kortlaget\ner ikke opdateret. Sidst opdateret: september 2020. Polygonlag\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Map layer showing urban areas in Malmö Municipality. Urban areas were a\npolitically decided division based on the geographical area of ​​operation of\nthe urban area administrations in the city. The division was valid from 2013\nto 2017. For the current geographical division of the city, reference is made\nto sub-areas. The map layer is not updated. Last update: September 2020.\nPolygon layer\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kartlager som visar stadsområden i Malmö kommun. Stadsområden var en politiskt beslutad indelning baserad på stadsområdesförvaltningarnas\ngeografiska verksamhetsområde i staden. Indelningen gällde 2013 - 2017. För gällande geografisk indelning av staden hänvisas till delområden.\nKartlagret uppdateras inte. Senaste uppdatering: september 2020.\nPolygonlager"}],"dct:identifier":"276d8ab5-18f6-4cf6-8d16-c947781388cc","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-04-27"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-09-04T08:03:53.586882"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:3999dc3da170faee1c993aceadfdff41281ecd4251bbf77996608fac2f7fe366_b3n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Byområder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Urban areas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stadsområden"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/276d8ab5-18f6-4cf6-8d16-c947781388cc/resource/3552b9ca-5d43-41cd-987f-c23b739101c0","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/276d8ab5-18f6-4cf6-8d16-c947781388cc/resource/3552b9ca-5d43-41cd-987f-c23b739101c0/download/stadsomraden_4326.gpkg"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"172032"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Koordinatsystem EPSG:4326 / WGS84\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Coordinate system EPSG:4326 / WGS84\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Koordinatsystem EPSG:4326 / WGS84"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-28T12:32:29.753398"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-07-01T06:50:27.148896"},"dc