  \n  \nKälla: SCB (via Kolada)"}],"dct:identifier":"a82c0b8a-3d17-4b80-ac00-6f6911cc7696","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-07"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:46:53.334918"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:43c48732c995858bc4c004fbc61e406d869514705032f459a1f2a10c0b4241ec_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Median bruttoindkomst for kommunens valgte politikere, SEK/person"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Median gross income of the municipality's elected politicians, SEK/person"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Medianbruttoinkomst kommunens förtroendevalda politiker, kr/person"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/a82c0b8a-3d17-4b80-ac00-6f6911cc7696/resource/82816af4-1170-4519-bfed-08ae2d427d45","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N05827"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Median bruttoindkomst eksklusive kapitalindkomst blandt valgte politikere i\nkommunen. Henviser til personer på 20 år eller ældre.\n\nKilde: Sveriges Statistik (via Kolada)\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Median gross income excluding capital income among elected politicians in the\nmunicipality. Refers to people 20 years of age or older.\n\nSource: Statistics Sweden (via Kolada)\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Medianbruttoinkomst exkl kapitalinkomst bland förtroendevalda politiker i kommunen. Avser personer 20 år eller äldre.  \n  \nKälla: SCB (via Kolada)"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-12-07T09:18:15.831770"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:46:53.340160"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Median bruttoindkomst for kommunens valgte politikere, SEK/person"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Median gross income of the municipality's elected politicians, SEK/person"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Medianbruttoinkomst kommunens förtroendevalda politiker, kr/person"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:43c48732c995858bc4c004fbc61e406d869514705032f459a1f2a10c0b4241ec"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:459cba445887e90b38b3ceb7827c8182d1810c5eb67db6fad23b1aaf3c34fa49_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"975629dc1e821b5548716092c18e3b03"},{"@id":"_:459cba445887e90b38b3ceb7827c8182d1810c5eb67db6fad23b1aaf3c34fa49_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Karl McShane","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:karl.mcshane@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/f0785d20-0993-47c3-a76e-a8fec8e742cb","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/f0785d20-0993-47c3-a76e-a8fec8e742cb/resource/bbe0afe6-6d3c-4a0e-96f7-43ec503d887c"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/f0785d20-0993-47c3-a76e-a8fec8e742cb/resource/f5baec6d-748e-4d92-976f-d9fbd62743ad"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Viser enten et gennemsnit eller en median af den årlige indkomst for beboere i\nområdet. Består af indkomst fra beskæftigelse og indkomst fra\nerhvervsaktiviteter. Tallene viser bruttoindkomst. Ud over lønindkomst\nomfatter indkomst fra beskæftigelse også indkomst fra pensioner, sygedagpenge\nog andre skattepligtige ydelser. Fra og med data for 2020 er indkomst fra\narbejde og pensioner fra andre nordiske lande inkluderet i statistikken. Dette\ngør sammenligninger tilbage i tiden misvisende, da indkomst fra dem, der\npendler til Danmark, tidligere ikke var inkluderet i statistikken. Tallene er\nvist i løbende priser, hvilket betyder, at de ikke er inflationsjusterede.\nVist for gruppen af ​​erhvervsaktive 20-64 år. Variablen er opdelt efter køn.\nData fra Indkomst- og Skatteregisteret (IoT).\n\n**Variabelbeskrivelse**  \nDu finder det\n[her](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**API'er**  \nVed at bruge API-kaldet\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics_\nkan du hente alle datasæt, der indeholder statistiske data for Malmøs områder,\ni JSON-format.  \nI hver forekomst af result/results i JSON-resultatet er der en \"id\"-egenskab\nfor hver ressource. Værdien af ​​\"id\" kan bruges til at hente dataene for den\nrespektive statistikvariabel (i henhold til værdien af ​​egenskaben \"name\").\nAPI-kald til at hente statistikdataene:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-\nværdi]_\n\nBrug gerne tallene, men angiv \"Bykontoret, Malmö Kommune\" som kilde.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Shows either an average or median of the annual income for residents in the\narea. Consists of income from employment and income from business activities.\nThe figures show gross income. In addition to salary income, income from\nemployment also includes income from pensions, sickness benefits and other\ntaxable benefits. As of data for 2020, income from work and pensions from\nother Nordic countries are included in the statistics. This makes comparisons\nback in time misleading as income from those who commute to Denmark was\npreviously not included in the statistics. The figures are shown in current\nprices, which means that they are not inflation-adjusted. Shown for the group\nof gainfully employed 20–64. The variable is broken down by gender. Data from\nthe Income and Tax Register (IoT).\n\n**Variable description**  \nYou find it\n[here](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**APIs**  \nUsing the API call\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics,_\nyou can retrieve all data sets that contain statistical data for Malmö's areas\nin JSON format.  \nIn each instance of result/results in the JSON result, there is an \"id\"\nproperty for each resource. The value of \"id\" can be used to retrieve the data\nfor the respective statistics variable (according to the value of the \"name\"\nproperty). API call to retrieve the statistics data:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id\nvalue]_\n\nFeel free to use the numbers, but cite “City Office, Malmö City” as the\nsource.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visar antingen som ett genomsnitt eller median av årsinkomsten för boende i området. Består av inkomst av tjänst och inkomst av näringsverksamhet. Siffrorna visar bruttoinkomst. I inkomst av tjänst ingår förutom löneinkomst även inkomst från pension, sjukpenning och andra skattepliktiga ersättningar. Från och med data för 2020 ingår inkomster från arbete och pension från övriga nordiska länder i statistiken. Detta gör att jämförelser bakåt i tiden blir missvisande då inkomster från de som arbetspendlar till Danmark tidigare inte ingått i statistiken. Siffrorna visas i löpande priser vilket betyder att de inte är inflationsjusterade. Visas för gruppen förvärvsarbetande 20–64. Variabeln finns uppdelad på kön. Data från Inkomst- och taxeringsregistret (IoT).\n\n__Variabelbeskrivning__  \nHittar du [här](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)!  \n                     \n__API__  \nMed hjälp av API-anropet *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistik* får man i JSON-format fram samtliga datamängder som innehåller statistikunderlag för Malmös områden.  \nI varje instans av result/results i JSON-resultatet finns för varje resurs en egenskap \"id\". Värdet för \"id\" kan användas för att hämta datan för respektive statistikvariabel (enligt värdet för egenskapen \"name\").\nAPI-anrop för att hämta statistikdatan: *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-värdet]*   \n\nAnvänd gärna siffrorna, men ange “Stadskontoret, Malmö stad” som källa."}],"dct:identifier":"f0785d20-0993-47c3-a76e-a8fec8e742cb","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-16"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:05:58.501822"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:459cba445887e90b38b3ceb7827c8182d1810c5eb67db6fad23b1aaf3c34fa49_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Arbejdsindkomst blandt erhvervsaktive 2020-2021 - Statistiske data for Malmøs områder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Earned income among gainfully employed people 2020-2021 - Statistical data for Malmö's areas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förvärvsinkomst bland förvärvsarbetande 2020-2021 - Statistikunderlag för Malmös områden"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/f0785d20-0993-47c3-a76e-a8fec8e742cb/resource/bbe0afe6-6d3c-4a0e-96f7-43ec503d887c","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/action/datastore_search?resource_id=f5baec6d-748e-4d92-976f-d9fbd62743ad"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmö-statistik - Arbejdsindkomst blandt erhvervsaktive 2020-2021\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Earned income among gainfully employed people 2020-2021\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Förvärvsinkomst bland förvärvsarbetande 2020-2021"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2024-08-22T07:56:35.357508"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-01T11:11:37.552073"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Arbejdsindkomst blandt erhvervsaktive 2020-2021"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Earned income among gainfully employed people 2020-2021"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förvärvsinkomst bland förvärvsarbetande 2020-2021"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/f0785d20-0993-47c3-a76e-a8fec8e742cb/resource/f5baec6d-748e-4d92-976f-d9fbd62743ad","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/f0785d20-0993-47c3-a76e-a8fec8e742cb/resource/f5baec6d-748e-4d92-976f-d9fbd62743ad/download/forvarvsinkomst-bland-forvarvsarbetande-2020-2021.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"113029"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmö-statistik - Arbejdsindkomst blandt erhvervsaktive 2020-2021\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Earned income among gainfully employed people 2020-2021\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Förvärvsinkomst bland förvärvsarbetande 2020-2021"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2024-08-22T07:56:34.449629"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:05:58.507721"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Arbejdsindkomst blandt erhvervsaktive 2020-2021"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Earned income among gainfully employed people 2020-2021"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förvärvsinkomst bland förvärvsarbetande 2020-2021"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:459cba445887e90b38b3ceb7827c8182d1810c5eb67db6fad23b1aaf3c34fa49_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:459cba445887e90b38b3ceb7827c8182d1810c5eb67db6fad23b1aaf3c34fa49"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:465ea286e779db5a56dc8efd270e1bfbe065f9332bc894389f196e1e843a6a05_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"d688a658bf37665abd06f538058d4b7627371cfc"},{"@id":"_:465ea286e779db5a56dc8efd270e1bfbe065f9332bc894389f196e1e843a6a05_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"_:465ea286e779db5a56dc8efd270e1bfbe065f9332bc894389f196e1e843a6a05_b2n0","@type":"dct:PeriodOfTime","dcat:startDate":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-02-29"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/1d4cc711-9d56-48a7-a263-7c028ca72841","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/1d4cc711-9d56-48a7-a263-7c028ca72841/resource/0394086d-979c-49c8-ae3a-1052461e4096"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","samverkan"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/GOVE"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/IRREG"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Der er tekniske krav, der skal tages i betragtning ved publicering af åbne\ndata, samt spørgsmål som ejerskab, kvalitetssikring og informationssikkerhed.  \nDet er et bredt område, hvor mange færdigheder kan være nødvendige at inddrage\ni arbejdet. For at understøtte arbejdet anvender Malmø Kommune en\npubliceringsproces, som er udviklet ud fra DIGG's anbefalinger tilpasset Malmø\nKommunes forhold.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"There are technical requirements to consider when publishing open data, as\nwell as issues such as ownership, quality assurance, and information security.  \nIt is a broad area where many skills may need to be involved in the work. To\nsupport the work, the City of Malmö uses a publishing process, which has been\ndeveloped based on DIGG's recommendations adapted to the conditions of the\nCity of Malmö.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Det finns tekniska förutsättningar att ta hänsyn till vid publiceringen av öppna data, samt frågor kring exempelvis ägandeskap, kvalitetssäkring, och informationssäkerhet.  \nDet är ett brett område där många kompetenser kan behöva medverka i arbetet. För att stötta arbetet använder Malmö stad en publiceringsprocess, som har tagits fram med utgångspunkt från DIGGs rekommendationer anpassade till Malmö stads förutsättningar."}],"dct:identifier":"1d4cc711-9d56-48a7-a263-7c028ca72841","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-02-29"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-09T12:56:00.470986"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:relation":{"@id":"https://www.digg.se/kunskap-och-stod/oppna-och-delade-data/offentliga-aktorer/vagledning-for-att-tillgangliggora-information"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:465ea286e779db5a56dc8efd270e1bfbe065f9332bc894389f196e1e843a6a05_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:465ea286e779db5a56dc8efd270e1bfbe065f9332bc894389f196e1e843a6a05_b2n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Åbne data - Udgivelsesproces"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Open Data - Publishing Process"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Öppna data - Publiceringsprocess"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/1d4cc711-9d56-48a7-a263-7c028ca72841/resource/0394086d-979c-49c8-ae3a-1052461e4096","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/1d4cc711-9d56-48a7-a263-7c028ca72841/resource/0394086d-979c-49c8-ae3a-1052461e4096/download/publiceringsprocess-oppna-data-3.2.pdf"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"911297"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"-\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"-\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"-"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/PDF"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2024-02-22T10:03:41.448337"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-03-18T21:48:59.458696"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Procedure for publicering af åbne data"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Open data publishing process"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Publiceringsprocess för öppna data"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:465ea286e779db5a56dc8efd270e1bfbe065f9332bc894389f196e1e843a6a05_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:465ea286e779db5a56dc8efd270e1bfbe065f9332bc894389f196e1e843a6a05"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:4bda1abd91d45b4e5ccf08e21d7126e1a55de67c8485b6788ad5e2af123f6d5d_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/32c20cd4-357b-4bbc-b92c-c2886f930282","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/32c20cd4-357b-4bbc-b92c-c2886f930282/resource/592fc90c-c0c5-46f3-9304-e3574610c2ad"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/EDUC"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Alle data refererer til elever i skoler med karakterer i henhold til det mål-\nog vidensrelaterede karaktersystem.\n\nStatistik i procenter fra 2013.\n\nBegrebet \"lokationskommune\" henviser til elever i både kommunale og friskoler\nbeliggende i kommunen, uanset hvor de er indskrevet.\n\nKilde: Den svenske statslige skolestyrelse (Siris).\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"All data refers to students in schools with grades according to the goal- and\nknowledge-related grading system.\n\nStatistics in percentages from 2013.\n\nThe term \"location municipality\" refers to students in both municipal and\nindependent schools located in the municipality, regardless of where they are\nregistered.\n\nSource: Swedish National Agency for Education (Siris).\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samtliga uppgifter avser elever i skolor med betyg enligt det mål- och kunskapsrelaterade betygssystemet. \n\nStatistik i procent från 2013.\n\nMed lägeskommun avses elever i både kommunala och fristående skolor belägna i kommunen oavsett var de är folkbokförda. \n\nKälla: Skolverket (Siris)."}],"dct:identifier":"32c20cd4-357b-4bbc-b92c-c2886f930282","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-15"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:04:29.419159"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:4bda1abd91d45b4e5ccf08e21d7126e1a55de67c8485b6788ad5e2af123f6d5d_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elever i 9. klasse med minimum karakteren E i svensk, lokal kommune"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Students in grade 9 with a minimum grade of E in Swedish, local municipality"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elever i årskurs 9 med lägst betyget E  i svenska, lägeskommun"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/32c20cd4-357b-4bbc-b92c-c2886f930282/resource/592fc90c-c0c5-46f3-9304-e3574610c2ad","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N15498"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Alle data refererer til elever i skoler med karakterer i henhold til det mål-\nog vidensrelaterede karaktersystem. Elever i 9. klasse med minimumskarakteren\nE i svensk, placeringskommune, procentdel (%). Placeringskommune refererer til\nelever i både kommunale og friskoler beliggende i kommunen, uanset hvor de er\nindskrevet. Kilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"All data refers to students in schools with grades according to the goal- and\nknowledge-related grading system. Students in year 9 with a minimum grade of E\nin Swedish, location municipality, percentage (%). Location municipality\nrefers to students in both municipal and independent schools located in the\nmunicipality regardless of where they are registered. Source: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samtliga uppgifter avser elever i skolor med betyg enligt det mål- och kunskapsrelaterade betygssystemet. Elever i åk 9 med lägst betyget E  i svenska, lägeskommun, andel (%). Med lägeskommun avses elever i både kommunala och fristående skolor belägna i kommunen oavsett var de är folkbokförda. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-12T12:56:29.133100"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:04:29.423814"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elever i 9. klasse med mindst karakteren E i svensk, kommune, procentdel (%) (N15498)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Students in year 9 with a minimum grade of E in Swedish, municipality of location, percentage (%) (N15498)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elever i åk 9 med lägst betyget E  i svenska, lägeskommun, andel (%) (N15498)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:4bda1abd91d45b4e5ccf08e21d7126e1a55de67c8485b6788ad5e2af123f6d5d"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:4c46f5d26cd41f3e6b00fadb9e63a2f92f2baaf4be261bcaee012a27dccc1c16_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"5fe73d0acd406eff4514714c2d7fb05f"},{"@id":"_:4c46f5d26cd41f3e6b00fadb9e63a2f92f2baaf4be261bcaee012a27dccc1c16_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Karl McShane","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:karl.mcshane@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/ba8a9ad3-16cd-47f6-86c9-67e45743e9da","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/ba8a9ad3-16cd-47f6-86c9-67e45743e9da/resource/45f4bfe6-f55e-4b26-b439-419154521d98"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/ba8a9ad3-16cd-47f6-86c9-67e45743e9da/resource/fcebee4b-0715-4881-95bc-cfce7fa46920"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Viser antallet af indbyggere opdelt i forskellige aldersgrupper.\nAldersgrupperne er 0 - 5 år, 6 - 15 år (folkeskolealder), 16 - 19 år\n(gymnasiealder), 20 - 64 år (erhvervsaktiv alder), 65 - 79 år og 80+ år.\nVariablen er opdelt efter køn. Data fra Befolkningsregisteret (RTB).\n\n**Variabelbeskrivelse**  \nDu finder det\n[her](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**API'er**  \nVed at bruge API-kaldet\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics_\nkan du hente alle datasæt, der indeholder statistiske data for Malmøs områder,\ni JSON-format.  \nI hver forekomst af result/results i JSON-resultatet er der en \"id\"-egenskab\nfor hver ressource. Værdien af ​​\"id\" kan bruges til at hente dataene for den\nrespektive statistikvariabel (i henhold til værdien af ​​egenskaben \"name\").\nAPI-kald til at hente statistikdataene:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-\nværdi]_\n\nBrug gerne tallene, men angiv \"Bykontoret, Malmö Kommune\" som kilde.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Shows the number of inhabitants divided into different age groups. The age\ngroups are 0 - 5 years, 6 - 15 years (primary school age), 16 - 19 years\n(upper secondary school age), 20 - 64 years (working age), 65 - 79 years and\n80+ years. The variable is divided by gender. Data from the Register of Total\nPopulation (RTB).\n\n**Variable description**  \nYou find it\n[here](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**APIs**  \nUsing the API call\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics,_\nyou can retrieve all data sets that contain statistical data for Malmö's areas\nin JSON format.  \nIn each instance of result/results in the JSON result, there is an \"id\"\nproperty for each resource. The value of \"id\" can be used to retrieve the data\nfor the respective statistics variable (according to the value of the \"name\"\nproperty). API call to retrieve the statistics data:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id\nvalue]_\n\nFeel free to use the numbers, but cite “City Office, Malmö City” as the\nsource.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visar antalet invånare uppdelat på olika åldersklasser. Åldersklasserna är 0 - 5 år, 6 - 15 år (grundskoleåldern), 16 - 19 år (gymnasieålder), 20 - 64 år (arbetsför ålder), 65 - 79 år och 80+ år.\nVariabeln finns uppdelad på kön. Data från Registret över Totalbefolkningen (RTB).\n\n__Variabelbeskrivning__  \nHittar du [här](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)!  \n                     \n__API__  \nMed hjälp av API-anropet *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistik* får man i JSON-format fram samtliga datamängder som innehåller statistikunderlag för Malmös områden.  \nI varje instans av result/results i JSON-resultatet finns för varje resurs en egenskap \"id\". Värdet för \"id\" kan användas för att hämta datan för respektive statistikvariabel (enligt värdet för egenskapen \"name\").\nAPI-anrop för att hämta statistikdatan: *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-värdet]*   \n\nAnvänd gärna siffrorna, men ange “Stadskontoret, Malmö stad” som källa."}],"dct:identifier":"ba8a9ad3-16cd-47f6-86c9-67e45743e9da","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-16"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:01:58.635799"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:4c46f5d26cd41f3e6b00fadb9e63a2f92f2baaf4be261bcaee012a27dccc1c16_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Alder og køn - Statistiske data for Malmøs områder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Age and gender - Statistical data for Malmö's areas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ålder och kön - Statistikunderlag för Malmös områden"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/ba8a9ad3-16cd-47f6-86c9-67e45743e9da/resource/45f4bfe6-f55e-4b26-b439-419154521d98","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=fcebee4b-0715-4881-95bc-cfce7fa46920"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø statistik - Alder og køn\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Age and gender\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Ålder och kön"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:13:48.727445"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:14:09.280065"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Alder og køn"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Age and gender"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ålder och kön"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/ba8a9ad3-16cd-47f6-86c9-67e45743e9da/resource/fcebee4b-0715-4881-95bc-cfce7fa46920","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/ba8a9ad3-16cd-47f6-86c9-67e45743e9da/resource/fcebee4b-0715-4881-95bc-cfce7fa46920/download/alder-och-kon.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"4619741"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø statistik - Alder og køn\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Age and gender\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Ålder och kön"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:13:43.519111"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:01:58.642694"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Alder og køn"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Age and gender"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ålder och kön"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:4c46f5d26cd41f3e6b00fadb9e63a2f92f2baaf4be261bcaee012a27dccc1c16_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:4c46f5d26cd41f3e6b00fadb9e63a2f92f2baaf4be261bcaee012a27dccc1c16"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:4c52f964bb1ae6ea3f61badd50cd5fc9a11ea90b11271f34cb5b46e5328eee6c_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"b980ddc67a66c259bfddbcf7c1cc7291"},{"@id":"_:4c52f964bb1ae6ea3f61badd50cd5fc9a11ea90b11271f34cb5b46e5328eee6c_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"_:4c52f964bb1ae6ea3f61badd50cd5fc9a11ea90b11271f34cb5b46e5328eee6c_b2n0","@type":"dct:PeriodOfTime","dcat:startDate":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"1967-01-01"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/abd7da407bcfbc956fd6c0e91189412f","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Fastighets- och gatukontoret","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:gis.fgk@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/c99dca2d-1e68-41bb-972e-04a5a1d5aeaa","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/abd7da407bcfbc956fd6c0e91189412f"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/c99dca2d-1e68-41bb-972e-04a5a1d5aeaa/resource/c2ec6145-fefd-4d49-a909-48a3e09a080b"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/c99dca2d-1e68-41bb-972e-04a5a1d5aeaa/resource/d8429eab-38c4-42f7-975f-4d0967f48a5c"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","geodata","gis","karta","map","trafik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"**Biltrafikken flyder i Malmø**  \nFormålet med denne rapport er at rapportere den aktuelle trafikmængde på\nMalmøs gader. Samtidig skal ændringer over tid være tydeligt synlige i\nrapporten. Data om trafikmængder er blevet indsamlet af Malmø Kommune siden\n1967.\n\nDet er vigtigt at huske på, at der er faktorer, der kan påvirke\nmåleresultaterne, når man studerer trafikstrømme (f.eks. vejarbejder, flytning\naf lokale busser, større ombygninger, hastighedsændringer og indførelse af\ntrafikdæmpende foranstaltninger).  \nTrafikstrømmene er også blevet påvirket af COVID-19-pandemien, især data fra\n2020.\n\nRapporten er et uddrag samlet fra Ejendoms- og Vejkontorets trafikdatabase,\nhvor målte trafikmængder løbende er blevet lagret hvert år.\n\n**Attribut**\n\n  * `pg_id [unik identifierare för varje mätplats]`\n  * `pg_nummer [identifierare för mätpunktens position]`\n  * `gatunamn [gata där mätning genomförts]`\n  * `delsträcka [position där mätningen genomförts]`\n  * `rikt_1 [färdriktning som ingår i mätning]`\n  * `rikt_2 [annan färdriktning som ingår i mätning]`\n  * `punkt_uppdaterat [senaste uppdatering av mätpunktsuppgifter och/eller geometri]`\n  * `year [mätår]`\n  * `mvd [medelvardagsdygnstrafik¹]`\n  * `max_fm [motorfordon/timme under förmiddagens maxtimme]`\n  * `max_em [motorfordon/timme under eftermiddagens maxtimme]`\n  * `andel_tung [motorfordon med vikt över 3,5 i procent av den totala trafiken²]`\n  * `medelhast [medelhastighet för den totala trafiken²]`\n  * `stats_uppdaterat [senaste uppdatering av statistikvärden; kan vara en justering av tidigare publicerade siffror eller nya siffror]`\n  * `geometry [typ: MultiLineString, CRS: WGS84]`\n  * `timestamp [trafikmätningsobjektens senaste uppdateringsdatum]`\n\n¹ Gennemsnitlig trafik på hverdage i en given periode for alle motorkøretøjer\ni begge retninger. Gennemsnitsværdien beregnes ud fra målinger for tirsdag-\ntorsdag, weekender og helligdage.  \n² Gælder for trafik i begge retninger.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"**Car traffic flows in Malmö**  \nThe purpose of this report is to report current traffic volumes on Malmö's\nstreets. At the same time, changes over time should be easily visible in the\nreport. Data on traffic volumes has been collected by the City of Malmö since\n1967.\n\nIt is important to keep in mind that there are factors that can affect the\nmeasurement results when studying traffic flows (e.g. road works, relocation\nof local buses, major reconstructions, speed changes and the introduction of\ntraffic calming measures).  \nTraffic flows have also been affected by the COVID-19 pandemic, especially\ndata from 2020.\n\nThe report is an excerpt compiled from the Property and Street Office's\ntraffic database in which measured traffic volumes have been continuously\nstored each year.\n\n**Attribute**\n\n  * `pg_id [unik identifierare för varje mätplats]`\n  * `pg_nummer [identifierare för mätpunktens position]`\n  * `gatunamn [gata där mätning genomförts]`\n  * `delsträcka [position där mätningen genomförts]`\n  * `rikt_1 [färdriktning som ingår i mätning]`\n  * `rikt_2 [annan färdriktning som ingår i mätning]`\n  * `punkt_uppdaterat [senaste uppdatering av mätpunktsuppgifter och/eller geometri]`\n  * `year [mätår]`\n  * `mvd [medelvardagsdygnstrafik¹]`\n  * `max_fm [motorfordon/timme under förmiddagens maxtimme]`\n  * `max_em [motorfordon/timme under eftermiddagens maxtimme]`\n  * `andel_tung [motorfordon med vikt över 3,5 i procent av den totala trafiken²]`\n  * `medelhast [medelhastighet för den totala trafiken²]`\n  * `stats_uppdaterat [senaste uppdatering av statistikvärden; kan vara en justering av tidigare publicerade siffror eller nya siffror]`\n  * `geometry [typ: MultiLineString, CRS: WGS84]`\n  * `timestamp [trafikmätningsobjektens senaste uppdateringsdatum]`\n\n¹ Average traffic during weekdays during a given period of time for all motor\nvehicles in both directions. The average value is calculated based on\nmeasurements for Tuesday-Thursday, weekends and public holidays.  \n² Applies to traffic in both directions.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"__Biltrafikflöden i Malmö__  \nSyftet med denna rapport är att redovisa aktuella trafikmängder på Malmös gator. Samtidigt ska förändringar över tid på ett enkelt sätt kunna avläsas i rapporten. Uppgifter om trafikmängder har samlats in av Malmö stad från och med år 1967.  \n  \nDet är viktigt att tänka på att det finns faktorer som kan ha inverkan på mätresultaten när trafikflöden studeras (t.ex. vägarbete, förflyttning av lokalbussar, större ombyggnationer, hastighetsförändringar och införande av trafikdämpande åtgärder).  \nTrafikflöden har också påverkats av COVID-19 pandemin, särskilt data från år 2020.  \n  \nRapporten är ett utdrag sammanställt ur Fastighet- och gatukontorets trafikdatabas i vilken uppmätta trafikmängder kontinuerligt har lagrats varje år.  \n  \n__Attribut__  \n  \n+ `pg_id [unik identifierare för varje mätplats]`  \n+ `pg_nummer [identifierare för mätpunktens position]`  \n+ `gatunamn [gata där mätning genomförts]`  \n+ `delsträcka [position där mätningen genomförts]`  \n+ `rikt_1 [färdriktning som ingår i mätning]`  \n+ `rikt_2 [annan färdriktning som ingår i mätning]`  \n+ `punkt_uppdaterat [senaste uppdatering av mätpunktsuppgifter och/eller geometri]`  \n+ `year [mätår]`  \n+ `mvd [medelvardagsdygnstrafik¹]`  \n+ `max_fm [motorfordon/timme under förmiddagens maxtimme]`  \n+ `max_em [motorfordon/timme under eftermiddagens maxtimme]`  \n+ `andel_tung [motorfordon med vikt över 3,5 i procent av den totala trafiken²]`  \n+ `medelhast [medelhastighet för den totala trafiken²]`  \n+ `stats_uppdaterat [senaste uppdatering av statistikvärden; kan vara en justering av tidigare publicerade siffror eller nya siffror]`  \n+ `geometry [typ: MultiLineString, CRS: WGS84]`  \n+ `timestamp [trafikmätningsobjektens senaste uppdateringsdatum]`\n\n¹ Medeltrafik under vardagsdygn under en given tidsperiod för alla motorfordon i båda riktningarna. Medelvärdet beräknas utifrån mätvärden för dygnen tisdag-torsdag, helg- och lovfria dagar.  \n² Gäller trafik i båda riktningarna.  \n"}],"dct:identifier":"c99dca2d-1e68-41bb-972e-04a5a1d5aeaa","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-03-08"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-07T02:01:32.222677"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:4c52f964bb1ae6ea3f61badd50cd5fc9a11ea90b11271f34cb5b46e5328eee6c_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:4c52f964bb1ae6ea3f61badd50cd5fc9a11ea90b11271f34cb5b46e5328eee6c_b2n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Trafikmåling for biltrafik"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Traffic measurement for car traffic"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trafikmätning för biltrafik"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/c99dca2d-1e68-41bb-972e-04a5a1d5aeaa/resource/c2ec6145-fefd-4d49-a909-48a3e09a080b","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/c99dca2d-1e68-41bb-972e-04a5a1d5aeaa/resource/c2ec6145-fefd-4d49-a909-48a3e09a080b/download/trafikmatning_for_biltrafik.geojson"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"9389306"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Viser målesteder og måleværdier for trafikmålinger\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Shows measurement locations and measurement values ​​for traffic measurements\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visar mätplatser och mätvärden för trafikmätningar"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2024-11-14T06:32:19.503587"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-07T02:00:55.641727"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Trafikmåling for målepunkter for biltrafik"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Traffic measurement for car traffic measuring points"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trafikmätning för biltrafik mätplatser"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/c99dca2d-1e68-41bb-972e-04a5a1d5aeaa/resource/d8429eab-38c4-42f7-975f-4d0967f48a5c","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/c99dca2d-1e68-41bb-972e-04a5a1d5aeaa/resource/d8429eab-38c4-42f7-975f-4d0967f48a5c/download/trafikmatning_for_biltrafik.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"3231473"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Viser målesteder og måleværdier for trafikmålinger\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Shows measurement locations and measurement values ​​for traffic measurements\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visar mätplatser och mätvärden för trafikmätningar"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-01-30T10:11:54.080336"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-07T02:01:32.247988"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Trafikmåling for målepunkter for biltrafik"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Traffic measurement for car traffic measuring points"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trafikmätning för biltrafik mätplatser"}],"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:4c52f964bb1ae6ea3f61badd50cd5fc9a11ea90b11271f34cb5b46e5328eee6c_b0n0"}}],"@id":"urn:source:4c52f964bb1ae6ea3f61badd50cd5fc9a11ea90b11271f34cb5b46e5328eee6c"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:4d541405ba74d958f93191b9b675e79868a05621d85471bf3230a0dfa9eece7b_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/bfff2434-7db1-4197-b67d-e682feb5d9b6","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/bfff2434-7db1-4197-b67d-e682feb5d9b6/resource/b105ffd7-7a90-4a63-9794-cc02d840f38c"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/EDUC"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Antal elever, der startede på gymnasiet i kommunen for 4 år siden med en\nuddannelse inden for 4 år (inklusive Introduktionsprogrammet IM) divideret med\nantallet af elever, der startede på gymnasiet i kommunen for 4 år siden\n(inklusive IM).\n\nStatistik i procenter fra 2014.\n\nStuderende, der ikke har et svensk personnummer ved starten af ​​deres\nuddannelse (for eksempel nyankomne studerende, der endnu ikke er blevet\nregistreret), er ikke medregnet.\n\nStatistikken er baseret på placeringskommune, hvilket refererer til elever i\nkommunale og friskoler i kommunen uanset hvor de er indskrevet.\n\nKilde: Statistiska Centralbyrån.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Number of students who started upper secondary school in the municipality 4\nyears ago with a degree within 4 years (including the Introductory Program IM)\ndivided by the number of students who started upper secondary school in the\nmunicipality 4 years ago, (including IM).\n\nStatistics in percentages from 2014.\n\nStudents who do not have a Swedish personal identification number at the\nbeginning of their education (for example, newly arrived students who have not\nyet been registered) are not included.\n\nThe statistics are based on location municipality, which refers to students in\nmunicipal and independent schools in the municipality regardless of where they\nare registered.\n\nSource: Statistics Sweden.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal elever som började på gymnasium i  kommunen för 4 år sedan med examen inom 4 år (inklusive Introduktionsprogrammet IM) dividerat med antal elever som började på gymnasium i kommunen för 4 år sedan, (inklusive IM). \n\nStatistik i procent från 2014.\n\nElever som vid utbildningens början saknar svenskt personnummer (exempelvis nyanlända elever som ännu inte blivit folkbokförda) ingår ej. \n\nStatistiken är baserat på lägeskommun vilket avser elever i kommunala och fristående skolor i kommunen oberoende på vart de är folkbokförda.\n\nKälla: SCB."}],"dct:identifier":"bfff2434-7db1-4197-b67d-e682feb5d9b6","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-15"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:32:40.196350"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:4d541405ba74d958f93191b9b675e79868a05621d85471bf3230a0dfa9eece7b_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Gymnasieelever, der dimitterer inden for 4 år, placeringskommune"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Upper secondary school students graduating within 4 years, location municipality"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gymnasieelever med examen inom 4 år, lägeskommun"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/bfff2434-7db1-4197-b67d-e682feb5d9b6/resource/b105ffd7-7a90-4a63-9794-cc02d840f38c","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N17464"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Antal elever, der startede i gymnasiet i kommunen for 4 år siden og\ndimitterede inden for 4 år, inkl. IM, divideret med antal elever, der startede\ni gymnasiet i kommunen for 4 år siden, inkl. IM. Elever, der ikke har et\nsvensk personnummer ved begyndelsen af ​​deres uddannelse (f.eks. nyankomne\nelever, der endnu ikke er blevet registreret), er ikke inkluderet. Kilde:\nKolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Number of students who started upper secondary school in the municipality 4\nyears ago and graduated within 4 years, incl. IM divided by number of students\nwho started upper secondary school in the municipality 4 years ago, incl. IM.\nStudents who do not have a Swedish personal identity number at the beginning\nof their education (e.g. newly arrived students who have not yet been\nregistered) are not included. Source: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal elever som började på gymnasium i  kommunen för 4 år sedan med examen inom 4 år, inkl. IM dividerat med antal elever som började på gymnasium i kommunen för 4 år sedan, inkl. IM. Elever som vid utbildningens början saknar svenskt personnummer (t ex nyanlända elever som ännu inte blivit folkbokförda) ingår ej. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-19T08:20:59.868256"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:32:40.200761"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Gymnasieelever med en uddannelse inden for 4 år, kommune, andel (%) (N17464)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Upper secondary school students with a degree within 4 years, municipality of location, proportion (%) (N17464)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gymnasieelever med examen inom 4 år, lägeskommun, andel (%) (N17464)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:4d541405ba74d958f93191b9b675e79868a05621d85471bf3230a0dfa9eece7b"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:4ed1c74cfeac3cc95f93fecafcca2f9814635be5a5a8ec63eeb93252343602b0_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/b80a51b8-a154-43b3-8ef3-4ddcf1690e62","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/b80a51b8-a154-43b3-8ef3-4ddcf1690e62/resource/cc8738e3-85ef-493b-90d4-9e0bc5f91e75"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ECON"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Afvigelse i procent mellem nettoomkostninger og referenceomkostninger for\nindividuel og familiepleje, SEK pr. indbygger.\n\nNettoomkostninger er bruttoomkostninger minus bruttoindkomst. Fra og med 2019\ner referenceomkostningerne baseret på nettoomkostningerne til individuel og\nfamiliepleje i landet, andelen af ​​lavtuddannede 20-40-årige født i Sverige,\nbybefolkningen, andelen der bor i flerfamiliehuse bygget i 1965-75, andelen af\n​​børn og unge i alderen 0-19 år i husstande med en lav indkomststandard, når\nøkonomisk bistand er ekskluderet, sygdomsrater, korrektion for\ngrænseoverskridende pendling til Danmark og Norge samt lønninger til kommunalt\nansatte. Data for lav indkomststandard er baseret på resultatet fra det\nforegående år.\n\nPositive værdier indikerer en højere omkostningssituation end statistisk\nforventet, og negative værdier indikerer en lavere omkostningssituation end\nstatistisk forventet.\n\nIndtil 2018 blev nettoomkostningsvariansen beregnet ved hjælp af den tidligere\nIFO-standardomkostningsmodel. Dette påvirker sammenligneligheden med tidligere\når fra 2019.\n\nKilde: SKR.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Deviation in percentage between net cost and reference cost for individual and\nfamily care, SEK per inhabitant.\n\nNet cost is gross cost minus gross income. From 2019 onwards, the reference\ncost is based on the net cost of individual and family care in the country,\nthe proportion of low-educated 20-40-year-olds born in Sweden, the urban\npopulation, the proportion living in multi-family buildings built in 1965-75,\nthe proportion of children and young people aged 0-19 in households with a low\nincome standard when financial assistance is excluded, ill health rates,\ncorrection for cross-border commuting to Denmark and Norway, and salaries for\nmunicipal employees. Data for low income standards is based on the previous\nyear's outcome.\n\nPositive values ​​indicate a higher cost situation than statistically expected\nand negative values ​​indicate a lower cost situation than statistically\nexpected.\n\nUp until 2018, net cost variance was calculated using the previous IFO\nstandard cost model. This affects comparability with previous years from 2019.\n\nSource: SKR.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Avvikelse i procent mellan nettokostnad och referenskostnad för individ- och familjeomsorg, kronor per invånare. \n\nNettokostnad är bruttokostnad minus bruttointäkt. Referenskostnaden bygger från och med 2019 på nettokostnaden för individ- och familjeomsorg i riket, andel lågutbildade 20-40-åringar födda i Sverige, tätortsbefolkningen, andel boende i flerfamiljshus byggda 1965-75, andel barn och unga 0-19 år i hushåll med låg inkomststandard då ekonomiskt bistånd exkluderas, ohälsotal, korrigering för gränspendling till Danmark och Norge samt löner för kommunalt anställda. Uppgifter för låg inkomststandard bygger på föregående års utfall. \n\nPositiva värden indikerar högre kostnadsläge än statistiskt förväntat och negativa värden ett lägre kostnadsläge än statistiskt förväntat. \n\nTill och med 2018 beräknades nettokostnadsavvikelse enligt den tidigare standardkostnadsmodellen för IFO. Detta påverkar jämförbarheten med tidigare år from 2019. \n\nKälla: SKR."}],"dct:identifier":"b80a51b8-a154-43b3-8ef3-4ddcf1690e62","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-15"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T06:19:22.652459"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:4ed1c74cfeac3cc95f93fecafcca2f9814635be5a5a8ec63eeb93252343602b0_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Nettoomkostningsvarians for individuel og familiepleje, procent"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Net cost variance for individual and family care, percent"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nettokostnadsavvikelse individ- och familjeomsorg, procent"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/b80a51b8-a154-43b3-8ef3-4ddcf1690e62/resource/cc8738e3-85ef-493b-90d4-9e0bc5f91e75","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N30001"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Afvigelse i procent mellem nettoomkostninger og referenceomkostninger for\nindividuel og familiepleje, SEK/indbygger. Nettoomkostninger er\nbruttoomkostninger minus bruttoindkomst. Fra og med 2019 er\nreferenceomkostningerne baseret på nettoomkostningerne for individuel og\nfamiliepleje i landet, andelen af ​​lavtuddannede 20-40-årige født i Sverige,\nbybefolkningen, andelen af ​​beboere i flerfamiliehuse bygget i 1965-75,\nandelen af ​​børn og unge i alderen 0-19 år i husstande med lav\nindkomststandard, når økonomisk bistand er ekskluderet, sygefraværsrater,\nkorrektion for grænseoverskridende pendling til Danmark og Norge og lønninger\nfor kommunalt ansatte. Data for lav indkomststandard er baseret på det\nforegående års resultat. Positive værdier indikerer en højere\nomkostningssituation end statistisk forventet, og negative værdier en lavere\nomkostningssituation end statistisk forventet. Til og med 2018 blev\nnettoomkostningsafvigelsen beregnet efter den tidligere\nstandardomkostningsmodel for IFO. Dette påvirker sammenligneligheden med\ntidligere år fra 2019. Kilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Deviation in percentage between net cost and reference cost for individual and\nfamily care, SEK/inhabitant. Net cost is gross cost minus gross income. From\n2019 onwards, the reference cost is based on the net cost of individual and\nfamily care in the country, the proportion of low-educated 20-40-year-olds\nborn in Sweden, the urban population, the proportion living in multi-family\nbuildings built in 1965-75, the proportion of children and young people aged\n0-19 in households with a low income standard when financial assistance is\nexcluded, ill health rates, correction for cross-border commuting to Denmark\nand Norway and salaries for municipal employees. Data for low income standard\nis based on the previous year's outcome. Positive values ​​indicate a higher\ncost situation than statistically expected and negative values ​​a lower cost\nsituation than statistically expected. Up to and including 2018, the net cost\ndeviation was calculated according to the previous standard cost model for\nIFO. This affects comparability with previous years from 2019. Source: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Avvikelse i procent mellan nettokostnad och referenskostnad för individ- och familjeomsorg, kr/inv. Nettokostnad är bruttokostnad minus bruttointäkt. Referenskostnaden bygger från och med 2019 på nettokostnaden för individ- och familjeomsorg i riket, andel lågutbildade 20-40-åringar födda i Sverige, tätortsbefolkningen, andel boende i flerfamiljshus byggda 1965-75, andel barn och unga 0-19 år i hushåll med låg inkomststandard då ekonomiskt bistånd exkluderas, ohälsotal, korrigering för gränspendling till Danmark och Norge samt löner för kommunalt anställda. Uppgifter för låg inkomststandard bygger på föregående års utfall. Positiva värden indikerar högre kostnadsläge än statistiskt förväntat och negativa värden ett lägre kostnadsläge än statistiskt förväntat. Till och med 2018 beräknades nettokostnadsavvikelse enligt den tidigare standardkostnadsmodellen för IFO. Detta påverkar jämförbarheten med tidigare år from 2019. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-19T10:09:14.379663"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T06:19:22.674157"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Nettoomkostningsvarians i individuel og familiepleje (%) (N30001)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Net cost variance individual and family care, (%) (N30001)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nettokostnadsavvikelse individ- och familjeomsorg, (%) (N30001)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:4ed1c74cfeac3cc95f93fecafcca2f9814635be5a5a8ec63eeb93252343602b0"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:52b3015cb1983cc699ceaf4bdde3cf37114cdfac8537fdc2470b0e13c42cedd5_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"2ece299aed131857fb6ee96d8e84bf7419d57cde"},{"@id":"_:52b3015cb1983cc699ceaf4bdde3cf37114cdfac8537fdc2470b0e13c42cedd5_b1n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"b673b5a1617176a5e8fea8e6a2b91bd97c9a403f"},{"@id":"_:52b3015cb1983cc699ceaf4bdde3cf37114cdfac8537fdc2470b0e13c42cedd5_b2n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/bcbddb58c201e63da3e728b33a85afcc","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Stadsbyggnadskontoret","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:sbk.sma@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fa574631-e811-48c7-afa6-fd402815b4eb","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/bcbddb58c201e63da3e728b33a85afcc"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fa574631-e811-48c7-afa6-fd402815b4eb/resource/24cc1d77-3760-46c8-b61c-a7ed99941e6a"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fa574631-e811-48c7-afa6-fd402815b4eb/resource/5cae8fdc-b4a8-4791-87b9-94e41013f11b"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fa574631-e811-48c7-afa6-fd402815b4eb/resource/b8959339-aef8-40dc-bffd-0e91b7cbbb34"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","geodata","gis","karta","map","nyckelkodsområde","samhällsbyggnad"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/IRREG"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"## Kortlag\n\nKortlag, der viser delområder i Malmø Kommune. Delområderne følger grænserne\nfor Key Code Area IV-numrene. Områderne bruges primært til statistik.\nKortlaget opdateres efter behov af byplankontoret. Sidst opdateret: september\n2020.\n\n##  Polygonlag\n\n**Koordinatsystem**\n\nWGS84 (EPSG4326)\n\nSWEREF99 13 30 (EPSG3008)\n\n**Attributdata**\n\nNavn på delområde: delområde\n\nUnderområdekode: do_kod\n\nDelområde areal: område\n\n(TopoJSON-formatressourcen er blevet brugt med succes til distribution af\nspatiale data i Power BI.)\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"## Map layers\n\nMap layer showing sub-areas in Malmö Municipality. The sub-areas follow the\nboundaries of Key Code Areas IV numbers. The areas are mainly used for\nstatistics. The map layer is updated as needed by the City Planning Office.\nLast update: September 2020.\n\n##  Polygon layer\n\n**Coordinate system**\n\nWGS84 (EPSG4326)\n\nSWEREF99 13 30 (EPSG3008)\n\n**Attribute data**\n\nSubarea name: subarea\n\nSubarea code: do_kod\n\nSub-area area: area\n\n(The TopoJSON format resource has been successfully used for spatial data\ndistribution in Power BI.)\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"## Kartlager\n\nKartlager som visar delområden i Malmö kommun. Delområdena följer gränserna för Nyckelkodsområden IV-siffror. Områdena används främst för statistik. Kartlagret uppdateras vid behov av stadsbyggnadskontoret. Senaste uppdatering: september 2020.\n\n## Polygonlager\n\n__Koordinatsystem__  \n\nWGS84 (EPSG4326)\n\nSWEREF99 13 30 (EPSG3008)\n\n__Attributdata__  \n\nDelområdets namn: delomr\n\nDelområdets kod: do_kod \n\nDelområdets area: area\n\n(Resursen i TopoJSON-format har framgångsrikt använts vid geografisk datafördelning i Power BI.)"}],"dct:identifier":"fa574631-e811-48c7-afa6-fd402815b4eb","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-01-12"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-15T16:05:06.234254"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:52b3015cb1983cc699ceaf4bdde3cf37114cdfac8537fdc2470b0e13c42cedd5_b2n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Delområder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Sub-areas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Delområden"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fa574631-e811-48c7-afa6-fd402815b4eb/resource/24cc1d77-3760-46c8-b61c-a7ed99941e6a","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fa574631-e811-48c7-afa6-fd402815b4eb/resource/24cc1d77-3760-46c8-b61c-a7ed99941e6a/download/delomr_p_4326.gpkg"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"573440"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Delområder i henhold til koordinatsystemet WGS84/EPSG4326.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Subareas according to coordinate system WGS84/EPSG4326.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Delområden enligt koordinatsystem WGS84/EPSG4326."}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2021-01-12T15:13:40.268967"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-15T16:04:51.984273"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Delområder EPSG4326 (GPKG)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Subareas EPSG4326 (GPKG)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Delområden EPSG4326 (GPKG)"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:52b3015cb1983cc699ceaf4bdde3cf37114cdfac8537fdc2470b0e13c42cedd5_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fa574631-e811-48c7-afa6-fd402815b4eb/resource/5cae8fdc-b4a8-4791-87b9-94e41013f11b","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fa574631-e811-48c7-afa6-fd402815b4eb/resource/5cae8fdc-b4a8-4791-87b9-94e41013f11b/download/delomr_p_3008.gpkg"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"573440"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Delområder i henhold til koordinatsystemet SWEREF99/EPSG3008.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Subareas according to coordinate system SWEREF99/EPSG3008.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Delområden enligt koordinatsystem SWEREF99/EPSG3008."}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2021-01-12T15:39:25.930695"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-15T16:05:06.241094"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Delområder EPSG3008 (GPKG)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Subareas EPSG3008 (GPKG)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Delområden EPSG3008 (GPKG)"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fa574631-e811-48c7-afa6-fd402815b4eb/resource/b8959339-aef8-40dc-bffd-0e91b7cbbb34","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fa574631-e811-48c7-afa6-fd402815b4eb/resource/b8959339-aef8-40dc-bffd-0e91b7cbbb34/download/delomraden_epsg4326.json"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"129614"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Delområder i henhold til koordinatsystemet WGS84/EPSG4326.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Subareas according to coordinate system WGS84/EPSG4326.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Delområden enligt koordinatsystem WGS84/EPSG4326."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2023-11-30T10:24:09.649809"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-03-18T20:27:00.248727"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"EPSG4326 underområder (TopoJSON)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"EPSG4326 subareas (TopoJSON)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Delområden EPSG4326 (TopoJSON)"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:52b3015cb1983cc699ceaf4bdde3cf37114cdfac8537fdc2470b0e13c42cedd5_b1n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:52b3015cb1983cc699ceaf4bdde3cf37114cdfac8537fdc2470b0e13c42cedd5"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:5337209f5e7ad88e35363b119291da49218d00e145c1aa46dd348842ca450ac1_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"5ff50a97e80309094fce3818e46218b1"},{"@id":"_:5337209f5e7ad88e35363b119291da49218d00e145c1aa46dd348842ca450ac1_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/abd7da407bcfbc956fd6c0e91189412f","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Fastighets- och gatukontoret","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:gis.fgk@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://lankadedata.se/spec/offentlig-konst/","@type":"dct:Standard"},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/cf5f830c-0216-43c0-af60-e8385dfef4e2","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/abd7da407bcfbc956fd6c0e91189412f"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/cf5f830c-0216-43c0-af60-e8385dfef4e2/resource/01c13bc1-861c-4486-85a3-15d50ac6584e"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/cf5f830c-0216-43c0-af60-e8385dfef4e2/resource/4d9d1717-5151-4662-a834-7caf840cec37"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/cf5f830c-0216-43c0-af60-e8385dfef4e2/resource/fd1e5590-3a73-4fe7-9972-f7d6c9ab3fd6"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","skulptur"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/EDUC"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/WEEKLY"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://lankadedata.se/spec/offentlig-konst/"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Dette datasæt indeholder data om offentlig kunst placeret på offentlig jord\nejet af Malmø Kommune.\n\n**Attribut**\n\n  * `id` [identifikator for kunstværket]\n  * `source` [organisationsnummer for forvaltningsmyndighed]\n  * `title` [kunstværkets titel]\n  * `description` [beskrivelse af kunstværket]\n  * `artform` [kunsttype]\n  * `creator` [kunstnerens navn]\n  * `created` [år hvor kunstværket blev skabt]\n  * `artmedium` [materiale brugt til kunstværket]\n  * `artwork_surface` [støttemateriale til kunstværket]\n  * `width` [kunstværkets bredde]\n  * `height` [kunstværkets højde]\n  * `depth` [kunstværkets dybde]\n  * `street` [gadeadresse]\n  * `city` [sted]\n  * `region` [amt]\n  * `URL` [link til hjemmeside for mere information]\n  * `image` [links til billeder af kunstværket]\n  * `rights` [fotografens navn]\n  * `license` [licensrettigheder til billederne]\n  * `timestamp` [objektets seneste opdateringsdato]\n  * `geometry` [type: Punkt, CRS: WGS84]\n\nAttributterne følger i vid udstrækning [Specifikationen for Offentlig Kunst -\nversion 1.0](https://lankadedata.se/spec/offentlig%2dkonst/) , udviklet af\nNational Data Workshop. Specifikationens felter for længdegrad og breddegrad\ner her tilpasset GeoJSONs **geometriattribut** .\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"This dataset contains data about public art placed on public land owned by the\nCity of Malmö.\n\n**Attribute**\n\n  * `id` [identifier for the artwork]\n  * `source` [organizational number of managing authority]\n  * `title` [title of the artwork]\n  * `description` [description of the artwork]\n  * `artform` [type of artwork]\n  * `creator` [artist's name]\n  * `created` [year when the artwork was created]\n  * `artmedium` [material used for the artwork]\n  * `artwork_surface` [supporting material for the artwork]\n  * `width` [width of the artwork]\n  * `height` [height of the artwork]\n  * `depth` [depth of the artwork]\n  * `street` [street address]\n  * `city` ​​[place]\n  * `region` [county]\n  * `URL` [link to home page for more information]\n  * `image` [links to images of the artwork]\n  * `rights` [name of photographer]\n  * `license` [license rights for the images]\n  * `timestamp` [the object's last update date]\n  * `geometry` [type: Point, CRS: WGS84]\n\nThe attributes largely follow [the Specification for Public Art - version\n1.0](https://lankadedata.se/spec/offentlig%2dkonst/) , developed by the\nNational Data Workshop. The specification's fields for longitude and latitude\nare here adapted to GeoJSON's **geometry** attribute.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Denna datamängd innehåller data om offentlig konst placerad på allmän platsmark som ägs av Malmö stad.  \n\n__Attribut__  \n  \n+ `id` [identifierare för konstverket]  \n+ `source` [organisationsnr för förvaltande myndighet]  \n+ `title` [konstverkets titel]  \n+ `description` [beskrivning av konstverket]  \n+ `artform` [typ av konstverk]  \n+ `creator` [konstnärens namn]  \n+ `created` [år när konstverket skapades]  \n+ `artmedium` [material som användes för konstverket]  \n+ `artwork_surface` [stödjande material till konstverket]  \n+ `width` [konstverkets bredd]  \n+ `height` [konstverkets höjd]  \n+ `depth` [konstverkets djup]  \n+ `street` [gatuadress]  \n+ `city` [ort]  \n+ `region` [län]  \n+ `URL` [länk till ingångssida för mer information]  \n+ `image` [länkar till bilder på konstverket]  \n+ `rights` [namn på fotografen]  \n+ `license` [licensrättigheter för bilderna]  \n+ `timestamp` [objektets senaste uppdateringsdatum]  \n+ `geometry` [typ: Point, CRS: WGS84]  \n\nAttributen följer i stort [Specifikation för offentlig konst - version 1.0](https://lankadedata.se/spec/offentlig-konst/), framtagen av Nationell Dataverkstad. Specifikationens fält för longitud, latitud är här anpassade till GeoJSONs __geometry__-attribut.  "}],"dct:identifier":"cf5f830c-0216-43c0-af60-e8385dfef4e2","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-06-27"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-10T08:29:34.869643"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:5337209f5e7ad88e35363b119291da49218d00e145c1aa46dd348842ca450ac1_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Offentlig kunst"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Public art"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Offentlig konst"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/cf5f830c-0216-43c0-af60-e8385dfef4e2/resource/01c13bc1-861c-4486-85a3-15d50ac6584e","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/cf5f830c-0216-43c0-af60-e8385dfef4e2/resource/01c13bc1-861c-4486-85a3-15d50ac6584e/download/offentlig_konst.geojson"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"151261"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Offentlig kunst\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Public art\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Offentlig konst"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2025-06-27T07:43:17.961216"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-10T08:29:08.385856"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Offentlig kunst"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Public art"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Offentlig konst"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/cf5f830c-0216-43c0-af60-e8385dfef4e2/resource/4d9d1717-5151-4662-a834-7caf840cec37","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/cf5f830c-0216-43c0-af60-e8385dfef4e2/resource/4d9d1717-5151-4662-a834-7caf840cec37/download/offentlig_konst.gpkg"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"131072"},"dcat:mediaType":"application/vnd.sqlite3","dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Offentlig kunst\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Public art\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Offentlig konst"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-01-30T06:55:35.528662"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-10T08:29:14.224432"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Offentlig kunst"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Public art"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Offentlig konst"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/cf5f830c-0216-43c0-af60-e8385dfef4e2/resource/fd1e5590-3a73-4fe7-9972-f7d6c9ab3fd6","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/cf5f830c-0216-43c0-af60-e8385dfef4e2/resource/fd1e5590-3a73-4fe7-9972-f7d6c9ab3fd6/download/offentlig_konst.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"30229"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Offentlig kunst\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Public art\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Offentlig konst"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-01-30T08:11:42.673302"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-10T08:29:34.885614"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Offentlig kunst"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Public art"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Offentlig konst"}],"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:5337209f5e7ad88e35363b119291da49218d00e145c1aa46dd348842ca450ac1_b0n0"}}],"@id":"urn:source:5337209f5e7ad88e35363b119291da49218d00e145c1aa46dd348842ca450ac1"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:56ca5c6f2be03d27d5ebdfc304490964df230d776d8e1f6da698540fc487eb98_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/70c407d9-2d73-480a-8daf-9aac5ec63d4d","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/70c407d9-2d73-480a-8daf-9aac5ec63d4d/resource/9483456b-aa20-498e-a6e8-03bb97035e3e"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","energi","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENER"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Samlet installeret effekt fra solkraftværker tilsluttet elnettet, målt i MW.\nTallene stammer fra undersøgelsen Nettilsluttede solkraftværker.\n\nKilde: Den svenske energimyndighed (via Kolada)\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Total installed power from solar power plants connected to the electricity\ngrid, measured in MW. The figures come from the survey Grid-connected solar\npower plants.\n\nSource: Swedish Energy Agency (via Kolada)\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Total installerad effekt från solcellsanläggningar anslutna till elnätet, mätt i MW. Siffrorna kommer från enkätundersökningen Nätanslutna solcellsanläggningar.  \n  \nKälla: Energimyndigheten (via Kolada)"}],"dct:identifier":"70c407d9-2d73-480a-8daf-9aac5ec63d4d","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:00:52.363802"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:56ca5c6f2be03d27d5ebdfc304490964df230d776d8e1f6da698540fc487eb98_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Samlede solcelleinstallationer i kommunen, installeret kapacitet (MW)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Total solar cell installations in the municipality, installed capacity (MW)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Solcellsanläggningar totalt kommunen, installerad effekt (MW)"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/70c407d9-2d73-480a-8daf-9aac5ec63d4d/resource/9483456b-aa20-498e-a6e8-03bb97035e3e","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N45970"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Samlet installeret effekt fra solkraftværker tilsluttet elnettet, målt i MW.\nTallene stammer fra undersøgelsen Nettilsluttede solkraftværker.\n\nKilde: Den svenske energimyndighed (via Kolada)\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Total installed power from solar power plants connected to the electricity\ngrid, measured in MW. The figures come from the survey Grid-connected solar\npower plants.\n\nSource: Swedish Energy Agency (via Kolada)\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Total installerad effekt från solcellsanläggningar anslutna till elnätet, mätt i MW. Siffrorna kommer från enkätundersökningen Nätanslutna solcellsanläggningar.  \n  \nKälla: Energimyndigheten (via Kolada)"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-12-13T07:03:54.301123"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:00:52.386840"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Samlet antal solcelleinstallationer i kommunen, installeret kapacitet (MW)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Total solar cell installations in the municipality, installed capacity (MW)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Solcellsanläggningar totalt kommunen, installerad effekt (MW)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:56ca5c6f2be03d27d5ebdfc304490964df230d776d8e1f6da698540fc487eb98"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:5fdaeb4272b15053705e36b59b8d310a2e3b1e26de686474cb2f8bf25f8cf3b1_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/1c44246c-e65d-431c-be4e-234c90ed1589","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/1c44246c-e65d-431c-be4e-234c90ed1589/resource/2098c1b7-3b78-4f84-ab9c-8a8841677696"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/EDUC"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elevernes samlede meritværdi divideret med antallet af elever, der fik\nkarakterer i mindst ét ​​fag i henhold til det mål- og vidensrelaterede\nkaraktersystem i 9. klasse. Karaktererne måles før eksamen.\n\nStatistik fra 2015.\n\nDataene vedrører elever, der er registreret i kommunen (hjemkommunen), uanset\nhvor de går i skole.  \n_Studerende med ukendt baggrund er ikke inkluderet.  \n_ Oplysningerne refererer til studieåret.\n\nMeritværdien for en studerende er summen af ​​de 17 bedste karakterer i den\nstuderendes endelige karakter (E=10, D=12,5, C=15, B=17,5 og A=20). Den\nmaksimalt mulige værdi er 340 point.\n\nKilde: Statistiska centralbanken og Skolstyrelsen.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"The students' total merit value divided by the number of students who received\ngrades in at least one subject according to the goal- and knowledge-related\ngrading system in grade 9. The grades are measured before the examination.\n\nStatistics from 2015.\n\nThe data refers to students registered in the municipality (home\nmunicipality), regardless of where they attend school.  \n_Students with unknown backgrounds are not included.  \n_ The information refers to the academic year.\n\nThe credit value for a student is the sum of the 17 best grades in the\nstudent's final grade (E=10, D=12.5, C=15, B=17.5 and A=20). The maximum\npossible value is 340 points.\n\nSource: Statistics Sweden and the Swedish National Agency for Education.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elevernas sammanlagda meritvärde dividerat med antal elever som fått betyg i minst ett ämne enligt det mål- och kunskapsrelaterade betygssystemet i årskurs 9. Betygen mäts före prövning. \n\nStatistik från 2015.\n\nUppgifterna avser elever folkbokförda i kommunen (hemkommunen), oavsett var de går i skola.   \n* Elever med okänd bakgrund ingår inte.  \n* Uppgiften avser läsår.\n\nMeritvärdet för en elev utgörs av summan för de 17 bästa betygen i elevens slutbetyg  (E=10, D=12.5, C=15, B=17.5 och A=20). Det möjliga maxvärdet är 340 poäng. \n\nKälla: SCB och Skolverket."}],"dct:identifier":"1c44246c-e65d-431c-be4e-234c90ed1589","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-15"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:35:02.379802"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:5fdaeb4272b15053705e36b59b8d310a2e3b1e26de686474cb2f8bf25f8cf3b1_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elever i 9. klasse - gennemsnit af meritværdi, hjemkommune (17 fag)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Students in grade 9 - average of merit value, home municipality (17 subjects)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elever i årskurs 9 - genomsnitt av meritvärde, hemkommun (17 ämnen)"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/1c44246c-e65d-431c-be4e-234c90ed1589/resource/2098c1b7-3b78-4f84-ab9c-8a8841677696","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N15507"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elevernes samlede meritværdi divideret med antallet af elever, der har opnået\nkarakterer i mindst ét ​​fag i henhold til det mål- og vidensrelaterede\nkaraktersystem i 9. klasse. Karaktererne måles før eksamen. Dataene refererer\ntil elever, der er registreret i kommunen, uanset hvor de går i skole. Elever\nmed ukendt baggrund er ikke inkluderet. Dataene refererer til skoleåret.\nMeritværdien for en elev består af summen af ​​de 17 bedste karakterer i\nelevens endelige karakter (E=10, D=12,5, C=15, B=17,5 og A=20). Den maksimalt\nmulige værdi er 340 point. Kilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"The students' total merit value divided by the number of students who received\ngrades in at least one subject according to the goal- and knowledge-related\ngrading system in grade 9. The grades are measured before the examination. The\ndata refers to students registered in the municipality, regardless of where\nthey attend school. Students with unknown backgrounds are not included. The\ndata refers to the academic year. The merit value for a student consists of\nthe sum of the 17 best grades in the student's final grade (E=10, D=12.5,\nC=15, B=17.5 and A=20). The maximum possible value is 340 points. Source:\nKolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elevernas sammanlagda meritvärde dividerat med antal elever som fått betyg i minst ett ämne enligt det mål- och kunskapsrelaterade betygssystemet i årskurs 9. Betygen mäts före prövning. Uppgifterna avser elever folkbokförda i kommunen, oavsett var de går i skola. Elever med okänd bakgrund ingår inte. Uppgiften avser läsår. Meritvärdet för en elev utgörs av summan för de 17 bästa betygen i elevens slutbetyg  (E=10, D=12.5, C=15, B=17.5 och A=20). Det möjliga maxvärdet är 340 poäng. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-15T07:29:23.457675"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:35:02.408400"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elever i 9. klasse, meritværdi, hjemkommune, gennemsnit (17 fag) (N15507)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Students in grade 9, merit value, home municipality, average (17 subjects) (N15507)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elever i åk 9, meritvärde, hemkommun, genomsnitt (17 ämnen) (N15507)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:5fdaeb4272b15053705e36b59b8d310a2e3b1e26de686474cb2f8bf25f8cf3b1"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:6398f64d18176d89cf0ef63b3a7dbd2049bb8ccf8fe8dfbf8bbeefba476c4337_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"_:6398f64d18176d89cf0ef63b3a7dbd2049bb8ccf8fe8dfbf8bbeefba476c4337_b1n0","@type":"dct:PeriodOfTime","dcat:endDate":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2008-12-31"},"dcat:startDate":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"1988-01-01"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Karl McShane","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:karl.mcshane