494e-993a-039db9c2e717","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://mmostatfiler.malmo.se/stadsdelar/stadsdelar_1996.pdf"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"* * *\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"* * *\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"---"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/PDF"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-12-20T10:47:16.445548"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-03-18T21:33:05.071072"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Områdefakta Distrikter 1996"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Area facts Districts 1996"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Områdesfakta Stadsdelar 1996"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:6398f64d18176d89cf0ef63b3a7dbd2049bb8ccf8fe8dfbf8bbeefba476c4337"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:662ff21bf538b7ed99b6ffdd05573fc26ee4428c14712b2f59585c82439a41de_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"5d456e3609b878f6a229d48c6c5343be"},{"@id":"_:662ff21bf538b7ed99b6ffdd05573fc26ee4428c14712b2f59585c82439a41de_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Karl McShane","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:karl.mcshane@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/54d9bf1e-c74d-4835-8e9d-5ab8a10e4cf9","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/54d9bf1e-c74d-4835-8e9d-5ab8a10e4cf9/resource/53a115c6-ecbe-4405-9418-353e88b4520c"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/54d9bf1e-c74d-4835-8e9d-5ab8a10e4cf9/resource/7e80c27b-04fa-4951-bdba-75e0469682a3"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Viser antallet af lejligheder opdelt på lejlighedsbygninger, enfamiliehuse,\nsærlige boliger og andre huse. \"Lejlighed\" bruges her til at henvise til både\nlejligheder i lejlighedsbygninger og enfamiliehuse, for eksempel betragtes en\nvilla som en lejlighed i denne statistik. Lejlighedsbygninger er defineret som\nbeboelsesejendomme med tre eller flere lejligheder, inklusive loftshuse.\nEnfamiliehuse er defineret som fritliggende en- og tofamiliehuse samt\ndobbelthuse, rækkehuse og kædehuse (eksklusive fritidshuse). Særlige boliger\nomfatter blandt andet studieboliger og boliger for ældre/handicappede. Andre\nhuse er defineret som bygninger, der ikke er beregnet til boligformål, for\neksempel bygninger beregnet til erhverv eller fællesfunktioner. Antallet af\nlejligheder kan være større end antallet af beboelseshusstande, hvis ingen er\nregistreret i lejligheden på grund af administrative efterslæb, manglende\nopholdstilladelser blandt de beboere i lejligheden, manglende rettidig\nregistrering, hvis ingen blot boede i lejligheden den 31/12 i det år,\nstatistikken gælder, eller af andre lignende årsager. Alle lejligheder, der er\ninkluderet i lejlighedsregisteret, er inkluderet i statistikken, men kun\nområder med mere end 30 lejligheder i alt er indberettet. Data fra\nlejlighedsregisteret.\n\n**Variabelbeskrivelse**  \nDu finder det\n[her](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**API'er**  \nVed at bruge API-kaldet\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics_\nkan du hente alle datasæt, der indeholder statistiske data for Malmøs områder,\ni JSON-format.  \nI hver forekomst af result/results i JSON-resultatet er der en \"id\"-egenskab\nfor hver ressource. Værdien af ​​\"id\" kan bruges til at hente dataene for den\nrespektive statistikvariabel (i henhold til værdien af ​​egenskaben \"name\").\nAPI-kald til at hente statistikdataene:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-\nværdi]_\n\nBrug gerne tallene, men angiv \"Bykontoret, Malmö Kommune\" som kilde.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Shows the number of apartments divided by apartment buildings, single-family\nhouses, special housing and other houses. \"Apartment\" is used here to refer to\nboth apartments in apartment buildings and single-family houses, for example a\nvilla is considered an apartment in these statistics. Apartment buildings are\ndefined as residential buildings containing three or more apartments including\nloft-type houses. Single-family houses are defined as detached one- and two-\nfamily houses as well as semi-detached, terraced and chain houses (excluding\nholiday homes). Special housing includes, among other things, student housing\nand housing for the elderly/disabled. Other houses are defined as buildings\nthat are not intended for residential purposes, for example buildings intended\nfor business or community functions. The number of apartments may be greater\nthan the number of residential households if no one is registered in the\napartment due to administrative backlog, lack of residence permits among those\nliving in the apartment, failure to register in time, if no one simply lived\nin the apartment on 31/12 of the year the statistics apply, or for other\nsimilar reasons. All apartments included in the apartment register are\nincluded in the statistics, but only areas with more than 30 apartments in\ntotal are reported. Data from the apartment register.\n\n**Variable description**  \nYou find it\n[here](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**APIs**  \nUsing the API call\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics,_\nyou can retrieve all data sets that contain statistical data for Malmö's areas\nin JSON format.  \nIn each instance of result/results in the JSON result, there is an \"id\"\nproperty for each resource. The value of \"id\" can be used to retrieve the data\nfor the respective statistics variable (according to the value of the \"name\"\nproperty). API call to retrieve the statistics data:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id\nvalue]_\n\nFeel free to use the numbers, but cite “City Office, Malmö City” as the\nsource.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visar antalet lägenheter uppdelat efter flerbostadshus, småhus, specialbostäder och övriga hus. ”Lägenhet” används här som beteckning både på bostäder i flerbostadshus och småhus, en villa betraktas till exempel som en lägenhet i denna statistik. Flerbostadshus definieras som bostadsbyggnader innehållande tre eller flera lägenheter inklusive loftgångshus. Småhus definieras som friliggande en- och tvåbostadshus samt par-, rad- och kedjehus (exklusive fritidshus). Specialbostäder innefattar bland annat studentbostäder och bostäder för äldre/funktionshindrade. Övriga hus definieras som byggnader som inte är avsedda för bostadsändamål, till exempel byggnader avsedda för verksamhet eller samhällsfunktion. Antalet lägenheter kan vara större än antalet bostadshushåll om ingen är folkbokförd på lägenheten på grund av administrativ eftersläpning, avsaknad av uppehållstillstånd bland de som bor i lägenheten, att man inte folkbokfört sig i tid, om ingen helt enkelt bodde i lägenheten den 31/12 året statistiken gäller eller på grund av andra liknande skäl. Alla lägenheter som finns med i lägenhetsregistret är med i statistiken men endast områden med fler än 30 lägenheter totalt redovisas. Data från lägenhetsregistret.\n\n__Variabelbeskrivning__  \nHittar du [här](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)!  \n                     \n__API__  \nMed hjälp av API-anropet *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistik* får man i JSON-format fram samtliga datamängder som innehåller statistikunderlag för Malmös områden.  \nI varje instans av result/results i JSON-resultatet finns för varje resurs en egenskap \"id\". Värdet för \"id\" kan användas för att hämta datan för respektive statistikvariabel (enligt värdet för egenskapen \"name\").\nAPI-anrop för att hämta statistikdatan: *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-värdet]*   \n\nAnvänd gärna siffrorna, men ange “Stadskontoret, Malmö stad” som källa."}],"dct:identifier":"54d9bf1e-c74d-4835-8e9d-5ab8a10e4cf9","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-16"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:08:19.243466"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:662ff21bf538b7ed99b6ffdd05573fc26ee4428c14712b2f59585c82439a41de_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Hustype - Statistiske data for Malmøs områder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"House type - Statistical data for Malmö's areas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hustyp - Statistikunderlag för Malmös områden"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/54d9bf1e-c74d-4835-8e9d-5ab8a10e4cf9/resource/53a115c6-ecbe-4405-9418-353e88b4520c","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=7e80c27b-04fa-4951-bdba-75e0469682a3"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø statistik - Hustype\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - House type\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Hustyp"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-05-08T12:04:00.260060"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-05-08T12:04:05.006851"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Hustype"},{"@language":"en","@value":"House type"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hustyp"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/54d9bf1e-c74d-4835-8e9d-5ab8a10e4cf9/resource/7e80c27b-04fa-4951-bdba-75e0469682a3","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/54d9bf1e-c74d-4835-8e9d-5ab8a10e4cf9/resource/7e80c27b-04fa-4951-bdba-75e0469682a3/download/hustyp.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"451801"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø statistik - Hustype\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - House type\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Hustyp"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-05-08T12:03:55.760159"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:08:19.252636"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Hustype"},{"@language":"en","@value":"House type"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hustyp"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:662ff21bf538b7ed99b6ffdd05573fc26ee4428c14712b2f59585c82439a41de_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:662ff21bf538b7ed99b6ffdd05573fc26ee4428c14712b2f59585c82439a41de"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:68cbc3746528347d8911423c773ee16a69a634a2a5b5dd6b01a85e7f71346e5a_b0n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Address","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#street-address":"Bergsgatan 17 Malmö"},{"@id":"_:68cbc3746528347d8911423c773ee16a69a634a2a5b5dd6b01a85e7f71346e5a_b1n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"e0626ff878a0eddbf470c405a5b1fb4289fb95bd"},{"@id":"_:68cbc3746528347d8911423c773ee16a69a634a2a5b5dd6b01a85e7f71346e5a_b2n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"8cf7fe60a1515b6000aac7a5e495be4c7edc6925"},{"@id":"_:68cbc3746528347d8911423c773ee16a69a634a2a5b5dd6b01a85e7f71346e5a_b3n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/00384f6c30a75c7618456af7c6cec6b6","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Avdelningen för miljö och hälsoskydd","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasAddress":{"@id":"_:68cbc3746528347d8911423c773ee16a69a634a2a5b5dd6b01a85e7f71346e5a_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:miljo@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/a8ce80d6-0c43-4d87-9f8f-51789531a4cf","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/00384f6c30a75c7618456af7c6cec6b6"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/a8ce80d6-0c43-4d87-9f8f-51789531a4cf/resource/6ce6c958-76bc-4366-8be4-33b4d15b0312"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/a8ce80d6-0c43-4d87-9f8f-51789531a4cf/resource/962b45b2-347f-4de1-83bd-d2baf496bf7f"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/a8ce80d6-0c43-4d87-9f8f-51789531a4cf/resource/bc6061d5-9324-45ff-841c-b96018e370b8"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/a8ce80d6-0c43-4d87-9f8f-51789531a4cf/resource/c634d440-a0bb-41d9-8903-1ff2402bf4fb"}],"dcat:keyword":["GIS","Malmö stad","PM10","geodata","karta","luftförorening","luftföroreningar","map","partiklar"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENVI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/BIENNIAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Beregnede koncentrationer af partikler med en størrelse på mindre end 10 µm\nberegnet som mikrogram/m3 i 2 meters højde over jorden. Partiklerne stammer\nfra forbrænding og hvirvlet støv, såsom dækaffald, saltpartikler,\njordpartikler og vejmateriale. En stor del af de partikler, der findes i\nluften, stammer fra Nordvesteuropa. Beregningens opløsning er 50x50 meter og\ner baseret på vejret og emissionerne i løbet af hvert år.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Calculated concentrations of particles with a size of less than 10 µm\ncalculated as micrograms/m3 at 2 meters above ground. The particles originate\nfrom combustion and swirled dust, such as tire debris, salt particles, soil\nparticles and road material. A large part of the particles found in the air\noriginates in northwestern Europe. The resolution of the calculation is 50x50\nmeters and is based on the weather and emissions during each year.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Beräknade halter av partiklar med storlek mindre än 10 µm beräknat som mikrogram/m3 vid 2 meter ovan mark. Partiklarna har ursprung från förbränning samt uppvirvlat stoft, så som däcksrester, saltpartiklar, jordpartiklar och vägmaterial. En stor del av partiklar som finns i luften har sitt ursprung i nordvästeuropa. Upplösningen på beräkningen är 50x50 meter och baseras på vädret och utsläppen under respektive år.\n"}],"dct:identifier":"a8ce80d6-0c43-4d87-9f8f-51789531a4cf","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-05-12"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-05-22T11:03:00.523817"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:68cbc3746528347d8911423c773ee16a69a634a2a5b5dd6b01a85e7f71346e5a_b3n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Luftbårne partikler - PM10"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Airborne particles - PM10"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Luftburna partiklar - PM10"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/a8ce80d6-0c43-4d87-9f8f-51789531a4cf/resource/6ce6c958-76bc-4366-8be4-33b4d15b0312","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/a8ce80d6-0c43-4d87-9f8f-51789531a4cf/resource/6ce6c958-76bc-4366-8be4-33b4d15b0312/download/pm10_ar_2021_p.geojson"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"6974646"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"PM 10 år 2021\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"PM 10 years 2021\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"PM 10 år 2021"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2023-05-12T11:36:21.826840"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-05-13T17:39:36.083823"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"PM 10 år 2021"},{"@language":"en","@value":"PM 10 years 2021"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"PM 10 år 2021"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:68cbc3746528347d8911423c773ee16a69a634a2a5b5dd6b01a85e7f71346e5a_b1n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/a8ce80d6-0c43-4d87-9f8f-51789531a4cf/resource/962b45b2-347f-4de1-83bd-d2baf496bf7f","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/a8ce80d6-0c43-4d87-9f8f-51789531a4cf/resource/962b45b2-347f-4de1-83bd-d2baf496bf7f/download/pm10_ar_2023_p.geojson"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"2188233"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":""}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/GEOJSON"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-05-22T11:02:25.296005"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-05-22T11:02:36.667159"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"PM 10 år 2023"},{"@language":"en","@value":"PM 10 years 2023"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"PM 10 år 2023"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/a8ce80d6-0c43-4d87-9f8f-51789531a4cf/resource/bc6061d5-9324-45ff-841c-b96018e370b8","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/a8ce80d6-0c43-4d87-9f8f-51789531a4cf/resource/bc6061d5-9324-45ff-841c-b96018e370b8/download/pm10.sld"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"11016"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Stilisering\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Stylization\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stilsättning"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/XML"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2023-05-12T11:35:25.517438"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-05-22T11:02:25.281856"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Stilisering"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Stylization"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stilsättning"}],"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:68cbc3746528347d8911423c773ee16a69a634a2a5b5dd6b01a85e7f71346e5a_b2n0"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/a8ce80d6-0c43-4d87-9f8f-51789531a4cf/resource/c634d440-a0bb-41d9-8903-1ff2402bf4fb","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/a8ce80d6-0c43-4d87-9f8f-51789531a4cf/resource/c634d440-a0bb-41d9-8903-1ff2402bf4fb/download/pm10_ar_2025_p.geojson"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"1046332"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":""}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/GEOJSON"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-05-22T11:02:51.556480"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-05-22T11:03:00.536078"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"PM 10 år 2025"},{"@language":"en","@value":"PM 10 years 2025"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"PM 10 år 2025"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:68cbc3746528347d8911423c773ee16a69a634a2a5b5dd6b01a85e7f71346e5a"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:69c17dc1c3547d98a6e619b782c6b79cbfc7d0c2dcffa9d2a37e1eb0822c12af_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"af1ef9959ed2cd909af63b4d59835da3"},{"@id":"_:69c17dc1c3547d98a6e619b782c6b79cbfc7d0c2dcffa9d2a37e1eb0822c12af_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Karl McShane","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:karl.mcshane@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/6ca294e4-48fe-4c7d-88f5-e66369ee3986","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/6ca294e4-48fe-4c7d-88f5-e66369ee3986/resource/094852a3-da4b-44c8-b2a1-379d92c748f9"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/6ca294e4-48fe-4c7d-88f5-e66369ee3986/resource/8f5225f3-602f-44b3-a9e2-2f14dccd6a7f"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Vises som et gennemsnit af den årlige indkomst for beboere i området. Består\naf indkomst fra beskæftigelse og erhvervsaktiviteter samt overskydende\nkapital. Tallene viser bruttoindkomst. Ud over lønindkomst omfatter indkomst\nfra beskæftigelse også indkomst fra pensioner, sygedagpenge og anden\nskattepligtig kompensation. Bemærk, at indkomst, der kun beskattes i udlandet,\nikke er inkluderet. Dette vedrører f.eks. dem, der arbejder i Danmark; deres\nindkomst er ikke inkluderet i statistikken. Tallene er vist i løbende priser,\nhvilket betyder, at de ikke er inflationsjusterede. Vist for gruppen 20-64\n(dvs. både erhvervsaktive og ikke-erhvervsaktive). Variablen er opdelt efter\nkøn. Data fra Indkomst- og Skatteregisteret (IoT).\n\n**Variabelbeskrivelse**  \nDu finder det\n[her](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**API'er**  \nVed at bruge API-kaldet\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics_\nkan du hente alle datasæt, der indeholder statistiske data for Malmøs områder,\ni JSON-format.  \nI hver forekomst af result/results i JSON-resultatet er der en \"id\"-egenskab\nfor hver ressource. Værdien af ​​\"id\" kan bruges til at hente dataene for den\nrespektive statistikvariabel (i henhold til værdien af ​​egenskaben \"name\").\nAPI-kald til at hente statistikdataene:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-\nværdi]_\n\nBrug gerne tallene, men angiv \"Bykontoret, Malmö Kommune\" som kilde.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Shows as an average of the annual income for residents in the area. Consists\nof income from employment and business activities as well as surplus capital.\nThe figures show gross income. In addition to salary income, income from\nemployment also includes income from pensions, sickness benefits and other\ntaxable compensation. Note that income that is only taxed abroad is not\nincluded. This concerns, for example, those who work in Denmark; their income\nis not included in the statistics. The figures are shown in current prices,\nwhich means that they are not inflation-adjusted. Shown for the group 20–64\n(i.e. both gainfully employed and non-gainfully employed). The variable is\nbroken down by gender. Data from the Income and Tax Register (IoT).\n\n**Variable description**  \nYou find it\n[here](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**APIs**  \nUsing the API call\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics,_\nyou can retrieve all data sets that contain statistical data for Malmö's areas\nin JSON format.  \nIn each instance of result/results in the JSON result, there is an \"id\"\nproperty for each resource. The value of \"id\" can be used to retrieve the data\nfor the respective statistics variable (according to the value of the \"name\"\nproperty). API call to retrieve the statistics data:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id\nvalue]_\n\nFeel free to use the numbers, but cite “City Office, Malmö City” as the\nsource.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visar som ett genomsnitt av årsinkomsten för boende i området. Består av inkomst av tjänst och näringsverksamhet samt överskott av kapital.  Siffrorna visar bruttoinkomst. I inkomst av tjänst ingår förutom löneinkomst även inkomst från pension, sjukpenning och andra skattepliktiga ersättningar. Notera att inkomster som bara beskattas utomlands inte finns med. Detta berör t.ex. de som arbetare i Danmark; deras inkomster räknas ingår inte i statistiken. Siffrorna visas i löpande priser vilket betyder att de inte är inflationsjusterade. Visas för gruppen 20–64 (alltså både förvärvsarbetande och icke-förvärvsarbetande).  Variabeln finns uppdelad på kön. Data från Inkomst- och taxeringsregistret (IoT).\n\n__Variabelbeskrivning__  \nHittar du [här](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)!  \n                     \n__API__  \nMed hjälp av API-anropet *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistik* får man i JSON-format fram samtliga datamängder som innehåller statistikunderlag för Malmös områden.  \nI varje instans av result/results i JSON-resultatet finns för varje resurs en egenskap \"id\". Värdet för \"id\" kan användas för att hämta datan för respektive statistikvariabel (enligt värdet för egenskapen \"name\").\nAPI-anrop för att hämta statistikdatan: *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-värdet]*   \n\nAnvänd gärna siffrorna, men ange “Stadskontoret, Malmö stad” som källa."}],"dct:identifier":"6ca294e4-48fe-4c7d-88f5-e66369ee3986","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-16"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:06:18.514027"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:69c17dc1c3547d98a6e619b782c6b79cbfc7d0c2dcffa9d2a37e1eb0822c12af_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Samlet arbejds- og kapitalindkomst 2007-2019 - Statistiske data for Malmøs områder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Total earned and capital income 2007-2019 - Statistical data for Malmö's areas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Summa förvärvs- och kapitalinkomst 2007-2019 - Statistikunderlag för Malmös områden"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/6ca294e4-48fe-4c7d-88f5-e66369ee3986/resource/094852a3-da4b-44c8-b2a1-379d92c748f9","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/6ca294e4-48fe-4c7d-88f5-e66369ee3986/resource/094852a3-da4b-44c8-b2a1-379d92c748f9/download/summa-forvarvs-och-kapitalinkomst-2007-2019.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"550121"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmö statistik - Samlet arbejds- og kapitalindkomst 2007-2019\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Total earned and capital income 2007-2019\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Summa förvärvs- och kapitalinkomst 2007-2019"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2024-08-22T07:56:41.752913"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:06:18.531992"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Samlet arbejds- og kapitalindkomst 2007-2019"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Total earned and capital income 2007-2019"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Summa förvärvs- och kapitalinkomst 2007-2019"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:69c17dc1c3547d98a6e619b782c6b79cbfc7d0c2dcffa9d2a37e1eb0822c12af_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/6ca294e4-48fe-4c7d-88f5-e66369ee3986/resource/8f5225f3-602f-44b3-a9e2-2f14dccd6a7f","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/action/datastore_search?resource_id=094852a3-da4b-44c8-b2a1-379d92c748f9"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmö statistik - Samlet arbejds- og kapitalindkomst 2007-2019\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Total earned and capital income 2007-2019\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Summa förvärvs- och kapitalinkomst 2007-2019"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2024-08-22T07:56:42.660678"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-01T11:11:52.852060"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Samlet arbejds- og kapitalindkomst 2007-2019"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Total earned and capital income 2007-2019"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Summa förvärvs- och kapitalinkomst 2007-2019"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:69c17dc1c3547d98a6e619b782c6b79cbfc7d0c2dcffa9d2a37e1eb0822c12af"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:6a2736921e632a2cb32ec9ce4a962e77ad6c46e0048a84a58c5dcb48eb9416df_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"d3ea7f5b4f9f0a66c8ed0922d6a6fb3e"},{"@id":"_:6a2736921e632a2cb32ec9ce4a962e77ad6c46e0048a84a58c5dcb48eb9416df_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Karl McShane","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:karl.mcshane@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/2e9db5bb-c90b-49e3-b791-09d791a6ed5d","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/2e9db5bb-c90b-49e3-b791-09d791a6ed5d/resource/21ed857b-232d-44dc-b6f8-acd1e8095b44"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/2e9db5bb-c90b-49e3-b791-09d791a6ed5d/resource/32cd5980-fc7b-4ba5-965c-e5a735ca5434"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Viser antallet af beboere i hvert område med en videregående uddannelse.\nUddannelsesniveauet angiver det formelle niveau for hver enkelt persons\nhøjeste fuldførte uddannelse. Der er fire kategorier: \"Førgymnasial\nuddannelse\" omfatter op til 9 års førgymnasial uddannelse. \"Gymnasial\nuddannelse\" omfatter både nutidens 3-årige uddannelser og kortere gymnasiale\nuddannelser. Den tredje kategori, \"Eftergymnasial uddannelse\", omfatter dem,\nder har en videregående uddannelse uanset længde, inklusive dem med en\ndoktorgrad. Den sidste kategori \"Andet\" omfatter de personer, for hvilke der\nmangler data, og dem, der ikke er inkluderet i uddannelsesregisteret.\nOpdelingen er baseret på kategorierne i SUN2000. Gælder for befolkningen\n20-64. Variablen er opdelt efter køn. Data fra Statistiska Centralbyråns\nuddannelsesregister (UREG).\n\n**Variabelbeskrivelse**  \nDu finder det\n[her](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**API'er**  \nVed at bruge API-kaldet\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics_\nkan du hente alle datasæt, der indeholder statistiske data for Malmøs områder,\ni JSON-format.  \nI hver forekomst af result/results i JSON-resultatet er der en \"id\"-egenskab\nfor hver ressource. Værdien af ​​\"id\" kan bruges til at hente dataene for den\nrespektive statistikvariabel (i henhold til værdien af ​​egenskaben \"name\").\nAPI-kald til at hente statistikdataene:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-\nværdi]_\n\nBrug gerne tallene, men angiv \"Bykontoret, Malmö Kommune\" som kilde.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Shows the number of residents in each area with a post-secondary education\nlevel. Education level indicates the formal level of each individual's highest\ncompleted education. There are four categories: \"Pre-secondary education\"\nincludes up to 9 years of pre-secondary education. \"Upper secondary education\"\nincludes both today's 3-year programs and shorter upper secondary programs.\nThe third category, \"Post-secondary education\" includes those who have a post-\nsecondary education regardless of length, including those with a doctoral\ndegree. The last category \"Other\" includes those individuals for whom data is\nmissing and those who are not included in the education register. The division\nis based on the categories in SUN2000. Applies to the population 20–64. The\nvariable is divided by gender. Data from Statistics Sweden's education\nregister (UREG).\n\n**Variable description**  \nYou find it\n[here](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**APIs**  \nUsing the API call\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics,_\nyou can retrieve all data sets that contain statistical data for Malmö's areas\nin JSON format.  \nIn each instance of result/results in the JSON result, there is an \"id\"\nproperty for each resource. The value of \"id\" can be used to retrieve the data\nfor the respective statistics variable (according to the value of the \"name\"\nproperty). API call to retrieve the statistics data:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id\nvalue]_\n\nFeel free to use the numbers, but cite “City Office, Malmö City” as the\nsource.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visar antalet invånare i varje område efterutbildningsnivå. Utbildningsnivå anger den formella nivån på respektive individs högsta avslutade utbildning. Det finns fyra kategorier: ”Förgymnasial utbildning” inkluderar upp till 9 års Förgymnasial utbildning. ”Gymnasial utbildning” inkluderar både dagens 3-åriga program och kortare gymnasieprogram. Den tredje kategorin, ”Eftergymnasial utbildning” innefattar de som har en eftergymnasial utbildning oavsett längd, inklusive de med forskarutbildning. Den sista kategorin ”Övriga” innefattar de individer där uppgifter saknas samt de som inte ingår i utbildningsregistret. Uppdelningen bygger på kategorierna i SUN2000. Gäller befolkningen 20–64. Variabeln finns uppdelad på kön. Data från SCB:s utbildningsregister (UREG).\n\n__Variabelbeskrivning__  \nHittar du [här](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)!  \n                     \n__API__  \nMed hjälp av API-anropet *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistik* får man i JSON-format fram samtliga datamängder som innehåller statistikunderlag för Malmös områden.  \nI varje instans av result/results i JSON-resultatet finns för varje resurs en egenskap \"id\". Värdet för \"id\" kan användas för att hämta datan för respektive statistikvariabel (enligt värdet för egenskapen \"name\").\nAPI-anrop för att hämta statistikdatan: *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-värdet]*   \n\nAnvänd gärna siffrorna, men ange “Stadskontoret, Malmö stad” som källa."}],"dct:identifier":"2e9db5bb-c90b-49e3-b791-09d791a6ed5d","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-16"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:03:00.200271"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:6a2736921e632a2cb32ec9ce4a962e77ad6c46e0048a84a58c5dcb48eb9416df_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Uddannelsesniveau - Statistiske data for Malmøs områder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Educational level - Statistical data for Malmö's areas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Utbildningsnivå - Statistikunderlag för Malmös områden"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/2e9db5bb-c90b-49e3-b791-09d791a6ed5d/resource/21ed857b-232d-44dc-b6f8-acd1e8095b44","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=32cd5980-fc7b-4ba5-965c-e5a735ca5434"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø statistik - Uddannelsesniveau\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Educational level\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Utbildningsnivå"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:15:25.309447"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:15:40.760775"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Uddannelsesniveau"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Education level"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Utbildningsnivå"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/2e9db5bb-c90b-49e3-b791-09d791a6ed5d/resource/32cd5980-fc7b-4ba5-965c-e5a735ca5434","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/2e9db5bb-c90b-49e3-b791-09d791a6ed5d/resource/32cd5980-fc7b-4ba5-965c-e5a735ca5434/download/utbildningsniva.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"3766010"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø statistik - Uddannelsesniveau\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Educational level\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Utbildningsnivå"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:15:20.423166"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:03:00.206990"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Uddannelsesniveau"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Education level"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Utbildningsnivå"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:6a2736921e632a2cb32ec9ce4a962e77ad6c46e0048a84a58c5dcb48eb9416df_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:6a2736921e632a2cb32ec9ce4a962e77ad6c46e0048a84a58c5dcb48eb9416df"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:6c48ae420d840e2f84535102cb348dda37db0447e53afbb3bf95d819e08999b6_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"10661de19ede99c4ce8c7f75c5e5c06f"},{"@id":"_:6c48ae420d840e2f84535102cb348dda37db0447e53afbb3bf95d819e08999b6_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Karl McShane","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:karl.mcshane@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/52c2ca0d-7930-457f-aaf4-42c939ebca2a","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/52c2ca0d-7930-457f-aaf4-42c939ebca2a/resource/69e32fb8-1403-41d9-a0f9-9a4c8d3d7b2c"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/52c2ca0d-7930-457f-aaf4-42c939ebca2a/resource/de857479-f231-4f81-830c-ba9ba3b8d133"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Viser antallet af personer opdelt efter baggrund. Statistisk Centralbyrån\ndefinerer personer med udenlandsk baggrund som dem, der er født i udlandet\neller er født i Sverige med to udenlandskfødte forældre. Andre personer har\nsvensk baggrund. Data fra Befolkningsregisteret (RTB). Tilgængelig opdelt\nefter køn. Kun personer på 20 år eller ældre. Tilgængelig opdelt efter køn.\n\n**Variabelbeskrivelse**  \nDu finder det\n[her](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**API'er**  \nVed at bruge API-kaldet\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics_\nkan du hente alle datasæt, der indeholder statistiske data for Malmøs områder,\ni JSON-format.  \nI hver forekomst af result/results i JSON-resultatet er der en \"id\"-egenskab\nfor hver ressource. Værdien af ​​\"id\" kan bruges til at hente dataene for den\nrespektive statistikvariabel (i henhold til værdien af ​​egenskaben \"name\").\nAPI-kald til at hente statistikdataene:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-\nværdi]_\n\nBrug gerne tallene, men angiv \"Bykontoret, Malmö Kommune\" som kilde.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Shows the number of people divided by background. Statistics Sweden defines\npeople with a foreign background as those who were born abroad or were born in\nSweden with two foreign-born parents. Other people have a Swedish background.\nData from the Register of Total Population (RTB). Available divided by gender.\nOnly people 20 years or older. Available divided by gender.\n\n**Variable description**  \nYou find it\n[here](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**APIs**  \nUsing the API call\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics,_\nyou can retrieve all data sets that contain statistical data for Malmö's areas\nin JSON format.  \nIn each instance of result/results in the JSON result, there is an \"id\"\nproperty for each resource. The value of \"id\" can be used to retrieve the data\nfor the respective statistics variable (according to the value of the \"name\"\nproperty). API call to retrieve the statistics data:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id\nvalue]_\n\nFeel free to use the numbers, but cite “City Office, Malmö City” as the\nsource.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visar antalet personer uppdelat efter bakgrund. SCB definierar personer med utländsk bakgrund som de som är utrikes födda eller är inrikes född med två utrikesfödda föräldrar. Övriga personer har svensk bakgrund.  Data från Registret över Totalbefolkningen (RTB). Finns uppdelat på kön.. Endast personer 20 år eller äldre. Finns uppdelat på kön.\n\n__Variabelbeskrivning__  \nHittar du [här](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)!  \n                     \n__API__  \nMed hjälp av API-anropet *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistik* får man i JSON-format fram samtliga datamängder som innehåller statistikunderlag för Malmös områden.  \nI varje instans av result/results i JSON-resultatet finns för varje resurs en egenskap \"id\". Värdet för \"id\" kan användas för att hämta datan för respektive statistikvariabel (enligt värdet för egenskapen \"name\").\nAPI-anrop för att hämta statistikdatan: *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-värdet]*   \n\nAnvänd gärna siffrorna, men ange “Stadskontoret, Malmö stad” som källa."}],"dct:identifier":"52c2ca0d-7930-457f-aaf4-42c939ebca2a","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-16"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:02:42.095898"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:6c48ae420d840e2f84535102cb348dda37db0447e53afbb3bf95d819e08999b6_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Udenlandsk baggrund, 20+ - Statistiske data for Malmøs områder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Foreign background, 20+ - Statistical data for Malmö's areas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Utländsk bakgrund, 20+ - Statistikunderlag för Malmös områden"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/52c2ca0d-7930-457f-aaf4-42c939ebca2a/resource/69e32fb8-1403-41d9-a0f9-9a4c8d3d7b2c","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/52c2ca0d-7930-457f-aaf4-42c939ebca2a/resource/69e32fb8-1403-41d9-a0f9-9a4c8d3d7b2c/download/utlandsk-bakgrund-20.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"2964084"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø statistik - Udenlandsk baggrund, 20+\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Foreign background, 20+\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Utländsk bakgrund, 20+"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2025-05-12T23:01:37.535893"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"htt