ekt. Observera: Primärkartan och dess lager är inte kompletta i alla delar av staden. Arbete med att höja kvalitén pågår ständigt, för mer information kontakta Stadsbyggnadskontoret eller via formuläret."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-11-03T13:09:14.182295"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-16T12:24:28.829218"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Detaljer om jorden"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Ground details"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Markdetaljer"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:7044f89bff9464f8274d7836e373d4c8210b3a0b14171abe63d9b583326c21b8_b7n0"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/d463475a-5dd9-4130-a97a-dc3e19f1da71/resource/a5800991-bc33-4956-9035-fd9de3c282d6","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/d463475a-5dd9-4130-a97a-dc3e19f1da71/resource/a5800991-bc33-4956-9035-fd9de3c282d6/download/ovriga.geojson"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"130646688"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Andre objekter fra det primære kort består af objekter, der udgør en\ngeografisk beskrivelse af objekter, der mangler deres egen kategori. Laget\nbestår blandt andet af objekter, der beskriver fortidsminder, broer, molearme\nog trapper. Objekterne i det andet lag er offentliggjort som linjeobjekter.\nBemærk: Det primære kort og dets lag er ikke komplette i alle dele af byen.\nArbejdet med at forbedre kvaliteten er i gang, for mere information kontakt\nByplankontoret eller via formularen.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Other objects from the primary map consist of objects that constitute a\ngeographical description of objects that lack their own category. The layer\nconsists of, among other things, objects that describe ancient remains,\nbridges, pier arms and stairs. The objects in the other layer are published as\nline objects. Please note: The primary map and its layers are not complete in\nall parts of the city. Work to improve the quality is ongoing, for more\ninformation contact the City Planning Office or via the form.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Övriga objekt från primärkartan består av objekt som utgör geografisk beskrivning av objekt som saknar sig en egen kategori. Lagret består av bl.a. objekt som beskriver fornlämningar, bryggor, pirarmar och trappor. Objekten i lagret övrigt är publicerade som linjeobjekt. Observera: Primärkartan och dess lager är inte kompletta i alla delar av staden. Arbete med att höja kvalitén pågår ständigt, för mer information kontakta Stadsbyggnadskontoret eller via formuläret."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-11-03T15:03:31.530936"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-16T12:27:23.698613"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Andre objekter"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Other objects"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Övriga objekt"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:7044f89bff9464f8274d7836e373d4c8210b3a0b14171abe63d9b583326c21b8_b8n0"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/d463475a-5dd9-4130-a97a-dc3e19f1da71/resource/d190adc8-f0d5-4501-ae5a-eb569915a3d0","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/d463475a-5dd9-4130-a97a-dc3e19f1da71/resource/d190adc8-f0d5-4501-ae5a-eb569915a3d0/download/byggnad_ovrigt.geojson"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"30349934"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Laget indeholder andre objekter knyttet til bygninger. Lagets indhold består\naf f.eks. altaner, bygningslinjer eller markeringer af bygningsdele, der er\nskjult på det primære kort. Objekterne i laget er offentliggjort som\nlinjeobjekter. Bemærk: Det primære kort og dets lag er ikke komplette i alle\ndele af byen. Arbejdet med at forbedre kvaliteten er i gang. For mere\ninformation, kontakt Byplankontoret eller via formularen.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"The layer contains other objects linked to buildings. The content of the layer\nconsists of, for example, balconies, building lines or markings of building\nparts that are obscured in the primary map. The objects in the layer are\npublished as line objects. Please note: The primary map and its layers are not\ncomplete in all parts of the city. Work to improve the quality is ongoing, for\nmore information contact the City Planning Office or via the form.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lagret innehåller övriga objekt kopplade till byggnader. Innehållet i lagret består av exempelvis balkonger, byggnadslinjer eller markeringar av byggnadsdelar som i primärkartan är skymda. Objekten i lagret är publicerade som linjeobjekt. Observera: Primärkartan och dess lager är inte kompletta i alla delar av staden. Arbete med att höja kvalitén pågår ständigt, för mer information kontakta Stadsbyggnadskontoret eller via formuläret."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2023-02-24T12:48:50.737516"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-16T12:28:22.072576"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Andre byggeprojekter"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Other buildings"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Övriga byggnadsobjekt"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:7044f89bff9464f8274d7836e373d4c8210b3a0b14171abe63d9b583326c21b8_b9n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/d463475a-5dd9-4130-a97a-dc3e19f1da71/resource/e4095d48-4730-464d-8e76-e9995d09fd0f","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/d463475a-5dd9-4130-a97a-dc3e19f1da71/resource/e4095d48-4730-464d-8e76-e9995d09fd0f/download/vegetation.geojson"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"5506859"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Vegetation fra hovedkortet består af objekter, der udgør en geografisk\nbeskrivelse af hække, skråninger osv. Objekterne i vegetation er\noffentliggjort som punktobjekter. Bemærk venligst: Hovedkortet og dets lag er\nikke komplette i alle dele af byen. Arbejdet med at forbedre kvaliteten er i\ngang, for mere information kontakt Byplankontoret eller via formularen.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Vegetation from the primary map consists of objects that constitute a\ngeographical description of hedges, slopes, etc. The objects in vegetation are\npublished as point objects. Please note: The primary map and its layers are\nnot complete in all parts of the city. Work to improve the quality is ongoing,\nfor more information contact the City Planning Office or via the form.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vegetation från primärkartan består av objekt som utgör geografisk beskrivning av häckar, slänter med mera. Objekten i vegetation är publicerade som punktobjekt. Observera: Primärkartan och dess lager är inte kompletta i alla delar av staden. Arbete med att höja kvalitén pågår ständigt, för mer information kontakta Stadsbyggnadskontoret eller via formuläret."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2023-02-24T12:58:43.482581"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-16T12:25:54.314971"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Vegetation - point"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Vegetation - points"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vegetation - punkter"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:7044f89bff9464f8274d7836e373d4c8210b3a0b14171abe63d9b583326c21b8_b10n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:7044f89bff9464f8274d7836e373d4c8210b3a0b14171abe63d9b583326c21b8"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:727a0ef316b54a663dfcc8a79008fa81c32ddfcd905b9290a9384d88e4b02034_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/39273cfc-aa1c-444a-8b72-6f27cd4a8db2","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/39273cfc-aa1c-444a-8b72-6f27cd4a8db2/resource/266d4d8d-cef7-415c-bef1-ed3c8581c687"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/EDUC"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elevernes samlede meritværdi divideret med antallet af elever, der fik en\nkarakter i mindst ét ​​fag i henhold til det mål- og vidensrelaterede\nkaraktersystem i 9. klasse.\n\nStatistik fra 2015.\n\n  * Karaktererne måles før eksamen.\n  * Dataene vedrører elever i kommunens egne skoler eller friskoler i kommunen, uanset folkeregistreringssted.\n  * Oplysningerne refererer til studieåret.\n  * I 2016 blev studerende med ukendt baggrund udelukket.\n\nMeritværdien for en studerende er summen af ​​de 17 bedste karakterer i den\nstuderendes endelige karakter (E=10, D=12,5, C=15, B=17,5 og A=20). Den\nmaksimalt mulige værdi er 340 point.\n\nKilde: Den svenske statslige skolestyrelse (Siris).\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"The students' total merit value divided by the number of students who received\na grade in at least one subject according to the goal- and knowledge-related\ngrading system in grade 9.\n\nStatistics from 2015.\n\n  * The grades are measured before the examination.\n  * The data refers to students in the municipality's own schools or independent schools in the municipality, regardless of place of population registration.\n  * The information refers to the academic year.\n  * In 2016, students with unknown backgrounds were excluded.\n\nThe credit value for a student is the sum of the 17 best grades in the\nstudent's final grade (E=10, D=12.5, C=15, B=17.5 and A=20). The maximum\npossible value is 340 points.\n\nSource: Swedish National Agency for Education (Siris).\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elevernas sammanlagda meritvärde dividerat med antal elever som fått betyg i minst ett ämne enligt det mål- och kunskapsrelaterade betygssystemet i årskurs 9. \n\nStatistik från 2015.\n\n* Betygen mäts före prövning.  \n* Uppgifterna avser elever i kommunens egna skolor eller fristående skolor i kommunen, oavsett folkbokföringsort.  \n* Uppgiften avser läsår. \n*  2016 exkluderades elever med okänd bakgrund.  \n\nMeritvärdet för en elev utgörs av summan för de 17 bästa betygen i elevens slutbetyg  (E=10, D=12.5, C=15, B=17.5 och A=20). Det möjliga maxvärdet är 340 poäng. \n\nKälla: Skolverket (Siris)."}],"dct:identifier":"39273cfc-aa1c-444a-8b72-6f27cd4a8db2","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-15"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:36:46.974085"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:727a0ef316b54a663dfcc8a79008fa81c32ddfcd905b9290a9384d88e4b02034_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elever i 9. klasse - gennemsnit af meritværdi, placeringskommune (17 fag)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Students in grade 9 - average of merit value, location municipality (17 subjects)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elever i årskurs 9 - genomsnitt av meritvärde, lägeskommun (17 ämnen)"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/39273cfc-aa1c-444a-8b72-6f27cd4a8db2/resource/266d4d8d-cef7-415c-bef1-ed3c8581c687","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N15504"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elevernes samlede meritværdi divideret med antallet af elever, der fik\nkarakterer i mindst ét ​​fag i henhold til det mål- og vidensrelaterede\nkaraktersystem i 9. klasse. Karaktererne måles før eksamen. Dataene refererer\ntil elever i kommunens egne skoler eller friskoler i kommunen, uanset\nfolkeregistreringssted. Dataene refererer til skoleåret. Meritværdien for en\nelev består af summen af ​​de 17 bedste karakterer i elevens endelige karakter\n(E=10, D=12,5, C=15, B=17,5 og A=20). Den maksimalt mulige værdi er 340 point.\nI 2016 blev elever med ukendt baggrund ekskluderet. Kilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"The students' total merit value divided by the number of students who received\ngrades in at least one subject according to the goal- and knowledge-related\ngrading system in grade 9. The grades are measured before the examination. The\ndata refers to students in the municipality's own schools or independent\nschools in the municipality, regardless of the place of population\nregistration. The data refers to the academic year. The merit value for a\nstudent consists of the sum of the 17 best grades in the student's final grade\n(E=10, D=12.5, C=15, B=17.5 and A=20). The maximum possible value is 340\npoints. In 2016, students with unknown backgrounds were excluded. Source:\nKolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elevernas sammanlagda meritvärde dividerat med antal elever som fått betyg i minst ett ämne enligt det mål- och kunskapsrelaterade betygssystemet i årskurs 9. Betygen mäts före prövning. Uppgifterna avser elever i kommunens egna skolor eller fristående skolor i kommunen, oavsett folkbokföringsort. Uppgiften avser läsår. Meritvärdet för en elev utgörs av summan för de 17 bästa betygen i elevens slutbetyg  (E=10, D=12.5, C=15, B=17.5 och A=20). Det möjliga maxvärdet är 340 poäng. 2016 exkluderades elever med okänd bakgrund. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-18T06:40:34.034602"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:36:46.978765"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elever i 9. klasse, meritværdi fordelt på kommune, gennemsnit (17 fag) (N15504)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Students in grade 9, merit value by municipality, average (17 subjects) (N15504)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elever i åk. 9, meritvärde lägeskommun, genomsnitt (17 ämnen) (N15504)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:727a0ef316b54a663dfcc8a79008fa81c32ddfcd905b9290a9384d88e4b02034"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:72f80ed6f9590652feb792eea073d59220bb06ba9b8f95aece1f352225b37864_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/906c3641-7a7b-4ab7-9c8b-d2a9608577ca","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/906c3641-7a7b-4ab7-9c8b-d2a9608577ca/resource/9cd2181c-e75a-4ebb-9166-f2615ac2b7e1"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","lön","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/GOVE"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Medianløn for kvinder ansat i kommunen i SEK (pr. måned). Al rapporteret løn\ner beregnet som en fuldtidsløn. Fuldtidsløn inkluderer grundløn plus variable\ntillæg og goder. Henviser til medarbejdere i alderen 18-66 (indtil 2013\nhenvistes der til 18-64 år), der aflønnes måneds- eller timelønnet.\nMedarbejdere i kommunalt ejede virksomheder er ikke inkluderet.\n\nKilde: Sveriges Statistik (via Kolada)\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Median salary for women employed by the municipality in SEK (per month). All\nsalary reported is calculated as a full-time salary. Full-time salary includes\nbasic salary plus variable supplements and benefits. Refers to employees aged\n18-66 (until 2013, 18-64 years old were referred to) who are paid monthly or\nhourly. Employees in municipally owned companies are not included.\n\nSource: Statistics Sweden (via Kolada)\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Medianlön för kvinnor anställda av kommunen kronor (i månaden). All lön som redovisas är uppräknad till heltidslön. I heltidslön ingår grundlön plus rörliga tillägg och förmåner. Avser anställda 18-66 år (t.o.m. 2013 avsågs 18-64 år) som är månads- eller timavlönade. Anställda i kommunägda bolag ingår inte.  \n  \nKälla: SCB (via Kolada)"}],"dct:identifier":"906c3641-7a7b-4ab7-9c8b-d2a9608577ca","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-01"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:46:34.394481"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:72f80ed6f9590652feb792eea073d59220bb06ba9b8f95aece1f352225b37864_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Medianløn for kvinder ansat i kommunen, SEK"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Median salary for women employed by the municipality, SEK"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Medianlön kvinnor anställda av kommunen, kr"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/906c3641-7a7b-4ab7-9c8b-d2a9608577ca/resource/9cd2181c-e75a-4ebb-9166-f2615ac2b7e1","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N00949"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Medianløn for kvinder ansat i kommunen i SEK (pr. måned). Al rapporteret løn\ner beregnet som en fuldtidsløn. Fuldtidsløn inkluderer grundløn plus variable\ntillæg og goder. Henviser til medarbejdere i alderen 18-66 (indtil 2013\nhenvistes der til 18-64 år), der aflønnes måneds- eller timelønnet.\nMedarbejdere i kommunalt ejede virksomheder er ikke inkluderet.\n\nKilde: Sveriges Statistik (via Kolada)\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Median salary for women employed by the municipality in SEK (per month). All\nsalary reported is calculated as a full-time salary. Full-time salary includes\nbasic salary plus variable supplements and benefits. Refers to employees aged\n18-66 (until 2013, 18-64 years old were referred to) who are paid monthly or\nhourly. Employees in municipally owned companies are not included.\n\nSource: Statistics Sweden (via Kolada)\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Medianlön för kvinnor anställda av kommunen kronor (i månaden). All lön som redovisas är uppräknad till heltidslön. I heltidslön ingår grundlön plus rörliga tillägg och förmåner. Avser anställda 18-66 år (t.o.m. 2013 avsågs 18-64 år) som är månads- eller timavlönade. Anställda i kommunägda bolag ingår inte.  \n  \nKälla: SCB (via Kolada)"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-12-01T09:13:01.918651"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:46:34.399904"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Medianløn for kvinder ansat i kommunen, SEK"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Median salary for women employed by the municipality, SEK"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Medianlön kvinnor anställda av kommunen, kr"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:72f80ed6f9590652feb792eea073d59220bb06ba9b8f95aece1f352225b37864"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:745232165eb66fece14111d5f0504f4f8a26b715c5ee98be6f69cd7f54d7f907_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/e185c11a-7c49-436b-b4a3-5ae3949573eb","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/e185c11a-7c49-436b-b4a3-5ae3949573eb/resource/9820588d-8bab-498d-9851-5f6ea16932d8"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","deceased","kolada"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Antal dødsfald i løbet af året. Statistik fra 1998.\n\nKilde: Statistiska Centralbyrån.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Number of deaths during the year. Statistics from 1998.\n\nSource: Statistics Sweden.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal döda under året. Statistik från 1998.\n\nKälla: SCB."}],"dct:identifier":"e185c11a-7c49-436b-b4a3-5ae3949573eb","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-17"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:42:45.572957"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:745232165eb66fece14111d5f0504f4f8a26b715c5ee98be6f69cd7f54d7f907_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Dødsfald, antal"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Deaths, number"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Döda, antal"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/e185c11a-7c49-436b-b4a3-5ae3949573eb/resource/9820588d-8bab-498d-9851-5f6ea16932d8","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N01805"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Antal dødsfald i løbet af året. Kilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Number of deaths during the year. Source: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal döda under året. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-22T05:45:31.040252"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:42:45.577862"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Dødsfald, antal (N01805)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Deaths, number (N01805)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Döda, antal (N01805)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:745232165eb66fece14111d5f0504f4f8a26b715c5ee98be6f69cd7f54d7f907"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:75d105113e70bca197e10c27c911aeffe612b9e780c9d74b823412f9053eab55_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"_:75d105113e70bca