value":"Geographic statistical areas EPSG4326 (JSON)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Geografiska statistikområden EPSG4326 (JSON)"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:96d5f0e48f9a06e3d2eb95be80ea565d3d1d9ce73b74708654553f104aa76d07_b4n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:96d5f0e48f9a06e3d2eb95be80ea565d3d1d9ce73b74708654553f104aa76d07"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:9707c4dfe988ee4d0e3c00ab82421c90d1cd29b1ce763299a7bc67893b2e919a_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/7da8f554-94b5-447a-8b7b-e4c175348a98","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/7da8f554-94b5-447a-8b7b-e4c175348a98/resource/1b731431-d941-4be4-b4f8-a719d8196abd"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/EDUC"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Antal elever, der var registreret i kommunen, som afsluttede gymnasiet og som\nblev indskrevet som førsteårsstuderende på universitet eller højere\nlæreanstalt i samme år, inklusive introduktionsprogrammet. Dette tal er\nderefter divideret med antallet af elever, der var registreret i kommunen, som\nafsluttede gymnasiet i løbet af året, inklusive introduktionsprogrammet.\n\nKilde: Statistiska Centralbyrån.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Number of students who were registered in the municipality who completed upper\nsecondary school and who registered as freshmen at university or college\nduring the same year, including the Introduction Program. This number has then\nbeen divided by the number of students who were registered in the municipality\nwho completed upper secondary school during the year, including the\nIntroduction Program.\n\nSource: Statistics Sweden.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal elever som var folkbokförda i kommunen som avslutat gymnasium och som registrerade sig som nybörjare på universitet eller högskola under samma år, inklusive Introduktionsprogram. Detta antalet har sedan dividerats med antal elever som var folkbokförda i kommunen som avslutat gymnasium under året, inklusive Introduktionsprogrammet. \n\nKälla: SCB."}],"dct:identifier":"7da8f554-94b5-447a-8b7b-e4c175348a98","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-15"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:30:54.965715"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:9707c4dfe988ee4d0e3c00ab82421c90d1cd29b1ce763299a7bc67893b2e919a_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Studerende, der gik direkte på universitet/gymnasium efter endt gymnasial uddannelse, hjemkommune"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Students who went directly to university/college after completing upper secondary education, home municipality"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elever som direkt gått till universitet/högskola efter avslutad gymnasieutbildning, hemkommun"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/7da8f554-94b5-447a-8b7b-e4c175348a98/resource/1b731431-d941-4be4-b4f8-a719d8196abd","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N17502"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Antal elever, der var registreret i kommunen som havende afsluttet gymnasiet\nog som var indskrevet som førsteårsstuderende på universitet eller højere\nlæreanstalt i samme år, inkl. IM, divideret med antallet af elever, der var\nregistreret i kommunen som havende afsluttet gymnasiet i løbet af året, inkl.\nIM. Kilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Number of students who were registered in the municipality as having completed\nupper secondary school and who registered as freshmen at university or college\nduring the same year, incl. IM divided by the number of students who were\nregistered in the municipality as having completed upper secondary school\nduring the year, incl. IM. Source: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal elever som var folkbokförda i kommunen som avslutat gymnasium och som registrerade sig som nybörjare på universitet eller högskola under samma år, inkl. IM dividerat med antal elever som var folkbokförda i kommunen som avslutat gymnasium under året, inkl. IM. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-18T06:38:00.429665"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:30:54.973990"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Gymnasieelever, der overgik til universitet/gymnasium direkte efter endt gymnasial uddannelse, hjemkommune, andel (%) (N17502)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Upper secondary school students who transferred to university/college directly after completing upper secondary education, home municipality, proportion (%) (N17502)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gymnasieelever som gått över till universitet/högskola direkt efter avslutad gymnasieutbildning, hemkommun, andel (%) (N17502)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:9707c4dfe988ee4d0e3c00ab82421c90d1cd29b1ce763299a7bc67893b2e919a"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:98fd18f95e6e7f03142c260ee36a1c30accab973d27835336b129f70687ae10d_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"702cebc08cfc969b419959b7f10fbcf0"},{"@id":"_:98fd18f95e6e7f03142c260ee36a1c30accab973d27835336b129f70687ae10d_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Karl McShane","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:karl.mcshane@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/9aee7c16-3ee6-4cf4-9924-115a5a322c5e","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/9aee7c16-3ee6-4cf4-9924-115a5a322c5e/resource/a4e00f65-6b68-4cc9-98e2-d04c7b0357c0"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/9aee7c16-3ee6-4cf4-9924-115a5a322c5e/resource/b9321d53-d57e-4852-8b81-f9989152ee75"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Viser andelen af ​​erhvervsaktive personer blandt befolkningen i området i\nalderen 20-64 år. Fra og med referenceåret 2019 bruger SCB en ny datakilde og\nmetode til at klassificere erhvervsaktive personer i RAMS. Ændringen i kilde\nog metode betyder, at sammenligninger af statistikker for 2019 og tidligere\nreferenceår skal foretages med stor forsigtighed. Fra og med 2019 er dataene\nbaseret på data fra de såkaldte arbejdsgiverdeklarationer på individniveau\n(AGI). Hvis personen modtog en løn i november, der overstiger 99 SEK,\nklassificeres personen som erhvervsaktiv. For selvstændige klassificeres, som\ntidligere, de, der har deklareret aktiv erhvervsaktivitet i referenceåret, som\nerhvervsaktive. Selv de, der er midlertidigt fraværende fra en beskæftigelse i\nmåleperioden, f.eks. på grund af sygdom, tælles som erhvervsaktive. Læs mere\npå SCB.se. Vist for aldersgruppen 20-64 år. Data fra SCB RAMS\n(“Registerbaseret arbejdsmarkedsstatistik”).\n\n**Variabelbeskrivelse**  \nDu finder det\n[her](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**API'er**  \nVed at bruge API-kaldet\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics_\nkan du hente alle datasæt, der indeholder statistiske data for Malmøs områder,\ni JSON-format.  \nI hver forekomst af result/results i JSON-resultatet er der en \"id\"-egenskab\nfor hver ressource. Værdien af ​​\"id\" kan bruges til at hente dataene for den\nrespektive statistikvariabel (i henhold til værdien af ​​egenskaben \"name\").\nAPI-kald til at hente statistikdataene:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-\nværdi]_\n\nBrug gerne tallene, men angiv \"Bykontoret, Malmö Kommune\" som kilde.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Shows the proportion of gainfully employed people among the population in the\narea aged 20–64. Starting with the reference year 2019, SCB uses a new data\nsource and method to classify gainfully employed people in RAMS. The change in\nsource and method means that comparisons of statistics for 2019 and previous\nreference years must be made with great caution. From 2019 onwards, the data\nis based on data from the so-called employer declarations at the individual\nlevel (AGI). If the person received a salary in November that exceeds SEK 99,\nthe person is classified as gainfully employed. For self-employed people, as\nbefore, those who have declared active business activity during the reference\nyear are classified as gainfully employed. Even those who are temporarily\nabsent from an employment during the measurement period, e.g. due to illness,\nare counted as gainfully employed. Read more at SCB.se. Shown for the age\nrange 20–64. Data from SCB RAMS (“Register-based labor market statistics”).\n\n**Variable description**  \nYou find it\n[here](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**APIs**  \nUsing the API call\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics,_\nyou can retrieve all data sets that contain statistical data for Malmö's areas\nin JSON format.  \nIn each instance of result/results in the JSON result, there is an \"id\"\nproperty for each resource. The value of \"id\" can be used to retrieve the data\nfor the respective statistics variable (according to the value of the \"name\"\nproperty). API call to retrieve the statistics data:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id\nvalue]_\n\nFeel free to use the numbers, but cite “City Office, Malmö City” as the\nsource.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visar andelen förvärvsarbetande bland befolkning i området i åldrarna 20–64 år. Från och med referensår 2019 använder SCB en ny datakälla och metod för att klassificera förvärvsarbetande i RAMS. Bytet av källa och metod innebär att jämförelser av statistik avseende 2019 och tidigare referensår måste göras med stor försiktighet. Datan är från och med 2019 baserad på data från det så kallade arbetsgivardeklarationerna på individnivå (AGI). Har personen fått en lön i november som överstiger 99 kronor klassificeras personen som förvärvsarbetande. För egenföretagare gäller, liksom tidigare, att de personer som under referensåret har deklarerat för aktiv näringsverksamhet klassificeras som förvärvsarbetande. Även de som är tillfälligt frånvarande från en anställning under mätperioden, t.ex. p.g.a. sjukdom, räknas som förvärvsarbetande. Läs mer på SCB.se. Visas för åldersspannet 20–64. Data från SCB RAMS (”Registerbaserad arbetsmarknadsstatistik”). \n\n__Variabelbeskrivning__  \nHittar du [här](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)!  \n                     \n__API__  \nMed hjälp av API-anropet *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistik* får man i JSON-format fram samtliga datamängder som innehåller statistikunderlag för Malmös områden.  \nI varje instans av result/results i JSON-resultatet finns för varje resurs en egenskap \"id\". Värdet för \"id\" kan användas för att hämta datan för respektive statistikvariabel (enligt värdet för egenskapen \"name\").\nAPI-anrop för att hämta statistikdatan: *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-värdet]*   \n\nAnvänd gärna siffrorna, men ange “Stadskontoret, Malmö stad” som källa."}],"dct:identifier":"9aee7c16-3ee6-4cf4-9924-115a5a322c5e","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-16"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:05:17.351550"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:98fd18f95e6e7f03142c260ee36a1c30accab973d27835336b129f70687ae10d_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Erhvervsrate, 2019-2021 - Statistiske data for Malmøs områder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Acquisition rate, 2019 - 2021 - Statistical data for Malmö's areas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förvärvsgrad, 2019 - 2021 - Statistikunderlag för Malmös områden"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/9aee7c16-3ee6-4cf4-9924-115a5a322c5e/resource/a4e00f65-6b68-4cc9-98e2-d04c7b0357c0","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/9aee7c16-3ee6-4cf4-9924-115a5a322c5e/resource/a4e00f65-6b68-4cc9-98e2-d04c7b0357c0/download/forvarvsgrad-2019-2021.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"133535"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmö statistik - Erhvervsrate, 2019-2021\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Acquisition rate, 2019 - 2021\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Förvärvsgrad, 2019 - 2021"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2024-08-22T07:56:23.054981"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:05:17.373238"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Erhvervsrate, 2019-2021"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Acquisition rate, 2019 - 2021"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förvärvsgrad, 2019 - 2021"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:98fd18f95e6e7f03142c260ee36a1c30accab973d27835336b129f70687ae10d_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/9aee7c16-3ee6-4cf4-9924-115a5a322c5e/resource/b9321d53-d57e-4852-8b81-f9989152ee75","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/action/datastore_search?resource_id=a4e00f65-6b68-4cc9-98e2-d04c7b0357c0"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmö statistik - Erhvervsrate, 2019-2021\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Acquisition rate, 2019 - 2021\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Förvärvsgrad, 2019 - 2021"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2024-08-22T07:56:24.603290"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-01T11:10:54.073605"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Erhvervsrate, 2019-2021"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Acquisition rate, 2019 - 2021"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förvärvsgrad, 2019 - 2021"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:98fd18f95e6e7f03142c260ee36a1c30accab973d27835336b129f70687ae10d"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:9a85160473ea1b8a442ebb5aae91aaba41dca6bf1da294e801bfd7175393be8b_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"7507eb1a03bfe904df5d2e0f41b01e2c"},{"@id":"_:9a85160473ea1b8a442ebb5aae91aaba41dca6bf1da294e801bfd7175393be8b_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Karl McShane","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:karl.mcshane@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/e743f22a-b01d-474f-9a8c-3edbf518f090","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/e743f22a-b01d-474f-9a8c-3edbf518f090/resource/1288d08e-4bab-4db9-94cf-144446ad0d00"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/e743f22a-b01d-474f-9a8c-3edbf518f090/resource/d6e6319a-bfdf-4f00-9c72-befa6918e910"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Viser enten et gennemsnit eller en median af den årlige indkomst for beboere i\nområdet. Består af indkomst fra beskæftigelse og indkomst fra\nerhvervsaktiviteter. Tallene viser bruttoindkomst. Ud over lønindkomst\nomfatter indkomst fra beskæftigelse også indkomst fra pensioner, sygedagpenge\nog anden skattepligtig kompensation. Bemærk, at indkomst, der kun beskattes i\nudlandet, ikke er inkluderet. Dette påvirker f.eks. dem, der arbejder i\nDanmark; deres indkomst er ikke inkluderet i statistikken. Tallene er vist i\nløbende priser, hvilket betyder, at de ikke er inflationsjusterede. Vist for\ngruppen af ​​erhvervsaktive 20-64 år. Variablen er opdelt efter køn. Data fra\nIndkomst- og Skatteregisteret (IoT).\n\n**Variabelbeskrivelse**  \nDu finder det\n[her](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**API'er**  \nVed at bruge API-kaldet\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics_\nkan du hente alle datasæt, der indeholder statistiske data for Malmøs områder,\ni JSON-format.  \nI hver forekomst af result/results i JSON-resultatet er der en \"id\"-egenskab\nfor hver ressource. Værdien af ​​\"id\" kan bruges til at hente dataene for den\nrespektive statistikvariabel (i henhold til værdien af ​​egenskaben \"name\").\nAPI-kald for at hente statistikdataene:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-\nværdi]_\n\nBrug gerne tallene, men angiv \"Bykontoret, Malmö Kommune\" som kilde.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Shows either an average or median of the annual income for residents in the\narea. Consists of income from employment and income from business activities.\nThe figures show gross income. In addition to salary income, income from\nemployment also includes income from pensions, sickness benefits and other\ntaxable compensation. Note that income that is only taxed abroad is not\nincluded. This affects, for example, those who work in Denmark; their income\nis not included in the statistics. The figures are shown in current prices,\nwhich means that they are not inflation-adjusted. Shown for the group of\ngainfully employed 20–64. The variable is broken down by gender. Data from the\nIncome and Tax Register (IoT).\n\n**Variable description**  \nYou find it\n[here](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**APIs**  \nUsing the API call\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics,_\nyou can retrieve all data sets that contain statistical data for Malmö's areas\nin JSON format.  \nIn each instance of result/results in the JSON result, there is an \"id\"\nproperty for each resource. The value of \"id\" can be used to retrieve the data\nfor the respective statistics variable (according to the value of the \"name\"\nproperty). API call to retrieve the statistics data:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id\nvalue]_\n\nFeel free to use the numbers, but cite “City Office, Malmö City” as the\nsource.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visar antingen som ett genomsnitt eller median av årsinkomsten för boende i området. Består av inkomst av tjänst och inkomst av näringsverksamhet. Siffrorna visar bruttoinkomst. I inkomst av tjänst ingår förutom löneinkomst även inkomst från pension, sjukpenning och andra skattepliktiga ersättningar. Notera att inkomster som bara beskattas utomlands inte finns med. Detta berör t.ex. de som arbetar i Danmark; deras inkomster räknas ingår inte i statistiken. Siffrorna visas i löpande priser vilket betyder att de inte är inflationsjusterade. Visas för gruppen förvärvsarbetande 20–64. Variabeln finns uppdelad på kön. Data från Inkomst- och taxeringsregistret (IoT).\n\n__Variabelbeskrivning__  \nHittar du [här](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)!  \n                     \n__API__  \nMed hjälp av API-anropet *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistik* får man i JSON-format fram samtliga datamängder som innehåller statistikunderlag för Malmös områden.  \nI varje instans av result/results i JSON-resultatet finns för varje resurs en egenskap \"id\". Värdet för \"id\" kan användas för att hämta datan för respektive statistikvariabel (enligt värdet för egenskapen \"name\").\nAPI-anrop för att hämta statistikdatan: *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-värdet]*   \n\nAnvänd gärna siffrorna, men ange “Stadskontoret, Malmö stad” som källa."}],"dct:identifier":"e743f22a-b01d-474f-9a8c-3edbf518f090","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-16"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:05:47.959428"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:9a85160473ea1b8a442ebb5aae91aaba41dca6bf1da294e801bfd7175393be8b_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Arbejdsindkomst blandt erhvervsaktive 2007-2019 - Statistiske data for Malmøs områder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Earned income among gainfully employed people 2007-2019 - Statistical data for Malmö's areas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förvärvsinkomst bland förvärvsarbetande 2007-2019 - Statistikunderlag för Malmös områden"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/e743f22a-b01d-474f-9a8c-3edbf518f090/resource/1288d08e-4bab-4db9-94cf-144446ad0d00","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=d6e6319a-bfdf-4f00-9c72-befa6918e910"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmö-statistik - Arbejdsindkomst blandt erhvervsaktive 2007-2019\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Earned income among gainfully employed people 2007-2019\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Förvärvsinkomst bland förvärvsarbetande 2007-2019"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:19:13.874512"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:19:19.291585"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Arbejdsindkomst blandt erhvervsaktive 2007-2019"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Earned income among gainfully employed people 2007-2019"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förvärvsinkomst bland förvärvsarbetande 2007-2019"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/e743f22a-b01d-474f-9a8c-3edbf518f090/resource/d6e6319a-bfdf-4f00-9c72-befa6918e910","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/e743f22a-b01d-474f-9a8c-3edbf518f090/resource/d6e6319a-bfdf-4f00-9c72-befa6918e910/download/forvarvsinkomst-bland-forvarvsarbetande-2007-2019.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"731687"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmö-statistik - Arbejdsindkomst blandt erhvervsaktive 2007-2019\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Earned income among gainfully employed people 2007-2019\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Förvärvsinkomst bland förvärvsarbetande 2007-2019"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:19:08.387621"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:05:47.980039"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Arbejdsindkomst blandt erhvervsaktive 2007-2019"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Earned income among gainfully employed people 2007-2019"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förvärvsinkomst bland förvärvsarbetande 2007-2019"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:9a85160473ea1b8a442ebb5aae91aaba41dca6bf1da294e801bfd7175393be8b_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:9a85160473ea1b8a442ebb5aae91aaba41dca6bf1da294e801bfd7175393be8b"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:9f55b39f80ff9047c58bc180c1ce30e81f534c1ee4c80500ed085a18ea8facd3_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"867811fc43bdcb44cd2c73ee73b4228c"},{"@id":"_:9f55b39f80ff9047c58bc180c1ce30e81f534c1ee4c80500ed085a18ea8facd3_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Karl McShane","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:karl.mcshane@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/1c0b59f7-116e-4a18-8098-bb0950ca4cb3","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/1c0b59f7-116e-4a18-8098-bb0950ca4cb3/resource/1b659379-313e-4c5b-8f29-4f1cf236d038"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/1c0b59f7-116e-4a18-8098-bb0950ca4cb3/resource/df0a0cfe-5d8a-47cb-bcfc-90b745bcd8ae"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Viser antallet af personer, der bor i området og er klassificeret som\nerhvervsaktive. Fra og med referenceåret 2019 bruger SCB en ny datakilde og\nmetode til at klassificere erhvervsaktive i RAMS. Ændringen i kilde og metode\nbetyder, at sammenligninger af statistikker for 2019 og tidligere referenceår\nskal foretages med stor forsigtighed. Fra og med 2019 er dataene baseret på\ndata fra de såkaldte arbejdsgiverdeklarationer på individniveau (AGI). Hvis\npersonen modtog en løn i november, der overstiger 99 SEK, klassificeres\npersonen som erhvervsaktiv. For selvstændige klassificeres de, der har\ndeklareret aktiv erhvervsaktivitet i referenceåret, som tidligere, som\nerhvervsaktive. Selv de, der er midlertidigt fraværende fra en beskæftigelse i\nmåleperioden, f.eks. på grund af sygdom, tælles som erhvervsaktive. Læs mere\npå SCB.se. Vist for aldersgruppen 20-64. Data fra SCB RAMS (“Registerbaseret\narbejdsmarkedsstatistik”).\n\n**Variabelbeskrivelse**  \nDu finder det\n[her](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**API'er**  \nVed at bruge API-kaldet\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics_\nkan du hente alle datasæt, der indeholder statistiske data for Malmøs områder,\ni JSON-format.  \nI hver forekomst af result/results i JSON-resultatet er der en \"id\"-egenskab\nfor hver ressource. Værdien af ​​\"id\" kan bruges til at hente dataene for den\nrespektive statistikvariabel (i henhold til værdien af ​​egenskaben \"name\").\nAPI-kald til at hente statistikdataene:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-\nværdi]_\n\nBrug gerne tallene, men angiv \"Bykontoret, Malmö Kommune\" som kilde.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Shows the number of individuals living in the area and classified as gainfully\nemployed. Starting with the reference year 2019, SCB uses a new data source\nand method to classify gainfully employed in RAMS. The change in source and\nmethod means that comparisons of statistics for 2019 and previous reference\nyears must be made with great caution. From 2019 onwards, the data is based on\ndata from the so-called employer declarations at individual level (AGI). If\nthe person received a salary in November that exceeds SEK 99, the person is\nclassified as gainfully employed. For self-employed persons, as before, those\nwho have declared active business activity during the reference year are\nclassified as gainfully employed. Even those who are temporarily absent from\nan employment during the measurement period, e.g. due to illness, are counted\nas gainfully employed. Read more at SCB.se. Shown for the age range 20–64.\nData from SCB RAMS (“Register-based labor market statistics”).\n\n**Variable description**  \nYou find it\n[here](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**APIs**  \nUsing the API call\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics,_\nyou can retrieve all data sets that contain statistical data for Malmö's areas\nin JSON format.  \nIn each instance of result/results in the JSON result, there is an \"id\"\nproperty for each resource. The value of \"id\" can be used to retrieve the data\nfor the respective statistics variable (according to the value of the \"name\"\nproperty). API call to retrieve the statistics data:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id\nvalue]_\n\nFeel free to use the numbers, but cite “City Office, Malmö City” as the\nsource.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visar antalet individer som bor inom området och klassas som förvärvsarbetande. Från och med referensår 2019 använder SCB en ny datakälla och metod för att klassificera förvärvsarbetande i RAMS. Bytet av källa och metod innebär att jämförelser av statistik avseende 2019 och tidigare referensår måste göras med stor försiktighet. Datan är från och med 2019 baserad på data från det så kallade arbetsgivardeklarationerna på individnivå (AGI). Har personen fått en lön i november som överstiger 99 kronor klassificeras personen som förvärvsarbetande. För egenföretagare gäller, liksom tidigare, att de personer som under referensåret har deklarerat för aktiv näringsverksamhet klassificeras som förvärvsarbetande. Även de som är tillfälligt frånvarande från en anställning under mätperioden, t.ex. p.g.a. sjukdom, räknas som förvärvsarbetande. Läs mer på SCB.se. Visas för åldersspannet 20–64. Data från SCB RAMS (”Registerbaserad arbetsmarknadsstatistik”). \n\n__Variabelbeskrivning__  \nHittar du [här](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)!  \n                     \n__API__  \nMed hjälp av API-anropet *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistik* får man i JSON-format fram samtliga datamängder som innehåller statistikunderlag för Malmös områden.  \nI varje instans av result/results i JSON-resultatet finns för varje resurs en egenskap \"id\". Värdet för \"id\" kan användas för att hämta datan för respektive statistikvariabel (enligt värdet för egenskapen \"name\").\nAPI-anrop för att hämta statistikdatan: *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-värdet]*   \n\nAnvänd gärna siffrorna, men ange “Stadskontoret, Malmö stad” som källa."}],"dct:identifier":"1c0b59f7-116e-4a18-8098-bb0950ca4cb3","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-16"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:04:48.052311"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:9f55b39f80ff9047c58bc180c1ce30e81f534c1ee4c80500ed085a18ea8facd3_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Beskæftigede, 2019-2021 - Statistiske data for Malmøs områder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gainfully employed, 2019 -2021 - Statistical data for Malmö's areas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förvärvsarbetande, 2019 -2021 - Statistikunderlag för Malmös områden"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/1c0b59f7-116e-4a18-8098-bb0950ca4cb3/resource/1b659379-313e-4c5b-8f29-4f1cf236d038","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/1c0b59f7-116e-4a18-8098-bb0950ca4cb3/resource/1b659379-313e-4c5b-8f29-4f1cf236d038/download/forvarvsarbetande-2019-2021.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"125813"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmö statistik - Erhvervsaktive, 2019-2021\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Gainfully employed, 2019 -2021\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Förvärvsarbetande, 2019 -2021"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2024-08-22T07:56:11.175960"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:04:48.058191"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Indtægtsgivende beskæftigelse, 2019-2021"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gainful employment, 2019 -2021"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förvärvsarbetande, 2019 -2021"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:9f55b39f80ff9047c58bc180c1ce30e81f534c1ee4c80500ed085a18ea8facd3_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/1c0b59f7-116e-4a18-8098-bb0950ca4cb3/resource/df0a0cfe-5d8a-47cb-bcfc-90b745bcd8ae","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/action/datastore_search?resource_id=1b659379-313e-4c5b-8f29-4f1cf236d038"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmö statistik - Erhvervsaktive, 2019-2021\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Gainfully employed, 2019 -2021\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Förvärvsarbetande, 2019 -2021"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2024-08-22T07:56:12.556124"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-01T11:10:28.847878"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Indtægtsgivende beskæftigelse, 2019-2021"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gainful employment, 2019 -2021"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förvärvsarbetande, 2019 -2021"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:9f55b39f80ff9047c58bc180c1ce30e81f534c1ee4c80500ed085a18ea8facd3"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:9fc71bd75cbcb7c7a64f7d668b85e579fbbbd78125d6cc022d5c545ea06ad132_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"8460a58fbf99439c075dde2461cfa16c"},{"@id":"_:9fc71bd75cbcb7c7a64f7d668b85e579fbbbd78125d6cc022d5c545ea06ad132_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Karl McShane","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:karl.mcshane@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/f54e5380-8a6e-4730-b324-ccb63d69218c","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/f54e5380-8a6e-4730-b324-ccb63d69218c/resource/196926bc-817a-4377-a7c9-ebeac1639b4f"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/f54e5380-8a6e-4730-b324-ccb63d69218c/resource/225598fc-9b0c-49c5-a157-d20cb8abba9b"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Viser antallet af personer, der bor i området og er klassificeret som\nerhvervsaktive. Dataene er baseret på data fra det såkaldte\nkontroldataregister. Alle, der udbetaler løn, anden godtgørelse eller ydelser,\nder udgør skattepligtig indkomst fra arbejde, skal indberette kontroldata.\nDefinitionen er den samme som i Arbejdskraftundersøgelsen (AKU): For\nlønmodtagere skal man have arbejdet mindst én time om ugen i november. For\nselvstændige tælles i stedet indkomst fra aktiv erhvervsaktivitet i løbet af\nåret. Selv de, der er midlertidigt fraværende fra et job i måleperioden,\nf.eks. på grund af sygdom, tælles som erhvervsaktive. Personer med meget lav\nindkomst tælles ikke som erhvervsaktive. Vist for aldersgruppen 20-64. Fra og\nmed referenceåret 2019 bruger Statistiska Centralen (SCB) en ny datakilde og\nmetode til at klassificere erhvervsaktive i RAMS. Ændringen i kilde og metode\nbetyder, at sammenligninger af statistik for 2019 og tidligere referenceår\nskal foretages med stor forsigtighed. Læs mere på SCB.se. Data fra SCB RAMS\n(“Registerbaseret arbejdsmarkedsstatistik”).\n\n**Variabelbeskrivelse**  \nDu finder det\n[her](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**API'er**  \nVed at bruge API-kaldet\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics_\nkan du hente alle datasæt, der indeholder statistiske data for Malmøs områder,\ni JSON-format.  \nI hver forekomst af result/results i JSON-resultatet er der en \"id\"-egenskab\nfor hver ressource. Værdien af ​​\"id\" kan bruges til at hente dataene for den\nrespektive statistikvariabel (i henhold til værdien af ​​egenskaben \"name\").\nAPI-kald til at hente statistikdataene:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-\nværdi]_\n\nBrug gerne tallene, men angiv \"Bykontoret, Malmö Kommune\" som kilde.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Shows the number of individuals living in the area and classified as gainfully\nemployed. The data is based on data from the so-called control data register.\nEveryone who pays out wages, salaries, other compensation or benefits that\nconstitute taxable income from work must report control data. The definition\nis the same as in the Labour Force Survey (LFS): for wage earners, one must\nhave worked at least one hour a week during November. For self-employed\npersons, income from active business activities during the year is counted\ninstead. Even those who are temporarily absent from a job during the\nmeasurement period, e.g. due to illness, are counted as gainfully employed.\nPeople with very low income are not counted as gainfully employed. Shown for\nthe age range 20–64. Starting with reference year 2019, Statistics Sweden uses\na new data source and method to classify gainfully employed in RAMS. The\nchange in source and method means that comparisons of statistics for 2019 and\nprevious reference years must be made with great caution. Read more at SCB.se.\nData from SCB RAMS (“Register-based labour market statistics”).\n\n**Variable description**  \nYou find it\n[here](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**APIs**  \nUsing the API call\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics,_\nyou can retrieve all data sets that contain statistical data for Malmö's areas\nin JSON format.  \nIn each instance of result/results in the JSON result, there is an \"id\"\nproperty for each resource. The value of \"id\" can be used to retrieve the data\nfor the respective statistics variable (according to the value of the \"name\"\nproperty). API call to retrieve the statistics data:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id\nvalue]_\n\nFeel free to use the numbers, but cite “City Office, Malmö City” as the\nsource.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visar antalet individer som bor inom området och klassas som förvärvsarbetande. Datan är baserad på data från det så kallade kontrolluppgiftsregistret. Alla som betalar ut lön, arvode, andra ersättningar eller förmåner som utgör skattepliktig inkomst av tjänst ska anmäla kontrolluppgifter. Definitionen är densamma som i arbetskraftsundersökningen (AKU): för lönearbetare måste man ha arbetat minst en timme i veckan under november. För personliga företagare räknas istället inkomst av aktiv näringsverksamhet under året. Även de som är tillfälligt frånvarande från en anställning under mätperioden, t.ex. p.g.a. sjukdom, räknas som förvärvsarbetande. Personer med väldigt låg inkomst räknas inte som förvärvsarbetande. Visas för åldersspannet 20–64. Från och med referensår 2019 använder SCB en ny datakälla och metod för att klassificera förvärvsarbetande i RAMS. Bytet av källa och metod innebär att jämförelser av statistik avseende 2019 och tidigare referensår måste göras med stor försiktighet. Läs mer på SCB.se. Data från SCB RAMS (”Registerbaserad arbetsmarknadsstatistik”). \n\n__Variabelbeskrivning__  \nHittar du [här](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)!  \n                     \n__API__  \nMed hjälp av API-anropet *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistik* får man i JSON-format fram samtliga datamängder som innehåller statistikunderlag för Malmös områden.  \nI varje instans av result/results i JSON-resultatet finns för varje resurs en egenskap \"id\". Värdet för \"id\" kan användas för att hämta datan för respektive statistikvariabel (enligt värdet för egenskapen \"name\").\nAPI-anrop för att hämta statistikdatan: *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-värdet]*   \n\nAnvänd gärna siffrorna, men ange “Stadskontoret, Malmö stad” som källa."}],"dct:identifier":"f54e5380-8a6e-4730-b324-ccb63d69218c","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-16"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:04:37.758323"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:9fc71bd75cbcb7c7a64f7d668b85e579fbbbd78125d6cc022d5c545ea06ad132_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Erhvervsaktive, 2007-2018 - Statistiske data for Malmøs områder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gainfully employed, 2007-2018 - Statistical data for Malmö's areas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förvärvsarbetande, 2007-2018 - Statistikunderlag för Malmös områden"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/f54e5380-8a6e-4730-b324-ccb63d69218c/resource/196926bc-817a-4377-a7c9-ebeac1639b4f","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=225598fc-9b0c-49c5-a157-d20cb8abba9b"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmö statistik - Erhvervsaktive, 2007-2018\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Gainfully employed, 2007-2018\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Förvärvsarbetande, 2007-2018"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:17:44.824975"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:17:51.095606"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Indkomstgivende beskæftigelse, 2007-2018"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gainful employment, 2007-2018"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förvärvsarbetande, 2007-2018"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/f54e5380-8a6e-4730-b324-ccb63d69218c/resource/225598fc-9b0c-49c5-a157-d20cb8abba9b","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/f54e5380-8a6e-4730-b324-ccb63d69218c/resource/225598fc-9b0c-49c5-a157-d20cb8abba9b/download/forvarvsarbetande-2007-2018.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"497566"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmö statistik - Erhvervsaktive, 2007-2018\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Gainfully employed, 2007-2018\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Förvärvsarbetande, 2007-2018"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:17:39.704839"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:04:37.768300"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Indkomstgivende beskæftigelse, 2007-2018"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gainful employment, 2007-2018"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förvärvsarbetande, 2007-2018"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:9fc71bd75cbcb7c7a64f7d668b85e579fbbbd78125d6cc022d5c545ea06ad132_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:9fc71bd75cbcb7c7a64f7d668b85e579fbbbd78125d6cc022d5c545ea06ad132"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:a006055a84af7c522d7074da8be14f94650f6767a2dec713e10925545dbebd56_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/7f000810-a9bd-4d33-9bc5-cced388e4854","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/7f000810-a9bd-4d33-9bc5-cced388e4854/resource/05d450bf-0fc3-40ef-bf41-658544db1212"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","arbetsmarknad","kolada","labour market","workforce"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Antal beskæftigede i alderen 20-64 år divideret med antal beboere i alderen\n20-64 år pr. 31/12.\n\nStatistik i procenter fra 1997.\n\nBeskæftigede personer omfatter registrerede personer i kommunen med\nlønindkomst fra beskæftigelse i november måned og personer med indkomst fra\naktiv erhvervsvirksomhed.\n\nSiden 2019 har Statistiska Centralbyrån brugt de månedlige\narbejdsgivererklæringer på individniveau (AGI) som datakilde i stedet for de\nårlige kontroldata (KU), hvilket betyder, at sammenligninger med tidligere år\nbør foretages med forsigtighed.\n\nKilde: Statistiska centralbankens registerbaserede arbejdsmarkedsstatistik\n(RAMS).\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Number of gainfully employed persons aged 20-64 divided by number of residents\naged 20-64 on 31/12.\n\nStatistics in percentages from 1997.\n\nGainfully employed refers to registered persons in the municipality with wage\nincome from employment during the month of November and persons with income\nfrom active business activities.\n\nSince 2019, Statistics Sweden has been using the monthly employer declarations\nat the individual level (AGI) as a data source instead of the annual control\ndata (KU), which means that comparisons with previous years should be made\nwith caution.\n\nSource: Statistics Sweden's register-based labour market statistics (RAMS).\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal förvärvsarbetande i åldern 20-64 år dividerat med antal invånare i åldern 20-64 år den 31/12.\n\nStatistik i procent från 1997. \n\nMed förvärvsarbetande avses folkbokförda personer i kommunen med löneinkomst av anställning under november månad och personer med inkomst av aktiv näringsverksamhet. \n\nSedan 2019 använder sig SCB av de månatliga arbetsgivardeklarationerna på individ¬nivå (AGI) som datakälla istället för de årliga kontrolluppgifterna (KU), det gör att jämförelser mot tidigare år bör göras med försiktighet. \n\nKälla: SCB:s registerbaserade arbetsmarknadsstatistik (RAMS)."}],"dct:identifier":"7f000810-a9bd-4d33-9bc5-cced388e4854","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-17"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:44:15.849278"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:a006055a84af7c522d7074da8be14f94650f6767a2dec713e10925545dbebd56_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Beskæftigede beboere i alderen 20-64 år, andel"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Employed residents aged 20-64, share"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förvärvsarbetande invånare 20-64 år, andel"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/7f000810-a9bd-4d33-9bc5-cced388e4854/resource/05d450bf-0fc3-40ef-bf41-658544db1212","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N00914"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Antal erhvervsaktive personer i alderen 20-64 år divideret med antal beboere i\nalderen 20-64 år pr. 31/12. Erhvervsaktive personer er personer registreret i\nkommunen med lønindkomst fra beskæftigelse i november måned og personer med\nindkomst fra aktiv erhvervsaktivitet. Siden 2019 har Statistiska Centralbyrån\nbrugt de månedlige arbejdsgivererklæringer på individniveau (AGI) som\ndatakilde i stedet for de årlige kontroldata (KU), hvilket betyder, at\nsammenligninger med tidligere år skal foretages med forsigtighed. Kilde:\nKolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Number of gainfully employed persons aged 20-64 divided by number of residents\naged 20-64 on 31/12. Gainfully employed persons are persons registered in the\nmunicipality with wage income from employment during the month of November,\nand persons with income from active business activities. Since 2019,\nStatistics Sweden has used the monthly employer declarations at individual\nlevel (AGI) as a data source instead of the annual control data (KU), which\nmeans that comparisons with previous years should be made with caution.\nSource: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal förvärvsarbetande i åldern 20-64 år dividerat med antal invånare i åldern 20-64 år den 31/12. Med förvärvsarbetande avses folkbokförda personer i kommunen med löneinkomst av anställning under november månad, och personer med inkomst av aktiv näringsverksamhet. Sedan 2019 använder sig SCB av de månatliga arbetsgivardeklarationerna på individ¬nivå (AGI) som datakälla istället för de årliga kontrolluppgifterna (KU), det gör att jämförelser mot tidigare år bör göras med försiktighet. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-12T08:50:28.339512"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:44:15.875778"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Beskæftigede beboere i alderen 20-64 år, andel (%) (N00914)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Employed residents 20-64 years old, share (%) (N00914)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förvärvsarbetande invånare 20-64 år, andel (%) (N00914)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:a006055a84af7c522d7074da8be14f94650f6767a2dec713e10925545dbebd56"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:a06f89c4cf2308326a80956133699619f9ae13eb1128214ef4e3c8ea49de6e7e_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/201863af-d0e5-44fc-b709-5cf068d1fe56","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/201863af-d0e5-44fc-b709-5cf068d1fe56/resource/414cc90a-4d0d-4d18-a9ea-c972c289d529"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Landareal 1/1 år T+1, kvadratkilometer.\n\nLandområdet omfatter vandløb på 6 meter og smallere samt damme og mindre\nvandmasser, op til maksimalt et par dusin kvadratmeter i størrelse.\n\nKilde: Statistiska Centralbyrån.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Land area 1/1 year T+1, square kilometers.\n\nThe land area includes watercourses 6 meters and narrower as well as ponds and\nsmaller bodies of water, up to a maximum of a few dozen square meters in size.\n\nSource: Statistics Sweden.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Landareal 1/1 år T+1, kvadratkilometer. \n\nI landarealen ingår vattendrag 6 meter och smalare samt gölar och mindre vattensamlingar, upp till max några 10-tal kvadratmeter stora. \n\nKälla: SCB."}],"dct:identifier":"201863af-d0e5-44fc-b709-5cf068d1fe56","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-17"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:13:59.610085"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:a06f89c4cf2308326a80956133699619f9ae13eb1128214ef4e3c8ea49de6e7e_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Landareal, kvadratkilometer"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Land area, square kilometers"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Landareal, kvadratkilometer"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/201863af-d0e5-44fc-b709-5cf068d1fe56/resource/414cc90a-4d0d-4d18-a9ea-c972c289d529","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N02993"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Landareal 1/1 år T+1, kvadratkilometer. Landarealet omfatter vandløb 6 meter\nog smallere samt damme og mindre vandområder, op til maksimalt et par dusin\nkvadratmeter. Kilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Land area 1/1 year T+1, square kilometers. The land area includes watercourses\n6 meters and narrower as well as ponds and smaller bodies of water, up to a\nmaximum of a few dozen square meters. Source: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Landareal 1/1 år T+1, kvadratkilometer. I landarealen ingår vattendrag 6 meter och smalare samt gölar och mindre vattensamlingar, upp till max några 10-tal kvadratmeter stora. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-22T05:59:46.999464"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:13:59.637911"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Landareal, kvadratkilometer (N02993)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Land area, square kilometers (N02993)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Landareal, kvadratkilometer (N02993)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:a06f89c4cf2308326a80956133699619f9ae13eb1128214ef4e3c8ea49de6e7e"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:a1cb83a9d46c2cd136c259b3f6badd520796800e118b02a03018e1d79b338c85_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/57200fb0-5641-45aa-b796-b745ba68bacf","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/57200fb0-5641-45aa-b796-b745ba68bacf/resource/67f52709-6fae-4a60-81ea-0cfa4a9297b9"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ECON"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Nettoomkostningsafvigelsen er nettoomkostningerne minus\nreferenceomkostningerne for gymnasiet, vist her i millioner SEK.\nNettoomkostningerne er bruttoomkostningerne minus bruttoindtægterne.\n\nReferenceomkostningerne er baseret på nettoomkostningerne ved\ngymnasieuddannelser i landet, andelen af ​​16-18-årige i kommunen, elevernes\nprogramvalg og antagelser om meromkostninger til små skoler, skoletransport og\nindkvarteringsgodtgørelser. Derudover lægges en del af standardomkostningerne\nfra delmodellerne lønninger, bygningsstruktur og befolkningsudvikling til.\n\nPositive værdier indikerer en højere omkostningssituation end statistisk\nforventet, og negative værdier indikerer en lavere omkostningssituation end\nstatistisk forventet.\n\nFra og med 2019 beregnes nettoomkostningsvarians på en ny måde på grund af\nændringer i omkostningsudligningen. Dette påvirker sammenligneligheden med\ntidligere år.\n\nKilde: SKR\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"The net cost deviation is the net cost minus the reference cost for upper\nsecondary school, shown here in millions of SEK. Net cost is gross cost minus\ngross income.\n\nThe reference cost is based on the net cost of upper secondary school in the\ncountry, the proportion of 16-18 year olds in the municipality, the students'\nprogram choices and assumptions about additional costs for small schools,\nschool transport and accommodation allowances. In addition, part of the\nstandard costs from the sub-models of salaries, building structure and\npopulation development are added.\n\nPositive values ​​indicate a higher cost situation than statistically expected\nand negative values ​​indicate a lower cost situation than statistically\nexpected.\n\nStarting in 2019, net cost variance is calculated in a new way due to changes\nin cost equalization. This affects comparability with previous years.\n\nSource: SKR\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nettokostnadsavvikelsen är nettokostnaden minus referenskostnad för gymnasieskola, här visat i miljoner kronor. Nettokostnad är bruttokostnad minus bruttointäkt. \n\nReferenskostnaden bygger på nettokostnaden för gymnasieskola i riket, andel 16-18-åringar i kommunen, elevernas programval samt antaganden om merkostnader för små skolor, skolskjuts och inackorderingsbidrag. Därutöver tillkommer del av standardkostnaderna från delmodellerna löner, bebyggelsestruktur och befolkningsutveckling. \n\nPositiva värden indikerar högre kostnadsläge än statistiskt förväntat och negativa värden ett lägre kostnadsläge än statistiskt förväntat. \n\nFrån och med 2019 beräknas nettokostnadsavvikelse på ett nytt sätt på grund av förändringar i kostnadsutjämningen.  Detta påverkar jämförbarheten med tidigare år. \n\nKälla: SKR"}],"dct:identifier":"57200fb0-5641-45aa-b796-b745ba68bacf","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-15"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:34:23.793772"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:a1cb83a9d46c2cd136c259b3f6badd520796800e118b02a03018e1d79b338c85_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Nettoomkostningsvariation for gymnasier, millioner SEK"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Net cost variance for upper secondary schools, million SEK"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nettokostnadsavvikelse gymnasieskola, miljoner kronor"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/57200fb0-5641-45aa-b796-b745ba68bacf/resource/67f52709-6fae-4a60-81ea-0cfa4a9297b9","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N17030"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Nettoomkostningsafvigelsen er nettoomkostningerne minus\nreferenceomkostningerne for gymnasiet, vist her i millioner SEK.\nNettoomkostningen er bruttoomkostningerne minus bruttoindkomsten.\nReferenceomkostningerne er baseret på nettoomkostningerne for gymnasiet i\nlandet, andelen af ​​16-18-årige i kommunen, elevernes programvalg og\nantagelser om meromkostninger for små skoler, skoletransport og kosttilskud.\nDerudover lægges en del af standardomkostningerne fra delmodellerne lønninger,\nbygningsstruktur og befolkningsudvikling til. Positive værdier indikerer en\nhøjere omkostningssituation end statistisk forventet, og negative værdier en\nlavere omkostningssituation end statistisk forventet. Fra og med 2019 beregnes\nnettoomkostningsafvigelsen på en ny måde på grund af ændringer i\nomkostningsudligningen. Dette påvirker sammenligneligheden med tidligere år.\nKilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"The net cost deviation is the net cost minus the reference cost for upper\nsecondary school, shown here in millions of SEK. The net cost is the gross\ncost minus gross income. The reference cost is based on the net cost of upper\nsecondary school in the country, the proportion of 16-18 year olds in the\nmunicipality, the students' program choices and assumptions about additional\ncosts for small schools, school transport and boarding grants. In addition,\npart of the standard costs from the sub-models salaries, building structure\nand population development are added. Positive values ​​indicate a higher cost\nsituation than statistically expected and negative values ​​a lower cost\nsituation than statistically expected. From 2019 onwards, the net cost\ndeviation is calculated in a new way due to changes in cost equalization. This\naffects comparability with previous years. Source: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nettokostnadsavvikelsen är nettokostnaden minus referenskostnad för gymnasieskola, här visat i miljoner kronor. Nettokostnad är bruttokostnad minus bruttointäkt. Referenskostnaden bygger på nettokostnaden för gymnasieskola i riket, andel 16-18-åringar i kommunen, elevernas programval samt antaganden om merkostnader för små skolor, skolskjuts och inackorderingsbidrag. Därutöver tillkommer del av standardkostnaderna från delmodellerna löner, bebyggelsestruktur och befolkningsutveckling. Positiva värden indikerar högre kostnadsläge än statistiskt förväntat och negativa värden ett lägre kostnadsläge än statistiskt förväntat. Från och med 2019 beräknas nettokostnadsavvikelse på ett nytt sätt pga förändringar i kostnadsutjämningen.  Detta påverkar jämförbarheten med tidigare år. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-22T06:09:02.245953"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:34:23.818215"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Nettoomkostningsvariation for gymnasier, millioner SEK (N17030)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Net cost variance for upper secondary schools, million SEK (N17030)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nettokostnadsavvikelse gymnasieskola, miljoner kronor (N17030)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:a1cb83a9d46c2cd136c259b3f6badd520796800e118b02a03018e1d79b338c85"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:a28a235a8c43a6a694c5d92682ab8a1c1c96e410517190acb80a96552ac9c2cb_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"4f1875db5749c884084c71636c2937f5"},{"@id":"_:a28a235a8c43a6a694c5d92682ab8a1c1c96e410517190acb80a96552ac9c2cb_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Karl McShane","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:karl.mcshane@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/2486cc94-84b3-4e61-816a-6489013e379b","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/2486cc94-84b3-4e61-816a-6489013e379b/resource/920f1bdf-b581-46cd-bf0d-cd2192916fbc"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/2486cc94-84b3-4e61-816a-6489013e379b/resource/accf1c96-5872-442f-b6e1-02d8f470be29"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Viser antallet af personer, der bor i det valgte område, og som har mindst én\npersonbil i trafikken. Variablen er opdelt efter køn. Data fra\nTrafikstyrelsens bilregister.\n\n**Variabelbeskrivelse**  \nDu finder det\n[her](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**API'er**  \nVed at bruge API-kaldet\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics_\nkan du hente alle datasæt, der indeholder statistiske data for Malmøs områder,\ni JSON-format.  \nI hver forekomst af result/results i JSON-resultatet er der en \"id\"-egenskab\nfor hver ressource. Værdien af ​​\"id\" kan bruges til at hente dataene for den\nrespektive statistikvariabel (i henhold til værdien af ​​egenskaben \"name\").\nAPI-kald til at hente statistikdataene:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-\nværdi]_\n\nBrug gerne tallene, men angiv \"Bykontoret, Malmö Kommune\" som kilde.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Shows the number of people living in the selected area who have at least one\npassenger car in traffic. The variable is broken down by gender. Data from the\nSwedish Transport Agency's car register.\n\n**Variable description**  \nYou find it\n[here](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**APIs**  \nUsing the API call\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics,_\nyou can retrieve all data sets that contain statistical data for Malmö's areas\nin JSON format.  \nIn each instance of result/results in the JSON result, there is an \"id\"\nproperty for each resource. The value of \"id\" can be used to retrieve the data\nfor the respective statistics variable (according to the value of the \"name\"\nproperty). API call to retrieve the statistics data:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id\nvalue]_\n\nFeel free to use the numbers, but cite “City Office, Malmö City” as the\nsource.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visar antal personer boende i det valda området som har minst en personbil i trafik. Variabeln finns uppdelad på kön. Data från Transportstyrelsens bilregister.\n\n__Variabelbeskrivning__  \nHittar du [här](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)!  \n                     \n__API__  \nMed hjälp av API-anropet *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistik* får man i JSON-format fram samtliga datamängder som innehåller statistikunderlag för Malmös områden.  \nI varje instans av result/results i JSON-resultatet finns för varje resurs en egenskap \"id\". Värdet för \"id\" kan användas för att hämta datan för respektive statistikvariabel (enligt värdet för egenskapen \"name\").\nAPI-anrop för att hämta statistikdatan: *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-värdet]*   \n\nAnvänd gärna siffrorna, men ange “Stadskontoret, Malmö stad” som källa."}],"dct:identifier":"2486cc94-84b3-4e61-816a-6489013e379b","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-16"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:08:32.690541"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:a28a235a8c43a6a694c5d92682ab8a1c1c96e410517190acb80a96552ac9c2cb_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Bilejere - Statistiske data for Malmøs områder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Car owners - Statistical data for Malmö's areas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bilägare - Statistikunderlag för Malmös områden"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/2486cc94-84b3-4e61-816a-6489013e379b/resource/920f1bdf-b581-46cd-bf0d-cd2192916fbc","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=accf1c96-5872-442f-b6e1-02d8f470be29"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø statistik - Bilejere\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Car owners\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Bilägare"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:21:13.727733"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:21:20.800584"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Bilejer"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Car owner"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bilägare"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/2486cc94-84b3-4e61-816a-6489013e379b/resource/accf1c96-5872-442f-b6e1-02d8f470be29","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/2486cc94-84b3-4e61-816a-6489013e379b/resource/accf1c96-5872-442f-b6e1-02d8f470be29/download/bilagare.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"694244"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø statistik - Bilejere\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Car owners\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Bilägare"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:21:08.985554"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:08:32.696781"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Bilejer"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Car owner"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bilägare"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:a28a235a8c43a6a694c5d92682ab8a1c1c96e410517190acb80a96552ac9c2cb_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:a28a235a8c43a6a694c5d92682ab8a1c1c96e410517190acb80a96552ac9c2cb"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:a368d27a075745d7332c5da59e16114634c16d1931ff859439ed40ce638759ce_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"dc75247bafff78db499db0ed0a1c1e2d"},{"@id":"_:a368d27a075745d7332c5da59e16114634c16d1931ff859439ed40ce638759ce_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/abd7da407bcfbc956fd6c0e91189412f","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Fastighets- och gatukontoret","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:gis.fgk@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/0d9523fd-40da-4e6f-8a90-981f61034ff3","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/abd7da407bcfbc956fd6c0e91189412f"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/0d9523fd-40da-4e6f-8a90-981f61034ff3/resource/1fc8d406-9bd2-481d-9b80-885cd5e3655c"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/0d9523fd-40da-4e6f-8a90-981f61034ff3/resource/a2cf32cd-8e04-455b-9d33-be337d6d71c2"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/0d9523fd-40da-4e6f-8a90-981f61034ff3/resource/e19c94ea-7c77-4138-b816-10500b305bc1"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","trees"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENVI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/DAILY"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Individuelle træer placeret på offentlig jord i Malmø.\n\n**Attribut**\n\n  * `objnr` [individuel træidentifikator]\n  * `vetenskapligt namn` [videnskabeligt navn]\n  * `svenskt namn` [svensk navn]\n  * `typ` [plantemiljø, f.eks. parkmiljø, gademiljø]\n  * `planteringsår` [året hvor træet blev plantet]\n  * `krondiameter` [angivet i meter]\n  * `stamdiameter` [angivet i centimeter]\n  * `vitalitet` [træets sundhed: 1. God vitalitet, 2. Moderat vitalitet, 3. Dårlig vitalitet, 4. Meget dårlig vitalitet]\n  * `marktäckning` [type jordmateriale omkring træet]\n  * `inventeringsdatum` [dato hvor træet sidst blev opgjort]\n  * `kategori` [løv- eller nåletræ]\n  * `ursprung` [geografisk oprindelse]\n  * `timestamp` [dato for filupload]\n\nGeometritypen er punkt, CRS i henhold til WGS84.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Individual trees located on public land in the city of Malmö.\n\n**Attribute**\n\n  * `objnr` [individual tree identifier]\n  * `vetenskapligt namn` [scientific name]\n  * `svenskt namn` [Swedish name]\n  * `typ` [plant environment, e.g. park environment, street environment]\n  * `planteringsår` [year the tree was planted]\n  * `krondiameter` [given in meters]\n  * `stamdiameter` [given in centimeters]\n  * `vitalitet` [tree health: 1. Good vitality, 2. Moderate vitality, 3. Poor vitality, 4. Very poor vitality]\n  * `marktäckning` [type of soil material around the tree]\n  * `inventeringsdatum` [date when the tree was last inventoried]\n  * `kategori` [deciduous or coniferous]\n  * `ursprung` [geographical origin]\n  * `timestamp` [file upload date]\n\nGeometry type is Point, CRS according to WGS84.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Individuella träd belägna på allmän platsmark i Malmö stad.   \n\n__Attribut__  \n  \n+ `objnr` [identifierare för individuellt träd]  \n+ `vetenskapligt namn` [vetenskapligt namn]  \n+ `svenskt namn` [svenskt namn]  \n+ `typ` [växtmiljö, t ex parkmiljö, gatumiljö]  \n+ `planteringsår` [året trädet planterades]    \n+ `krondiameter` [anges i meter]  \n+ `stamdiameter` [anges i centimeter]  \n+ `vitalitet` [trädhälsa: 1. God vitalitet, 2. Måttlig vitalitet, 3. Dålig vitalitet, 4. Mycket dålig vitalitet]  \n+ `marktäckning` [typ av markmaterial runt trädet]    \n+ `inventeringsdatum` [datum då trädet senast inventerades]   \n+ `kategori` [löv- eller barrträd]  \n+ `ursprung` [geografiskt ursprung]  \n+ `timestamp` [filens uppladdningsdatum]  \n\nGeometrityp är Point, CRS enligt WGS84.    "}],"dct:identifier":"0d9523fd-40da-4e6f-8a90-981f61034ff3","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-04-17"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-16T02:41:59.760665"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:a368d27a075745d7332c5da59e16114634c16d1931ff859439ed40ce638759ce_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Træ"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Tree"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Träd"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/0d9523fd-40da-4e6f-8a90-981f61034ff3/resource/1fc8d406-9bd2-481d-9b80-885cd5e3655c","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/0d9523fd-40da-4e6f-8a90-981f61034ff3/resource/1fc8d406-9bd2-481d-9b80-885cd5e3655c/download/trad.geojson"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"54333625"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Træer på offentlig jord\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Trees on public land\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Träd på allmän platsmark"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/GEOJSON"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-08T12:31:36.304349"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-16T02:41:24.571315"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Træ"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Tree"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Träd"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/0d9523fd-40da-4e6f-8a90-981f61034ff3/resource/a2cf32cd-8e04-455b-9d33-be337d6d71c2","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/0d9523fd-40da-4e6f-8a90-981f61034ff3/resource/a2cf32cd-8e04-455b-9d33-be337d6d71c2/download/trad.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"15435483"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Træer på offentlig jord\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Trees on public land\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Träd på allmän platsmark"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-09T08:17:38.292230"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-16T02:41:59.771986"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Træ"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Tree"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Träd"}],"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:a368d27a075745d7332c5da59e16114634c16d1931ff859439ed40ce638759ce_b0n0"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/0d9523fd-40da-4e6f-8a90-981f61034ff3/resource/e19c94ea-7c77-4138-b816-10500b305bc1","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/0d9523fd-40da-4e6f-8a90-981f61034ff3/resource/e19c94ea-7c77-4138-b816-10500b305bc1/download/trad.gpkg"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"26058752"},"dcat:mediaType":"application/vnd.sqlite3","dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Træer på offentlig jord\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Trees on public land\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Träd på allmän platsmark"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-09T04:48:17.359374"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-16T02:41:10.605677"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Træ"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Tree"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Träd"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:a368d27a075745d7332c5da59e16114634c16d1931ff859439ed40ce638759ce"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:a36d137c1b38a794b20406f264f073c365c01e9268896bbe1d3fb03950b5da94_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/3c36006c-8fc8-46ab-8862-7b5051347e6c","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/3c36006c-8fc8-46ab-8862-7b5051347e6c/resource/a80d50b4-67ac-455b-a2c3-d3409445a417"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ECON"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Nettoomkostningsvariansen er nettoomkostninger minus referenceomkostninger for\nældrepleje, vist her i millioner SEK. Nettoomkostningen er bruttoomkostninger\nminus bruttoindtægter.\n\nReferenceomkostningerne er baseret på nettoomkostningerne til ældrepleje i\nlandet, aldersstruktur (andel af 65-79 år, 80-89 år og 90+ år i kommunen),\ncivilstand, dårligt helbred, andel født uden for Norden, rejsetider i\nhjemmeplejen og meromkostninger til institutionspleje i tyndt befolkede\nområder. Derudover lægges en del af standardomkostningerne fra delmodellerne\nlønninger, boligstruktur og befolkningsudvikling til.\n\nPositive værdier indikerer en højere omkostningssituation end statistisk\nforventet, og negative værdier en lavere omkostningssituation end statistisk\nforventet. Fra og med 2019 beregnes nettoomkostningsvariansen på en ny måde på\ngrund af ændringer i omkostningsudligningen. Dette påvirker\nsammenligneligheden med tidligere år.\n\nKilde: SKR.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Net cost variance is net cost minus reference cost for elderly care, shown\nhere in millions of SEK. Net cost is gross cost minus gross revenue.\n\nThe reference cost is based on the net cost of elderly care in the country,\nage structure (proportion of 65-79 years, 80-89 years and 90+ years in the\nmunicipality), marital status, ill health, proportion born outside the Nordic\nregion, travel times in home care and additional costs for institutional care\nin sparsely populated areas. In addition, part of the standard costs from the\nsub-models salaries, housing structure and population development are added.\n\nPositive values ​​indicate a higher cost situation than statistically expected\nand negative values ​​a lower cost situation than statistically expected.\nStarting in 2019, net cost variance is calculated in a new way due to changes\nin cost equalization. This affects comparability with previous years.\n\nSource: SKR.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nettokostnadsavvikelse är nettokostnad minus  referenskostnad för äldreomsorg, här visat i miljoner kronor. Nettokostnad är bruttokostnad minus bruttointäkt. \n\nReferenskostnaden bygger på nettokostnaden för äldreomsorg i riket, åldersstruktur (andel 65-79 år, 80-89 år och 90+ år i kommunen), civilstånd, ohälsa, andel födda utanför Norden, restider i hemtjänsten samt merkostnader för institutionsboende i glesbygd. Därutöver tillkommer del av standardkostnaderna från delmodellerna löner, bebyggelsestruktur och befolkningsutveckling. \n\nPositiva värden indikerar högre kostnadsläge än statistiskt förväntat och negativa värden ett lägre kostnadsläge än statistiskt förväntat. Från och med 2019 beräknas nettokostnadsavvikelse på ett nytt sätt på grund av förändringar i kostnadsutjämningen. Detta påverkar jämförbarheten med tidigare år. \n\nKälla: SKR."}],"dct:identifier":"3c36006c-8fc8-46ab-8862-7b5051347e6c","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-15"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:29:02.795263"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:a36d137c1b38a794b20406f264f073c365c01e9268896bbe1d3fb03950b5da94_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Nettoomkostningsvariation for ældrepleje, SEK millioner"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Net cost variance for elderly care, SEK million"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nettokostnadsavvikelse äldreomsorg, miljoner kronor"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/3c36006c-8fc8-46ab-8862-7b5051347e6c/resource/a80d50b4-67ac-455b-a2c3-d3409445a417","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N20029"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Nettoomkostningsafvigelsen er nettoomkostninger minus referenceomkostninger\nfor ældrepleje, vist her i millioner SEK. Nettoomkostningen er\nbruttoomkostninger minus bruttoindkomst. Referenceomkostningerne er baseret på\nnettoomkostningerne for ældrepleje i landet, aldersstruktur (andel af 65-79\når, 80-89 år og 90+ år i kommunen), civilstand, dårligt helbred, andel født\nuden for Norden, rejsetider i hjemmeplejen og meromkostninger for\ninstitutionsbeboere i tyndt befolkede områder. Derudover lægges en del af\nstandardomkostningerne fra delmodellerne lønninger, bygningsstruktur og\nbefolkningsudvikling til. Positive værdier indikerer en højere\nomkostningssituation end statistisk forventet, og negative værdier en lavere\nomkostningssituation end statistisk forventet. Fra og med 2019 beregnes\nnettoomkostningsafvigelsen på en ny måde på grund af ændringer i\nomkostningsudligningen. Dette påvirker sammenligneligheden med tidligere år.\nKilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Net cost deviation is net cost minus reference cost for elderly care, shown\nhere in millions of SEK. Net cost is gross cost minus gross income. The\nreference cost is based on the net cost of elderly care in the country, age\nstructure (proportion of 65-79 years, 80-89 years and 90+ years in the\nmunicipality), marital status, ill health, proportion born outside the Nordic\ncountries, travel times in home care and additional costs for institutional\nresidents in sparsely populated areas. In addition, part of the standard costs\nfrom the sub-models salaries, building structure and population development\nare added. Positive values ​​indicate a higher cost situation than\nstatistically expected and negative values ​​a lower cost situation than\nstatistically expected. From 2019 onwards, net cost deviation is calculated in\na new way due to changes in cost equalization. This affects comparability with\nprevious years. Source: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nettokostnadsavvikelse är nettokostnad minus  referenskostnad för äldreomsorg, här visat i miljoner kronor. Nettokostnad är bruttokostnad minus bruttointäkt. Referenskostnaden bygger på nettokostnaden för äldreomsorg i riket, åldersstruktur (andel 65-79 år, 80-89 år och 90+ år i kommunen), civilstånd, ohälsa, andel födda utanför Norden, restider i hemtjänsten samt merkostnader för institutionsboende i glesbygd. Därutöver tillkommer del av standardkostnaderna från delmodellerna löner, bebyggelsestruktur och befolkningsutveckling. Positiva värden indikerar högre kostnadsläge än statistiskt förväntat och negativa värden ett lägre kostnadsläge än statistiskt förväntat. Från och med 2019 beräknas nettokostnadsavvikelse på ett nytt sätt pga förändringar i kostnadsutjämningen.  Detta påverkar jämförbarheten med tidigare år. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-17T05:44:03.795387"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:29:02.800240"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Nettoomkostningsvariation for ældrepleje, SEK millioner (N20029)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Net cost variance for elderly care, SEK million (N20029)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nettokostnadsavvikelse äldreomsorg, miljoner kronor (N20029)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:a36d137c1b38a794b20406f264f073c365c01e9268896bbe1d3fb03950b5da94"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:a493660de72a39291798c8109ea542fc725b429f09850ee15c5b9b0fc3d5643e_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/f094c34a-501b-440d-af7b-f7000cf8d805","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/f094c34a-501b-440d-af7b-f7000cf8d805/resource/4ab218b0-7051-4374-85a9-e00dd0be5550"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","energi","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENER"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Samlet antal solkraftværker tilsluttet elnettet. Tallene stammer fra\nundersøgelsen Nettilsluttede solkraftværker.\n\nKilde: Den svenske energimyndighed (via Kolada)\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Total number of solar power plants connected to the electricity grid. The\nfigures come from the survey Grid-connected solar power plants.\n\nSource: Swedish Energy Agency (via Kolada)\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Totala antalet solcellsanläggningar anslutna till elnätet. Siffrorna kommer från enkätundersökningen Nätanslutna solcellsanläggningar.  \n  \nKälla: Energimyndigheten (via Kolada)"}],"dct:identifier":"f094c34a-501b-440d-af7b-f7000cf8d805","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:27:21.709478"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:a493660de72a39291798c8109ea542fc725b429f09850ee15c5b9b0fc3d5643e_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Samlet antal solcelleinstallationer i kommunen"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Total number of solar cell installations in the municipality"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Solcellsanläggningar totalt kommunen, antal"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/f094c34a-501b-440d-af7b-f7000cf8d805/resource/4ab218b0-7051-4374-85a9-e00dd0be5550","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N45974"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Samlet antal solkraftværker tilsluttet elnettet. Tallene stammer fra\nundersøgelsen Nettilsluttede solkraftværker.\n\nKilde: Den svenske energimyndighed (via Kolada)\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Total number of solar power plants connected to the electricity grid. The\nfigures come from the survey Grid-connected solar power plants.\n\nSource: Swedish Energy Agency (via Kolada)\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Totala antalet solcellsanläggningar anslutna till elnätet. Siffrorna kommer från enkätundersökningen Nätanslutna solcellsanläggningar.  \n  \nKälla: Energimyndigheten (via Kolada)"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-12-13T06:54:49.337055"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:27:21.714103"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Samlet antal solcelleinstallationer i kommunen"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Total number of solar cell installations in the municipality"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Solcellsanläggningar totalt kommunen, antal"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:a493660de72a39291798c8109ea542fc725b429f09850ee15c5b9b0fc3d5643e"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:a74e99b16f0cf6ccecbf329d8936d43f9e35cb3fb7a65b21d8198990640c0d66_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"84528cf1cf63272dcddfc16d4825bd5e262f21e1"},{"@id":"_:a74e99b16f0cf6ccecbf329d8936d43f9e35cb3fb7a65b21d8198990640c0d66_b1n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"f11bac83c2fc6e561227efd88956aea86423daa7"},{"@id":"_:a74e99b16f0cf6ccecbf329d8936d43f9e35cb3fb7a65b21d8198990640c0d66_b2n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/3860a00f-0f74-4d97-9e73-7c74f86452f7","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/3860a00f-0f74-4d97-9e73-7c74f86452f7/resource/50959148-973D-43EC-803F-F4F849384F35"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/3860a00f-0f74-4d97-9e73-7c74f86452f7/resource/A7B4F170-4B1B-4119-8F7C-034F79B57C6C"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/3860a00f-0f74-4d97-9e73-7c74f86452f7/resource/E736CBDB-57F1-4454-80C7-D268F7E2CC4F"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/3860a00f-0f74-4d97-9e73-7c74f86452f7/resource/d6829bcd-8dba-4012-af28-4c3e22b3c77d"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","badhus","fritid","idrott","sport"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/EDUC"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø bys udendørs- og indendørsfaciliteter til forskellige sportsgrene og\naktiviteter.\n\n##  Fritidsfaciliteter for ressourcer\n\n**Attribut**\n\n  * `anlaggningsid` [facilitets-ID]\n  * `overordnadsresursid` [overordnet facilitets-ID]\n  * `anlaggning` [facilitetsnavn]\n  * `typ` [type af facilitet]\n  * `omraden` [delområde i Malmø, hvor anlægget er placeret]\n  * `hyralternativ` [leje-/bookingmuligheder]\n    * `\"Korttid\"` \\- bookinger med varierende varighed\n    * `\"Långtid\"` \\- abonnementslignende bookinger\n    * `\"Ej tillgänglig\"` \\- kan ikke bookes\n  * `beskrivning`\n  * `verksamheter` [aktiviteter der kan udføres på stedet]\n  * `adress` [gadeadresse]\n  * `postnr` [postnummer]\n  * `ort`\n  * `latitud`\n  * `longitud`\n\n##  Ressourceåbningstider\n\n**Attribut**\n\n  * `anläggningsId` [facilitets-ID]\n  * `start` [åbningstidspunkt]\n  * `slut` [tidspunkt for lukning]\n  * `veckodag` [mandag...søndag]\n\n##  Ressource Afvigende åbningstider\n\n**Attribut**\n\n  * `anläggningsid` [facilitets-ID]\n  * `datum` [dato der afviger fra normale åbningstider]\n  * `anteckning` [årsag til afvigelse]\n  * `öppet` [sandt/falsk]\n\n##  Mere information\n\nhttps://malmo.se/For%2dforeningar/Foreningsliv%2d%2d%2dIdrott%2doch%2dfritid/Boka%2danlaggning.html\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö city's outdoor and indoor facilities for various sports and activities.\n\n##  Resource Leisure facilities\n\n**Attribute**\n\n  * `anlaggningsid` [facility ID]\n  * `overordnadsresursid` [parent facility ID]\n  * `anlaggning` [facility name]\n  * `typ` [type of facility]\n  * `omraden` [sub-area in the city of Malmö where the facility is located]\n  * `hyralternativ` [rental/booking options]\n    * `\"Korttid\"` \\- bookings with varying duration\n    * `\"Långtid\"` \\- subscription-type bookings\n    * `\"Ej tillgänglig\"` \\- not bookable\n  * `beskrivning`\n  * `verksamheter` [activities that can be carried out on site]\n  * `adress` [street address]\n  * `postnr` [zip code]\n  * `ort`\n  * `latitud`\n  * `longitud`\n\n##  Resource Opening Hours\n\n**Attribute**\n\n  * `anläggningsId` [facility ID]\n  * `start` [time of opening]\n  * `slut` [time for closing]\n  * `veckodag` [Monday...Sunday]\n\n##  Resource Deviating opening hours\n\n**Attribute**\n\n  * `anläggningsid` [facility ID]\n  * `datum` [date that deviates from regular opening hours]\n  * `anteckning` [reason for deviation]\n  * `öppet` [true/false]\n\n##  More information\n\nhttps://malmo.se/For%2dforeningar/Foreningsliv%2d%2d%2dIdrott%2doch%2dfritid/Boka%2danlaggning.html\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö stads utomhus- och inomhusanläggningar för olika idrotter och aktiviteter.  \n\n## Resurs Fritidsanläggningar  \n__Attribut__  \n  \n+ `anlaggningsid` [ID för anläggningen]  \n+ `overordnadsresursid` [ID för överordnad anläggning]  \n+ `anlaggning` [anläggningens namn]  \n+ `typ` [typ av anläggning]  \n+ `omraden` [delområde i Malmö stad där anläggningen finns]  \n+ `hyralternativ` [hyr-/bokningsalternativ]\n    + `\"Korttid\"` - bokningar med varierande tid  \n    + `\"Långtid\"` - bokningar av abonnemangstyp  \n    + `\"Ej tillgänglig\"` - ej bokningsbar  \n+ `beskrivning`  \n+ `verksamheter` [verksamheter som kan utföras på platsen]  \n+ `adress` [gatuadress]  \n+ `postnr` [postnummer]  \n+ `ort`  \n+ `latitud`  \n+ `longitud`  \n  \n## Resurs Öppettider  \n__Attribut__  \n  \n+ `anläggningsId` [ID för anläggningen]  \n+ `start` [tid för öppning]  \n+ `slut` [tid för stängning]  \n+ `veckodag` [Måndag...Söndag]  \n  \n## Resurs Avvikande öppettider  \n__Attribut__  \n  \n+ `anläggningsid` [ID för anläggningen]  \n+ `datum` [datum som har avvikelse från ordinarie öppettid]  \n+ `anteckning` [anledning till avvikelse]  \n+ `öppet` [true/false]  \n\n## Mer information  \nhttps://malmo.se/For-foreningar/Foreningsliv---Idrott-och-fritid/Boka-anlaggning.html\n"}],"dct:identifier":"3860a00f-0f74-4d97-9e73-7c74f86452f7","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-22"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-15T16:24:29.020300"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:a74e99b16f0cf6ccecbf329d8936d43f9e35cb3fb7a65b21d8198990640c0d66_b2n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Fritidsfaciliteter"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Recreational facilities"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fritidsanläggningar"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/3860a00f-0f74-4d97-9e73-7c74f86452f7/resource/50959148-973D-43EC-803F-F4F849384F35","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/3860a00f-0f74-4d97-9e73-7c74f86452f7/resource/50959148-973D-43EC-803F-F4F849384F35/download/avvikandeoppettider-fritidsanlaggningar-20260419.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"4441669"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Fritidsfaciliteter med afvigende åbningstider\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Leisure facilities Deviating opening hours\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fritidsanläggningar Avvikande Öppettider"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-19T00:00:00"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-15T16:24:29.026286"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Afvigende åbningstider Fritidsfaciliteter"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Deviating opening hours Leisure facilities"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"AvvikandeÖppettider Fritidsanläggningar"}],"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:a74e99b16f0cf6ccecbf329d8936d43f9e35cb3fb7a65b21d8198990640c0d66_b0n0"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/3860a00f-0f74-4d97-9e73-7c74f86452f7/resource/A7B4F170-4B1B-4119-8F7C-034F79B57C6C","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/3860a00f-0f74-4d97-9e73-7c74f86452f7/resource/A7B4F170-4B1B-4119-8F7C-034F79B57C6C/download/fritidsanlaggningar-20260419.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"158344"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Fritidsfaciliteter\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Recreational facilities\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fritidsanläggningar"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-19T00:00:00"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-18T22:30:50.217151"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Fritidsfaciliteter"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Recreational facilities"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fritidsanläggningar"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/3860a00f-0f74-4d97-9e73-7c74f86452f7/resource/E736CBDB-57F1-4454-80C7-D268F7E2CC4F","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/3860a00f-0f74-4d97-9e73-7c74f86452f7/resource/E736CBDB-57F1-4454-80C7-D268F7E2CC4F/download/oppettider-fritidsanlaggningar-20260419.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"265729"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Fritidsfaciliteter Åbningstider\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Leisure facilities Opening hours\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fritidsanläggningar Öppettider"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-19T00:00:00"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-18T22:31:16.711823"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Åbningstider Fritidsfaciliteter"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Opening hours Leisure facilities"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Öppettider Fritidsanläggningar"}],"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:a74e99b16f0cf6ccecbf329d8936d43f9e35cb3fb7a65b21d8198990640c0d66_b1n0"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/3860a00f-0f74-4d97-9e73-7c74f86452f7/resource/d6829bcd-8dba-4012-af28-4c3e22b3c77d","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/3860a00f-0f74-4d97-9e73-7c74f86452f7/resource/d6829bcd-8dba-4012-af28-4c3e22b3c77d/download/fritidsanlaggningar.geojson"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"349989"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Fritidsfaciliteter\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Recreational facilities\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fritidsanläggningar"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/GEOJSON"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-05-29T08:52:20.477297"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-05-29T08:52:28.049793"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Fritidsfaciliteter"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Recreational facilities"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fritidsanläggningar"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:a74e99b16f0cf6ccecbf329d8936d43f9e35cb3fb7a65b21d8198990640c0d66"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:a7b7945f267bfbd1a71f1d0895bc19ded1c858764cf27665ebcbca46d7aa60c2_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/8909f747-c1f6-4205-9c61-9862545b52ea","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/8909f747-c1f6-4205-9c61-9862545b52ea/resource/de5d8832-1b69-44b2-a8a4-070aeefc5ca8"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/EDUC"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Alle data refererer til elever i skoler med karakterer i henhold til det mål-\nog vidensrelaterede karaktersystem.\n\nAntal elever i 6. klasse med minimumskarakteren E i svensk, inklusive svensk\nsom andetsprog, divideret med antallet af elever, der studerede faget i 6.\nklasse. Gang med 100 for at rapportere som en procentdel.\n\nStatistik i procenter fra 2013.\n\nHenviser til elever, der er registreret i kommunen, uanset hvor de går i\nskole. Elever med ukendt baggrund er inkluderet. For disse elever er den\nkommune, hvor de går i skole, angivet som deres hjemkommune.\n\nKilde: Skolstyrelsen og Statistisk Centralbyrån.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"All data refers to students in schools with grades according to the goal- and\nknowledge-related grading system.\n\nNumber of students in grade 6 with a minimum grade of E in Swedish including\nSwedish as a second language divided by the number of students who studied the\nsubject in grade 6. Multiply by 100 for reporting as a percentage.\n\nStatistics in percentages from 2013.\n\nRefers to students registered in the municipality regardless of where they\nattend school. Students with unknown backgrounds are included. For these\nstudents, the municipality where they attend school is stated as their home\nmunicipality.\n\nSource: Swedish National Agency for Education and Statistics Sweden.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samtliga uppgifter avser elever i skolor med betyg enligt det mål- och kunskapsrelaterade betygssystemet. \n\nAntal elever i årskurs 6 med lägst betyg E i svenska inklusive svenska som andraspråk dividerat med antal elever som läst ämnet i årskurs 6. Multipliceras med 100 för redovisning i procent. \n\nStatistik i procent från 2013.\n\nAvser elever folkbokförda i kommunen oavsett var de går i skola. Elever med okänd bakgrund ingår. För dessa elever anges kommunen där de går i skolan som hemkommun. \n\nKälla: Skolverket och SCB."}],"dct:identifier":"8909f747-c1f6-4205-9c61-9862545b52ea","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-15"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:03:00.871977"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:a7b7945f267bfbd1a71f1d0895bc19ded1c858764cf27665ebcbca46d7aa60c2_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elever i 6. klasse med mindst karakteren E i svensk, inklusive svensk som andetsprog, hjemkommune"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Students in grade 6 with the lowest grade of E in Swedish, including Swedish as a second language, home municipality"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elever i årskurs 6 med lägsta betyget E i svenska, inklusive svenska som andraspråk, hemkommun"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/8909f747-c1f6-4205-9c61-9862545b52ea/resource/de5d8832-1b69-44b2-a8a4-070aeefc5ca8","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N15546"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Alle data refererer til elever i skoler med karakterer i henhold til det mål-\nog vidensrelaterede karaktersystem. Antal elever i 6. klasse med minimum\nkarakteren E i svensk inklusive svensk som andetsprog divideret med antallet\naf elever, der studerede faget i 6. klasse. Ganget med 100 for rapportering\nsom en procentdel. Refererer til elever registreret i kommunen uanset hvor de\ngår i skole. Elever med ukendt baggrund er inkluderet. For disse elever er den\nkommune, hvor de går i skole, angivet som deres hjemkommune. Kilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"All data refers to students in schools with grades according to the goal- and\nknowledge-related grading system. Number of students in grade 6 with a minimum\ngrade of E in Swedish including Swedish as a second language divided by the\nnumber of students who studied the subject in grade 6. Multiplied by 100 for\nreporting as a percentage. Refers to students registered in the municipality\nregardless of where they attend school. Students with unknown backgrounds are\nincluded. For these students, the municipality where they attend school is\nstated as their home municipality. Source: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samtliga uppgifter avser elever i skolor med betyg enligt det mål- och kunskapsrelaterade betygssystemet. Antal elever i årskurs 6 med lägst betyg E i svenska inkl. svenska som andraspråk dividerat med antal elever som läst ämnet i årskurs 6. Multipliceras med 100 för redovisning i procent. Avser elever folkbokförda i kommunen oavsett var de går i skola. Elever med okänd bakgrund ingår. För dessa elever anges kommunen där de går i skolan som hemkommun. Källa: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-18T05:42:21.668938"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:03:00.879255"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elever i 6. klasse med mindst karakteren E i svensk inklusive svensk som andetsprog, bopælskommune, andel (%) (N15546)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Students in year 6 with a minimum grade of E in Swedish including Swedish as a second language, municipality of residence, proportion (%) (N15546)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elever i åk 6 med lägst betyget E i svenska inkl. svenska som andraspråk, hemkommun, andel (%) (N15546)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:a7b7945f267bfbd1a71f1d0895bc19ded1c858764cf27665ebcbca46d7aa60c2"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:a986318947cb7ebc871552d5546cccf6b7e2a506b17076f9dc59e4f51a7e4cd8_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"f23331fd44a42ef157d6edd72689c98122bb1ee6"},{"@id":"_:a986318947cb7ebc871552d5546cccf6b7e2a506b17076f9dc59e4f51a7e4cd8_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/63fa26e6-69c1-4469-a8ea-e601d989b537","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/63fa26e6-69c1-4469-a8ea-e601d989b537/resource/3e6e2b70-77c7-41b8-b083-0468486251dc"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ECON"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Årets overskud plus afskrivninger i procent af kommunens nettoinvesteringer.\n\nStatistik fra 1998.\n\nKilde: Statistiska Centralbyrån.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Profit for the year plus depreciation as a percentage of the municipality's\nnet investments.\n\nStatistics from 1998.\n\nSource: Statistics Sweden.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Årets resultat plus avskrivningar i procent av kommunens nettoinvesteringar. \n\nStatistik från 1998.\n\nKälla: SCB."}],"dct:identifier":"63fa26e6-69c1-4469-a8ea-e601d989b537","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-15"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:41:37.602664"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:a986318947cb7ebc871552d5546cccf6b7e2a506b17076f9dc59e4f51a7e4cd8_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Selvfinansieringsgrad for kommunens investeringer"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Self-financing rate for the municipality's investments"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Självfinansieringsgrad för kommunens investeringar"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/63fa26e6-69c1-4469-a8ea-e601d989b537/resource/3e6e2b70-77c7-41b8-b083-0468486251dc","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N03103"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"3244"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Årets resultat plus afskrivninger i procent af kommunens nettoinvesteringer.\nKilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Profit for the year plus depreciation as a percentage of the municipality's\nnet investments. Source: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Årets resultat plus avskrivningar i procent av kommunens nettoinvesteringar. Källa: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-07-08T12:12:57.876763"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:41:37.626826"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Selvfinansieringsgrad for kommunale investeringer, andel (%) (N03103)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Self-financing rate for municipal investments, share (%) (N03103)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Självfinansieringsgrad för kommunens investeringar, andel (%) (N03103)"}],"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:a986318947cb7ebc871552d5546cccf6b7e2a506b17076f9dc59e4f51a7e4cd8_b0n0"}}],"@id":"urn:source:a986318947cb7ebc871552d5546cccf6b7e2a506b17076f9dc59e4f51a7e4cd8"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:a9c0b40d4a7182bb6f8a1e7386e6d7d7f7909f922027251f877bd7f4675c9cfd_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"947ad559ac3747329746690f914c6ffa"},{"@id":"_:a9c0b40d4a7182bb6f8a1e7386e6d7d7f7909f922027251f877bd7f4675c9cfd_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Karl McShane","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:karl.mcshane@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/6e157164-c5d9-45ab-8bba-b1d5568f4ede","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/6e157164-c5d9-45ab-8bba-b1d5568f4ede/resource/0d559d15-ec0f-4ea2-9519-ccba2e4ff55d"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/6e157164-c5d9-45ab-8bba-b1d5568f4ede/resource/18526a9f-19a4-4c7b-8a2c-efccced43e49"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Viser vandringer i løbet af det foregående år. Viser vandringer til og fra\nhvert område opdelt i til/fra resten af ​​byen, Skåne undtagen Malmö, Sverige\nundtagen Skåne og indvandring/udvandring. Disse data rapporteres ikke for\ndelområder. Data fra Folkeregisteret (RTB).\n\n**Variabelbeskrivelse**  \nDu finder det\n[her](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**API'er**  \nVed at bruge API-kaldet\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics_\nkan du hente alle datasæt, der indeholder statistiske data for Malmøs områder,\ni JSON-format.  \nI hver forekomst af result/results i JSON-resultatet er der en \"id\"-egenskab\nfor hver ressource. Værdien af ​​\"id\" kan bruges til at hente dataene for den\nrespektive statistikvariabel (i henhold til værdien af ​​egenskaben \"name\").\nAPI-kald til at hente statistikdataene:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-\nværdi]_\n\nBrug gerne tallene, men angiv \"Bykontoret, Malmö Kommune\" som kilde.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Shows migrations during the previous year. Shows migrations to and from each\narea divided into to/from the rest of the city, Skåne except Malmö, Sweden\nexcept Skåne and immigration/emigration. This data is not reported for sub-\nareas. Data from the Register of Total Population (RTB).\n\n**Variable description**  \nYou find it\n[here](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**APIs**  \nUsing the API call\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics,_\nyou can retrieve all data sets that contain statistical data for Malmö's areas\nin JSON format.  \nIn each instance of result/results in the JSON result, there is an \"id\"\nproperty for each resource. The value of \"id\" can be used to retrieve the data\nfor the respective statistics variable (according to the value of the \"name\"\nproperty). API call to retrieve the statistics data:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id\nvalue]_\n\nFeel free to use the numbers, but cite “City Office, Malmö City” as the\nsource.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visar flyttningar under föregående år. Visar flyttningar till och från respektive områden uppdelat på till/från resten av staden, Skåne förutom Malmö, Sverige förutom Skåne samt invandring/utvandring. Denna data redovisas inte för delområden. Data från Registret över Totalbefolkningen (RTB).\n\n__Variabelbeskrivning__  \nHittar du [här](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)!  \n                     \n__API__  \nMed hjälp av API-anropet *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistik* får man i JSON-format fram samtliga datamängder som innehåller statistikunderlag för Malmös områden.  \nI varje instans av result/results i JSON-resultatet finns för varje resurs en egenskap \"id\". Värdet för \"id\" kan användas för att hämta datan för respektive statistikvariabel (enligt värdet för egenskapen \"name\").\nAPI-anrop för att hämta statistikdatan: *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-värdet]*   \n\nAnvänd gärna siffrorna, men ange “Stadskontoret, Malmö stad” som källa."}],"dct:identifier":"6e157164-c5d9-45ab-8bba-b1d5568f4ede","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-16"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:02:07.732689"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:a9c0b40d4a7182bb6f8a1e7386e6d7d7f7909f922027251f877bd7f4675c9cfd_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Flytning - Statistiske data for Malmøs områder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Relocations - Statistical data for Malmö's areas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Flyttningar - Statistikunderlag för Malmös områden"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/6e157164-c5d9-45ab-8bba-b1d5568f4ede/resource/0d559d15-ec0f-4ea2-9519-ccba2e4ff55d","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/6e157164-c5d9-45ab-8bba-b1d5568f4ede/resource/0d559d15-ec0f-4ea2-9519-ccba2e4ff55d/download/flyttningar.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"1381081"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmö statistik - Transfers\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Transfers\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Flyttningar"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:13:58.643958"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:02:07.738741"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Bevægelser"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Moves"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Flyttningar"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:a9c0b40d4a7182bb6f8a1e7386e6d7d7f7909f922027251f877bd7f4675c9cfd_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/6e157164-c5d9-45ab-8bba-b1d5568f4ede/resource/18526a9f-19a4-4c7b-8a2c-efccced43e49","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=0d559d15-ec0f-4ea2-9519-ccba2e4ff55d"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmö statistik - Transfers\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Transfers\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Flyttningar"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:14:03.197543"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:14:11.006919"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Bevægelser"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Moves"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Flyttningar"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:a9c0b40d4a7182bb6f8a1e7386e6d7d7f7909f922027251f877bd7f4675c9cfd"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:aa8c4efb841c67a4a53129d340e52e2d02ac6dff4b64ebbdbffa502bdce1b22d_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/1b730a04-05a1-438f-b045-6f18a0750b35","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/1b730a04-05a1-438f-b045-6f18a0750b35/resource/0610070b-d26f-44ef-acfb-c20d15018247"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/EDUC"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Antal indskrevne elever i kommunen, der startede på gymnasiet for 3 år siden\nog dimitterede inden for 3 år (inklusive introduktionsprogram IM), divideret\nmed antal indskrevne elever i kommunen, der startede på gymnasiet for 3 år\nsiden (inklusive IM).\n\nStatistik i procenter fra 2014.\n\nStuderende, der ikke har et svensk personnummer ved starten af ​​deres\nuddannelse (for eksempel nyankomne studerende, der endnu ikke er blevet\nregistreret), er ikke medregnet.\n\nKilde: Statistiska Centralbyrån.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Number of registered students in the municipality who started upper secondary\nschool 3 years ago and graduated within 3 years (including introductory\nprogram IM), divided by number of registered students in the municipality who\nstarted upper secondary school 3 years ago (including IM).\n\nStatistics in percentages from 2014.\n\nStudents who do not have a Swedish personal identification number at the\nbeginning of their education (for example, newly arrived students who have not\nyet been registered) are not included.\n\nSource: Statistics Sweden.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal folkbokförda elever i kommunen som började på gymnasium för 3 år sedan som med examen inom 3 år, (inklusive introduktionsprogram IM), dividerat med antal folkbokförda elever i kommunen som började på gymnasium för 3 år sedan, (inklusive IM).\n\nStatistik i procent från 2014.\n\nElever som vid utbildningens början saknar svenskt personnummer (exempelvis nyanlända elever som ännu inte blivit folkbokförda) ingår ej. \n\nKälla: SCB."}],"dct:identifier":"1b730a04-05a1-438f-b045-6f18a0750b35","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-15"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:09:17.429708"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:aa8c4efb841c67a4a53129d340e52e2d02ac6dff4b64ebbdbffa502bdce1b22d_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Gymnasieelever med en uddannelse inden for 3 år, hjemkommune"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Upper secondary school students with a degree within 3 years, home municipality"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gymnasieelever med examen inom 3 år, hemkommun"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/1b730a04-05a1-438f-b045-6f18a0750b35/resource/0610070b-d26f-44ef-acfb-c20d15018247","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N17445"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Antal registrerede elever i kommunen, der startede i gymnasiet for tre år\nsiden og dimitterede inden for tre år, inkl. IM, divideret med antal\nregistrerede elever i kommunen, der startede i gymnasiet for tre år siden,\ninkl. IM. Elever, der ikke har et svensk personnummer ved begyndelsen af\n​​deres uddannelse (f.eks. nyankomne elever, der endnu ikke er blevet\nregistreret), er ikke inkluderet. Kilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Number of registered students in the municipality who started upper secondary\nschool three years ago and who graduated within three years, incl. IM divided\nby number of registered students in the municipality who started upper\nsecondary school three years ago, incl. IM. Students who do not have a Swedish\npersonal identity number at the beginning of their education (e.g. newly\narrived students who have not yet been registered) are not included. Source:\nKolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal folkbokförda elever i kommunen som började på gymnasium för tre år sedan som med examen inom tre år, inkl. IM dividerat med antal folkbokförda elever i kommunen som började på gymnasium för tre år sedan, inkl. IM. Elever som vid utbildningens början saknar svenskt personnummer (t ex nyanlända elever som ännu inte blivit folkbokförda) ingår ej. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-22T05:47:10.371489"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:09:17.436302"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Gymnasieelever med en uddannelse inden for 3 år, hjemkommune, andel (%) (N17445)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Upper secondary school students with a degree within 3 years, home municipality, proportion (%) (N17445)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gymnasieelever med examen inom 3 år, hemkommun, andel (%) (N17445)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:aa8c4efb841c67a4a53129d340e52e2d02ac6dff4b64ebbdbffa502bdce1b22d"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:ac6ee649380c828846e7ddc23e95ef66ec55f26332d0347213ae82d42518102b_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/4bee98e5-009e-457d-8acd-952a770adc5c","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/4bee98e5-009e-457d-8acd-952a770adc5c/resource/57460e35-77e0-4f5a-b251-e4a38a78b1c0"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/EDUC"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Alle data refererer til elever i skoler med karakterer i henhold til det mål-\nog vidensrelaterede karaktersystem.\n\nStatistik i procenter fra 2013.\n\nBegrebet \"lokationskommune\" henviser til elever i både kommunale og friskoler\nbeliggende i kommunen, uanset hvor de er indskrevet.\n\nHvis det samlede antal elever er 40 eller flere, og antallet af EJ med den\nlaveste karakter E er 1-4 elever, vises procentdelen som 95 procent.\n\nKilde: Den svenske statslige skolestyrelse (Siris).\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"All data refers to students in schools with grades according to the goal- and\nknowledge-related grading system.\n\nStatistics in percentages from 2013.\n\nThe term \"location municipality\" refers to students in both municipal and\nindependent schools located in the municipality, regardless of where they are\nregistered.\n\nIf the total number of students is 40 or more and the number of EJ with the\nlowest grade E is 1-4 students, the percentage is shown as 95 percent.\n\nSource: Swedish National Agency for Education (Siris).\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samtliga uppgifter avser elever i skolor med betyg enligt det mål- och kunskapsrelaterade betygssystemet. \n\nStatistik i procent från 2013.\n\nMed lägeskommun avses elever i både kommunala och fristående skolor belägna i kommunen oavsett var de är folkbokförda.\n\nOm det totala antalet elever är 40 eller fler och antalet EJ med lägst betyget E är 1-4 elever, så visas andelen som 95 procent. \n\nKälla: Skolverket (Siris)."}],"dct:identifier":"4bee98e5-009e-457d-8acd-952a770adc5c","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-15"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:37:06.466172"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:ac6ee649380c828846e7ddc23e95ef66ec55f26332d0347213ae82d42518102b_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elever i 6. klasse med den laveste karakter E i svensk, placeringskommune"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Students in grade 6 with the lowest grade E in Swedish, location municipality"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elever i årskurs 6 med lägsta betyget E i svenska, lägeskommun"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/4bee98e5-009e-457d-8acd-952a770adc5c/resource/57460e35-77e0-4f5a-b251-e4a38a78b1c0","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N15486"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Alle data refererer til elever i skoler med karakterer i henhold til det mål-\nog vidensrelaterede karaktersystem. Elever i 6. klasse med minimumskarakteren\nE i svensk, lokationskommune, procentdel (%). Lokationskommune refererer til\nelever i både kommunale og friskoler beliggende i kommunen, uanset hvor de er\nindskrevet. Hvis det samlede antal elever er 40 eller mere, og antallet af EJ\nmed minimumskarakteren E er 1-4 elever, vises procentdelen som 95 procent.\nKilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"All data refers to students in schools with grades according to the goal- and\nknowledge-related grading system. Students in year 6 with a minimum grade of E\nin Swedish, location municipality, percentage (%). Location municipality\nrefers to students in both municipal and independent schools located in the\nmunicipality regardless of where they are registered. If the total number of\nstudents is 40 or more and the number of EJ with a minimum grade of E is 1-4\nstudents, the percentage is shown as 95 percent. Source: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samtliga uppgifter avser elever i skolor med betyg enligt det mål- och kunskapsrelaterade betygssystemet. Elever i åk 6 med lägst betyget E  i svenska, lägeskommun, andel (%). Med lägeskommun avses elever i både kommunala och fristående skolor belägna i kommunen oavsett var de är folkbokförda. Om det totala antalet elever är 40 eller fler och antalet EJ med lägst betyget E är 1-4 elever, så visas andelen som 95 procent. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-18T05:40:40.193258"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:37:06.473887"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elever i 6. klasse med mindst karakteren E i svensk, kommune, procentdel (%) (N15486)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Students in year 6 with a minimum grade of E in Swedish, municipality, percentage (%) (N15486)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elever i åk 6 med lägst betyget E i svenska, lägeskommun, andel (%) (N15486)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:ac6ee649380c828846e7ddc23e95ef66ec55f26332d0347213ae82d42518102b"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:ac9274d0569bf207503cb3e014453bdb0926ad1e5faa32a8c880cedc98119acc_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"0e3eb968fd6ef43253d5089eb66d60820cc8a810"},{"@id":"_:ac9274d0569bf207503cb3e014453bdb0926ad1e5faa32a8c880cedc98119acc_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/51d7f2ab-0efa-41cd-97fd-2dc9c2a2b205","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/51d7f2ab-0efa-41cd-97fd-2dc9c2a2b205/resource/dcb172e9-c691-4e5a-9e97-3effa436ed59"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","arbetsmarknad","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/EDUC"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Omfatter personer i alderen 16-24 år, som i løbet af kalenderåret ikke havde\nen indkomst, der oversteg et grundbeløb, ikke modtog studiestøtte, var\ntilmeldt uddannelse eller studerede på SFI i mere end 60 timer.\nIndkomstmodtagere i et andet nordisk land er undtaget. Kilde: Myndigheden for\nungdoms- og civilsamfund (MUCF)\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Includes people 16-24 who during the calendar year did not have income\nexceeding a basic amount, did not have study grants, were registered for\neducation or studied at SFI for more than 60 hours. Income earners in another\nNordic country are excluded. Source: Swedish Agency for Youth and Civil\nSociety (MUCF)\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Inkluderar personer 16-24 som under kalenderåret inte haft inkomster som överskridit ett basbelopp, inte haft studiemedel, varit utbildningsregistrerad eller studerat vid SFI mer än 60 timmar. Inkomsttagare i ett annat nordiskt land är exkluderade. Källa: Myndigheten för ungdoms- och civilsamhällesfrågor (MUCF)"}],"dct:identifier":"51d7f2ab-0efa-41cd-97fd-2dc9c2a2b205","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-15"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-26T10:13:22.540392"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:ac9274d0569bf207503cb3e014453bdb0926ad1e5faa32a8c880cedc98119acc_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Beboere i alderen 16-24 år, der hverken arbejder eller studerer, procentdel (%)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Residents aged 16-24 who are neither working nor studying, percentage (%)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Invånare 16-24 år som varken arbetar eller studerar, andel (%)"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/51d7f2ab-0efa-41cd-97fd-2dc9c2a2b205/resource/dcb172e9-c691-4e5a-9e97-3effa436ed59","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N02797"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"3661"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Omfatter personer i alderen 16-24 år, som i løbet af kalenderåret ikke havde\nen indkomst, der oversteg et grundbeløb, ikke havde studielån, var tilmeldt\nuddannelse eller studerede på SFI i mere end 60 timer. Indkomstmodtagere i et\nandet nordisk land er undtaget. Kilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Includes people 16-24 who during the calendar year did not have income\nexceeding a basic amount, did not have student loans, were registered for\neducation or studied at SFI for more than 60 hours. Income earners in another\nNordic country are excluded. Source: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Inkluderar personer 16-24 som under kalenderåret inte haft inkomster som överskridit ett basbelopp, inte haft studiemedel, varit utbildningsregistrerad eller studerat vid SFI mer än 60 timmar. Inkomsttagare i ett annat nordiskt land är exkluderade. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-11T12:45:57.486301"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-05-18T08:40:21.703530"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Beboere i alderen 16-24 år, der hverken arbejder eller studerer, procentdel (%)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Residents aged 16-24 who are neither working nor studying, percentage (%)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Invånare 16-24 år som varken arbetar eller studerar, andel (%)"}],"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:ac9274d0569bf207503cb3e014453bdb0926ad1e5faa32a8c880cedc98119acc_b0n0"}}],"@id":"urn:source:ac9274d0569bf207503cb3e014453bdb0926ad1e5faa32a8c880cedc98119acc"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:acd9c7713b5d0c2774f83e73a6146153e1f82dcba23a8d740e2521acd375e9b7_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/ab5e6fe8-6071-4cdc-9974-64909dfc530e","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/ab5e6fe8-6071-4cdc-9974-64909dfc530e/resource/36f7743b-4895-474e-88d6-eaffd1aae05c"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/EDUC"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Antal indskrevne elever i kommunen, der startede i gymnasiet for 3 år siden og\nhar en uddannelse eller et studiebevis inden for 3 år (inklusive\nintroduktionsprogram IM), divideret med antallet af indskrevne elever i\nkommunen, der startede i gymnasiet for 3 år siden (inklusive IM).\n\nStatistik i procenter fra 2014.\n\nStuderende, der ikke har et svensk personnummer ved starten af ​​deres\nuddannelse (for eksempel nyankomne studerende, der endnu ikke er blevet\nregistreret), er ikke medregnet.\n\nKun studerende med et studiebevis på 2.500 point indberettes.\n\nKilde: Statistiska Centralbyrån.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Number of registered students in the municipality who started upper secondary\nschool 3 years ago and have a degree or certificate of study within 3 years,\n(including introductory program IM), divided by the number of registered\nstudents in the municipality who started upper secondary school 3 years ago,\n(including IM).\n\nStatistics in percentages from 2014.\n\nStudents who do not have a Swedish personal identification number at the\nbeginning of their education (for example, newly arrived students who have not\nyet been registered) are not included.\n\nOnly students with a study certificate of 2,500 points are reported.\n\nSource: Statistics Sweden.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal folkbokförda elever i kommunen som började på gymnasium för 3 år sedan och har examen eller studiebevis inom 3 år, (inklusive introduktionsprogram IM), dividerat med antal folkbokförda elever i kommunen som började på gymnasium för 3 år sedan, (inklusive IM). \n\nStatistik i procent från 2014.\n\nElever som vid utbildningens början saknar svenskt personnummer (exempelvis nyanlända elever som ännu inte blivit folkbokförda) ingår ej. \n\nEndast elever med  studiebevis om 2 500 poäng redovisas. \n\nKälla: SCB."}],"dct:identifier":"ab5e6fe8-6071-4cdc-9974-64909dfc530e","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-15"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:33:42.432443"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:acd9c7713b5d0c2774f83e73a6146153e1f82dcba23a8d740e2521acd375e9b7_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Gymnasieelever med en uddannelse eller et certifikat inden for de sidste 3 år, hjemkommune"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Upper secondary school students with a degree or certificate within 3 years, home municipality"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gymnasieelever med examen eller studiebevis inom 3 år, hemkommun"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/ab5e6fe8-6071-4cdc-9974-64909dfc530e/resource/36f7743b-4895-474e-88d6-eaffd1aae05c","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N17441"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Antal registrerede elever i kommunen, der startede i gymnasiet for tre år\nsiden med en uddannelse eller et eksamensbevis inden for tre år, inkl. IM,\ndivideret med antallet af registrerede elever i kommunen, der startede i\ngymnasiet for tre år siden, inkl. IM. Elever, der ikke har et svensk\npersonnummer ved starten af ​​deres uddannelse (f.eks. nyankomne elever, der\nendnu ikke er registreret), er ikke inkluderet. Kun elever med et\neksamensbevis på 2.500 point rapporteres. Kilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Number of registered students in the municipality who started upper secondary\nschool three years ago with a degree or certificate of completion within three\nyears, incl. IM divided by the number of registered students in the\nmunicipality who started upper secondary school three years ago, incl. IM.\nStudents who do not have a Swedish personal identity number at the start of\ntheir education (e.g. newly arrived students who have not yet been registered)\nare not included. Only students with a certificate of completion of 2,500\npoints are reported. Source: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal folkbokförda elever i kommunen som började på gymnasium för tre år sedan med examen eller studiebevis inom tre år, inkl. IM dividerat med antal folkbokförda elever i kommunen som började på gymnasium för tre år sedan, inkl. IM. Elever som vid utbildningens början saknar svenskt personnummer (t ex nyanlända elever som ännu inte blivit folkbokförda) ingår ej. Endast elever med  studiebevis om 2 500 poäng redovisas. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-18T06:44:10.819956"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:33:42.458713"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Gymnasieelever med en uddannelse eller et eksamensbevis inden for 3 år, bopælskommune, andel (%) (N17441)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Upper secondary school students with a degree or certificate within 3 years, municipality of residence, proportion (%) (N17441)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gymnasieelever med examen eller studiebevis inom 3 år, hemkommun, andel (%) (N17441)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:acd9c7713b5d0c2774f83e73a6146153e1f82dcba23a8d740e2521acd375e9b7"},{"@graph":