":"Udenlandskfødte personer i alderen 18-64 år i kommunen. Statistik i procent\nfra 2013.\n\nKilde: Statistiska Centralbyrån.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Foreign-born people aged 18-64 in the municipality. Statistics in percentage\nfrom 2013.\n\nSource: Statistics Sweden.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Utrikes födda i åldern 18-64 år i kommunen. Statistik i procent från 2013. \n\nKälla: SCB."}],"dct:identifier":"585c2290-a043-4762-af5b-9b013dbfa7d5","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-17"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:45:40.433137"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:b26b4f3841d20b63e3f8fd977826ea1eb037e3ae77e6d2822c20182dccfa6408_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Udenlandskfødte 18-64 år, andel"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Foreign-born 18-64 years old, share"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Utrikes födda 18-64 år, andel"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/585c2290-a043-4762-af5b-9b013dbfa7d5/resource/61c7cd77-2abf-41b3-8c3b-e9c927209ed9","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N00221"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Udenlandskfødte i alderen 18-64 år i befolkningen, kommune, andel (%). Kilde:\nKolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Foreign-born people aged 18-64 in the population, municipality, share (%).\nSource: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Utrikes födda i åldern 18-64 år i befolkningen, kommun, andel (%). \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-19T10:07:14.541188"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:45:40.459693"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Udenlandskfødte 18-64 år, andel (%) (N00221)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Foreign-born 18-64 years, share (%) (N00221)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Utrikes födda 18-64 år, andel (%) (N00221)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:b26b4f3841d20b63e3f8fd977826ea1eb037e3ae77e6d2822c20182dccfa6408"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:b72a582b00af782e5ecae4903996a215467985353bf3f0703b8243913003eee0_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"fe16bb90be3f0b84f6e7d73cde53fa22"},{"@id":"_:b72a582b00af782e5ecae4903996a215467985353bf3f0703b8243913003eee0_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Karl McShane","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:karl.mcshane@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/59d37396-0bb4-49c2-aa4b-6db6faa8eabc","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/59d37396-0bb4-49c2-aa4b-6db6faa8eabc/resource/c0f5f885-18bf-4376-ab99-23c74a36128c"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/59d37396-0bb4-49c2-aa4b-6db6faa8eabc/resource/c3be2e73-a86e-4d54-89ce-2a66d079442e"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Viser antallet af beboere i området i alderen 16-29 år, som hverken arbejder\neller studerer. Definitionen stammer fra den svenske myndighed for ungdoms- og\ncivilsamfund (MUCF). En person i alderen 16-29 år, som ikke har haft\narbejdsindkomst over et grundbeløb eller ikke har haft studiemidler, har været\ntilmeldt uddannelse eller har studeret på SFI i mere end 60 timer i løbet af\net helt kalenderår, betragtes som en UVAS. Statistikken ekskluderer\ngrænsependlere. Grænsependlere er personer, der er registreret i svenske\nregistre, men som arbejder i et land, der grænser op til Sverige.\n\n**Variabelbeskrivelse**  \nDu finder det\n[her](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**API'er**  \nVed at bruge API-kaldet\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics_\nkan du hente alle datasæt, der indeholder statistiske data for Malmøs områder,\ni JSON-format.  \nI hver forekomst af result/results i JSON-resultatet er der en \"id\"-egenskab\nfor hver ressource. Værdien af ​​\"id\" kan bruges til at hente dataene for den\nrespektive statistikvariabel (i henhold til værdien af ​​egenskaben \"name\").\nAPI-kald til at hente statistikdataene:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-\nværdi]_\n\nBrug gerne tallene, men angiv \"Bykontoret, Malmö Kommune\" som kilde.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Shows the number of residents in the area aged 16–29 who are neither working\nnor studying. The definition comes from the Swedish Agency for Youth and Civil\nSociety (MUCF). A person aged 16–29 who has not had income from work over a\nbasic amount or has not had study funds, has been registered for education or\nhas studied at SFI for more than 60 hours during a whole calendar year is\nconsidered to be a UVAS. The statistics exclude cross-border commuters. Cross-\nborder commuters are people who are registered in Swedish registers, but who\nwork in a country that borders Sweden.\n\n**Variable description**  \nYou find it\n[here](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**APIs**  \nUsing the API call\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics,_\nyou can retrieve all data sets that contain statistical data for Malmö's areas\nin JSON format.  \nIn each instance of result/results in the JSON result, there is an \"id\"\nproperty for each resource. The value of \"id\" can be used to retrieve the data\nfor the respective statistics variable (according to the value of the \"name\"\nproperty). API call to retrieve the statistics data:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id\nvalue]_\n\nFeel free to use the numbers, but cite “City Office, Malmö City” as the\nsource.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visar antalet boende i området i åldern 16–29 som varken arbetar eller studerar. Definitionen kommer från Myndigheten för ungdoms- och civilsamhällesfrågor (MUCF). Som UVAS räknas en person 16–29 år som under ett helt kalenderår inte har haft arbetsinkomster över ett basbelopp eller inte har haft studiemedel, varit utbildningsregistrerad eller studerat vid SFI mer än 60 timmar. I statistiken exkluderas gränspendlare. Gränspendlare är personer som finns registrerade i svenska register, men som arbetar i ett land som gränsar till Sverige.\n\n__Variabelbeskrivning__  \nHittar du [här](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)!  \n                     \n__API__  \nMed hjälp av API-anropet *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistik* får man i JSON-format fram samtliga datamängder som innehåller statistikunderlag för Malmös områden.  \nI varje instans av result/results i JSON-resultatet finns för varje resurs en egenskap \"id\". Värdet för \"id\" kan användas för att hämta datan för respektive statistikvariabel (enligt värdet för egenskapen \"name\").\nAPI-anrop för att hämta statistikdatan: *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-värdet]*   \n\nAnvänd gärna siffrorna, men ange “Stadskontoret, Malmö stad” som källa."}],"dct:identifier":"59d37396-0bb4-49c2-aa4b-6db6faa8eabc","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-16"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:07:28.307716"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:b72a582b00af782e5ecae4903996a215467985353bf3f0703b8243913003eee0_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"UVAS (unge, der hverken arbejder eller studerer) - Statistiske data for Malmøs områder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"UVAS (young people neither working nor studying) - Statistical data for Malmö's areas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"UVAS (unga som varken arbetar eller studerar) - Statistikunderlag för Malmös områden"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/59d37396-0bb4-49c2-aa4b-6db6faa8eabc/resource/c0f5f885-18bf-4376-ab99-23c74a36128c","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=c3be2e73-a86e-4d54-89ce-2a66d079442e"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø-statistik - UVAS (unge, der hverken arbejder eller studerer)\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - UVAS (young people neither working nor studying)\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - UVAS (unga som varken arbetar eller studerar)"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-05-25T23:07:23.459894"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-05-25T23:07:29.189358"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"UVAS (unge mennesker, der hverken arbejder eller studerer)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"UVAS (young people neither working nor studying)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"UVAS (unga som varken arbetar eller studerar)"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/59d37396-0bb4-49c2-aa4b-6db6faa8eabc/resource/c3be2e73-a86e-4d54-89ce-2a66d079442e","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/59d37396-0bb4-49c2-aa4b-6db6faa8eabc/resource/c3be2e73-a86e-4d54-89ce-2a66d079442e/download/uvas-unga-som-varken-arbetar-eller-studerar.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"1314540"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø-statistik - UVAS (unge, der hverken arbejder eller studerer)\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - UVAS (young people neither working nor studying)\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - UVAS (unga som varken arbetar eller studerar)"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-05-25T23:07:19.183052"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:07:28.326304"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"UVAS (unge mennesker, der hverken arbejder eller studerer)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"UVAS (young people neither working nor studying)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"UVAS (unga som varken arbetar eller studerar)"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:b72a582b00af782e5ecae4903996a215467985353bf3f0703b8243913003eee0_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:b72a582b00af782e5ecae4903996a215467985353bf3f0703b8243913003eee0"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:b94ec2da2f8216f90bfde22f59cea72ecfeda129531cb69f48476576675ac0d6_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"5cc3efd92598b0ca8677d7f87303f3ac"},{"@id":"_:b94ec2da2f8216f90bfde22f59cea72ecfeda129531cb69f48476576675ac0d6_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Karl McShane","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:karl.mcshane@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/b7400515-854b-426b-8923-cc60bdf35c59","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/b7400515-854b-426b-8923-cc60bdf35c59/resource/54731f63-087f-49c3-833b-67fc0d4e34e7"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/b7400515-854b-426b-8923-cc60bdf35c59/resource/f0577844-dc2a-4849-b005-407d4f611894"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Viser antal og andel af personer, der modtog økonomisk bistand, tidligere\nkaldet socialhjælp, i mindst én måned i løbet af året. På grund af datatab i\nMalmø Kommunes rapportering til Socialstyrelsen og tidligere ændringer af\ndefinitioner, rapporteres data ikke før 2016. Dataene rapporteres kun for år,\nhvor Socialstyrelsen ikke rapporterer noget datatab fra Malmø. Vist for\nbefolkningen 18 år og ældre. Tilgængelig opdelt efter køn. Data fra Indkomst-\nog Skatteregistret (IoT) og Socialstyrelsen.\n\n**Variabelbeskrivelse**  \nDu finder det\n[her](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**API'er**  \nVed at bruge API-kaldet\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics_\nkan du hente alle datasæt, der indeholder statistiske data for Malmøs områder,\ni JSON-format.  \nI hver forekomst af result/results i JSON-resultatet er der en \"id\"-egenskab\nfor hver ressource. Værdien af ​​\"id\" kan bruges til at hente dataene for den\nrespektive statistikvariabel (i henhold til værdien af ​​egenskaben \"name\").\nAPI-kald for at hente statistikdataene:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-\nværdi]_\n\nBrug gerne tallene, men angiv \"Bykontoret, Malmö Kommune\" som kilde.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Shows the number and proportion of people who received financial assistance,\npreviously called social assistance, for at least one month during the year.\nDue to data loss in Malmö City's reporting to the National Board of Health and\nWelfare and previous changes to definitions, data is not reported before 2016.\nThe data is only reported for years where the National Board of Health and\nWelfare does not report any data loss from Malmö. Shown for the population 18\nand older. Available broken down by gender. Data from the Income and Tax\nRegister (IoT) and the National Board of Health and Welfare.\n\n**Variable description**  \nYou find it\n[here](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**APIs**  \nUsing the API call\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics,_\nyou can retrieve all data sets that contain statistical data for Malmö's areas\nin JSON format.  \nIn each instance of result/results in the JSON result, there is an \"id\"\nproperty for each resource. The value of \"id\" can be used to retrieve the data\nfor the respective statistics variable (according to the value of the \"name\"\nproperty). API call to retrieve the statistics data:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id\nvalue]_\n\nFeel free to use the numbers, but cite “City Office, Malmö City” as the\nsource.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visar antalet och andelen personer som under året mottagit ekonomiskt bistånd, tidigare kallat socialbidrag, under minst en månad under året. På grund av databortfall i Malmö stads inrapportering till Socialstyrelsen och tidigare ändringar av definitioner redovisas inte data innan 2016. Datan redovisas bara för år där Socialstyrelsen inte rapporterar något databortfall från Malmös sida. Visas för befolkningen 18 och äldre. Finns uppdelat på kön. Data från Inkomst- och taxeringsregistret (IoT) och Socialstyrelsen.\n\n__Variabelbeskrivning__  \nHittar du [här](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)!  \n                     \n__API__  \nMed hjälp av API-anropet *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistik* får man i JSON-format fram samtliga datamängder som innehåller statistikunderlag för Malmös områden.  \nI varje instans av result/results i JSON-resultatet finns för varje resurs en egenskap \"id\". Värdet för \"id\" kan användas för att hämta datan för respektive statistikvariabel (enligt värdet för egenskapen \"name\").\nAPI-anrop för att hämta statistikdatan: *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-värdet]*   \n\nAnvänd gärna siffrorna, men ange “Stadskontoret, Malmö stad” som källa."}],"dct:identifier":"b7400515-854b-426b-8923-cc60bdf35c59","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-16"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:07:59.343646"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:b94ec2da2f8216f90bfde22f59cea72ecfeda129531cb69f48476576675ac0d6_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Økonomisk bistand - Statistiske data for Malmøs områder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Economic assistance - Statistical data for Malmö's areas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ekonomiskt bistånd - Statistikunderlag för Malmös områden"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/b7400515-854b-426b-8923-cc60bdf35c59/resource/54731f63-087f-49c3-833b-67fc0d4e34e7","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=f0577844-dc2a-4849-b005-407d4f611894"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø statistik - Økonomisk bistand\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Financial assistance\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Ekonomiskt bistånd"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:20:42.986525"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:20:49.298382"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Økonomisk bistand"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Financial assistance"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ekonomiskt bistånd"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/b7400515-854b-426b-8923-cc60bdf35c59/resource/f0577844-dc2a-4849-b005-407d4f611894","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/b7400515-854b-426b-8923-cc60bdf35c59/resource/f0577844-dc2a-4849-b005-407d4f611894/download/ekonomiskt-bistand.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"1014374"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø statistik - Økonomisk bistand\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Financial assistance\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Ekonomiskt bistånd"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:20:38.235629"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:07:59.362113"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Økonomisk bistand"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Financial assistance"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ekonomiskt bistånd"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:b94ec2da2f8216f90bfde22f59cea72ecfeda129531cb69f48476576675ac0d6_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:b94ec2da2f8216f90bfde22f59cea72ecfeda129531cb69f48476576675ac0d6"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:babe5361f856427b26488c35338fd3ef9b0c0dcdd687cdff6836c4f8fc6c889d_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/068bb0b6-e297-4d2e-881c-beddcce8203d","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/068bb0b6-e297-4d2e-881c-beddcce8203d/resource/42b69421-37a3-4c91-a8fa-8bdbcb876c8b"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","brott","crime","kolada","violence","våld"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/JUST"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Henviser til opsummering af: Forsøg på drab eller manddrab, Overfald herunder\ngroft overfald, Voldtægt herunder groft overfald, Alvorligt overfald på\nkvinde, Alvorligt overfald på offentligt ansat, Vold mod offentligt ansat og\nRøveri herunder groft overfald, antal/100.000 indbyggere.  \nStatistikken indberettes af den kommune, hvor forbrydelsen blev begået\n(gerningsstedet). Fra 2015 refererer dataene pr. kommune kun til forbrydelser,\nder kunne spores tilbage til kommunen. I tidligere år var der forbrydelser,\nder blev begået i regionen, men som ikke kunne knyttes til en specifik\nkommune. For dette nøgletal tælles bortfaldet som 0.\n\nKilde: BRÅ & Statistiska centralbyrån\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Refers to summation of: Attempted murder or manslaughter, Assault including\naggravated assault, Rape including aggravated assault, Serious assault on a\nwoman, Serious assault on a public servant, Violence against a public servant\nand Robbery including aggravated assault, number/100,000 inhabitants.  \nThe statistics are reported by the municipality where the crime was committed\n(crime scene). From 2015, the data per municipality only refers to crimes that\ncould be traced to the municipality. In previous years, there were crimes that\nwere committed in the region but could not be linked to a specific\nmunicipality. For this key figure, non-response is counted as 0.\n\nSource: BRÅ & Statistics Sweden\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Avser summering av: Försök till mord eller dråp, Misshandel inkl. grov, Våldtäkt inkl. grov, Grov kvinnofridskränkning, Grov fridskränkning, Våld mot tjänsteman och Rån inkl. grovt, antal/100 000 inv.  \nStatistiken redovisas efter den kommun där brottet har begåtts (brottsplats).  Fr.o.m. 2015 avser uppgifterna per kommun endast de brott som kunnat härledas till kommunen. Tidigare år fanns det med brott som begåtts i regionen men inte kunnat kopplas till en specifik kommun. För detta nyckeltal räknas bortfall som 0.  \n  \nKälla: BRÅ & SCB"}],"dct:identifier":"068bb0b6-e297-4d2e-881c-beddcce8203d","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-24"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:49:10.239352"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:babe5361f856427b26488c35338fd3ef9b0c0dcdd687cdff6836c4f8fc6c889d_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Anmeldte voldelige forbrydelser, antal/100.000 indbyggere"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Reported violent crimes, number/100,000 inhabitants"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Anmälda våldsbrott, antal/100 000 inv"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/068bb0b6-e297-4d2e-881c-beddcce8203d/resource/42b69421-37a3-4c91-a8fa-8bdbcb876c8b","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N07403"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Refererer til summen af: Forsøg på drab eller manddrab, Overfald inkl. groft,\nVoldtægt inkl. groft, Alvorlig kvindefredskrænkelse, Alvorlig fredskrænkelse,\nVold mod tjenestemand og Røveri inkl. groft, antal/100.000 indbyggere.\nStatistikken indberettes pr. kommune, hvor forbrydelsen blev begået\n(gerningssted). Fra 2015 refererer dataene pr. kommune kun til forbrydelser,\nder kunne spores til kommunen. I tidligere år var der forbrydelser, der blev\nbegået i regionen, men som ikke kunne knyttes til en specifik kommune. For\ndette nøgletal tælles manglende overholdelse som 0.\n\nKilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Refers to the summation of: Attempted murder or manslaughter, Assault incl.\naggravated, Rape incl. aggravated, Serious violation of the peace of women,\nSerious violation of the peace, Violence against an official and Robbery incl.\naggravated, number/100,000 inhabitants. The statistics are reported by the\nmunicipality where the crime was committed (crime scene). From 2015, the data\nper municipality only refers to crimes that could be traced to the\nmunicipality. In previous years, there were crimes that were committed in the\nregion but could not be linked to a specific municipality. For this key\nfigure, non-compliance is counted as 0.\n\nSource: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Avser summering av: Försök till mord eller dråp, Misshandel inkl. grov, Våldtäkt inkl. grov, Grov kvinnofridskränkning, Grov fridskränkning, Våld mot tjänsteman och Rån inkl. grovt, antal/100 000 inv.\nStatistiken redovisas efter den kommun där brottet har begåtts (brottsplats). Fr.o.m. 2015 avser uppgifterna per kommun endast de brott som kunnat härledas till kommunen. Tidigare år fanns det med brott som begåtts i regionen men inte kunnat kopplas till en specifik kommun. För detta nyckeltal räknas bortfall som 0.\n\nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-11-24T13:59:31.200910"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:49:10.243414"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Anmeldte voldelige forbrydelser, antal/100.000 indbyggere"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Reported violent crimes, number/100,000 inhabitants"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Anmälda våldsbrott, antal/100 000 inv"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:babe5361f856427b26488c35338fd3ef9b0c0dcdd687cdff6836c4f8fc6c889d"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:bad2368b2917f3aa3ebf40eb38adb1d071159bbe95b898a3b4e2bec924eb3023_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/634b0279-b31b-4176-abab-3663d0e3c675","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/634b0279-b31b-4176-abab-3663d0e3c675/resource/3f2aff0b-6b93-456e-a98d-aacf38b7f9cb"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ECON"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Afvigelse i procent mellem nettoomkostninger og referenceomkostninger for\ngrundskole inklusive førskoleklasse, SEK pr. indbygger. Nettoomkostninger er\nbruttoomkostninger minus bruttoindkomst.\n\nReferenceomkostningerne er baseret på nettoomkostningerne ved grundskole og\nførskoleklasser i landet, andelen af ​​6-15-årige i kommunen, børn med\nudenlandsk baggrund og antagelser om meromkostninger til små skoler og\nskoletransport. Derudover lægges en del af standardomkostningerne fra\ndelmodellerne for lønninger, bygningsstruktur og befolkningsudvikling til.\n\nPositive værdier indikerer en højere omkostningssituation end statistisk\nforventet, og negative værdier indikerer en lavere omkostningssituation end\nstatistisk forventet.\n\nFra og med 2019 beregnes nettoomkostningsvarians på en ny måde på grund af\nændringer i omkostningsudligningen. Dette påvirker sammenligneligheden med\ntidligere år.\n\nKilde: SKR.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Deviation in percentage between net cost and reference cost for compulsory\nschool including preschool class, SEK per inhabitant. Net cost is gross cost\nminus gross income.\n\nThe reference cost is based on the net cost of compulsory school and preschool\nclasses in the country, the proportion of 6-15 year olds in the municipality,\nchildren with a foreign background, and assumptions about additional costs for\nsmall schools and school transport. In addition, part of the standard costs\nfrom the sub-models for salaries, building structure, and population\ndevelopment are added.\n\nPositive values ​​indicate a higher cost situation than statistically expected\nand negative values ​​indicate a lower cost situation than statistically\nexpected.\n\nStarting in 2019, net cost variance is calculated in a new way due to changes\nin cost equalization. This affects comparability with previous years.\n\nSource: SKR.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Avvikelse i procent mellan nettokostnad och referenskostnad för grundskola inklusive förskoleklass, kronor per invånare. Nettokostnad är bruttokostnad minus bruttointäkt. \n\nReferenskostnaden bygger på nettokostnaden  för grundskola och förskoleklass i riket, andel 6-15-åringar i kommunen, barn med utländsk bakgrund samt antaganden om merkostnader för små skolor och skolskjuts. Därutöver tillkommer del av standardkostnaderna från delmodellerna löner, bebyggelsestruktur och befolkningsutveckling. \n\nPositiva värden indikerar högre kostnadsläge än statistiskt förväntat och negativa värden ett lägre kostnadsläge än statistiskt förväntat. \n\nFrån och med 2019 beräknas nettokostnadsavvikelse på ett nytt sätt på grund av förändringar i kostnadsutjämningen. Detta påverkar jämförbarheten med tidigare år. \n\nKälla: SKR."}],"dct:identifier":"634b0279-b31b-4176-abab-3663d0e3c675","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-15"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:40:05.717385"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:bad2368b2917f3aa3ebf40eb38adb1d071159bbe95b898a3b4e2bec924eb3023_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Nettoomkostningsafvigelse for folkeskolens F-9, procent"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Net cost deviation for primary school F-9, percent"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nettokostnadsavvikelse grundskola F-9, procent"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/634b0279-b31b-4176-abab-3663d0e3c675/resource/3f2aff0b-6b93-456e-a98d-aacf38b7f9cb","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N15001"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Afvigelse i procent mellem nettoomkostninger og referenceomkostninger for\ngrundskole inkl. førskoleklasse, SEK/indbygger. Nettoomkostninger er\nbruttoomkostninger minus bruttoindkomst. Referenceomkostningerne er baseret på\nnettoomkostningerne for grundskole og førskoleklasse i landet, andelen af\n​​6-15-årige i kommunen, børn med udenlandsk baggrund og antagelser om\nmeromkostninger til små skoler og skoletransport. Derudover lægges en del af\nstandardomkostningerne fra delmodellerne lønninger, bygningsstruktur og\nbefolkningsudvikling til. Positive værdier indikerer en højere\nomkostningssituation end statistisk forventet, og negative værdier en lavere\nomkostningssituation end statistisk forventet. Fra og med 2019 beregnes\nnettoomkostningsafvigelsen på en ny måde på grund af ændringer i\nomkostningsudligningen. Dette påvirker sammenligneligheden med tidligere år.\nKilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Deviation in percentage between net cost and reference cost for compulsory\nschool incl. preschool class, SEK/inhabitant. Net cost is gross cost minus\ngross income. The reference cost is based on the net cost for compulsory\nschool and preschool class in the country, the proportion of 6-15 year olds in\nthe municipality, children with a foreign background and assumptions about\nadditional costs for small schools and school transport. In addition, part of\nthe standard costs from the sub-models salaries, building structure and\npopulation development are added. Positive values ​​indicate a higher cost\nsituation than statistically expected and negative values ​​a lower cost\nsituation than statistically expected. From 2019 onwards, the net cost\ndeviation is calculated in a new way due to changes in cost equalization. This\naffects comparability with previous years. Source: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Avvikelse i procent mellan nettokostnad och referenskostnad för grundskola inkl. förskoleklass, kr/inv. Nettokostnad är bruttokostnad minus bruttointäkt. Referenskostnaden bygger på nettokostnaden  för grundskola och förskoleklass i riket, andel 6-15-åringar i kommunen, barn med utländsk bakgrund samt antaganden om merkostnader för små skolor och skolskjuts. Därutöver tillkommer del av standardkostnaderna från delmodellerna löner, bebyggelsestruktur och befolkningsutveckling. Positiva värden indikerar högre kostnadsläge än statistiskt förväntat och negativa värden ett lägre kostnadsläge än statistiskt förväntat. Från och med 2019 beräknas nettokostnadsavvikelse på ett nytt sätt pga förändringar i kostnadsutjämningen.  Detta påverkar jämförbarheten med tidigare år. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-16T08:06:27.816477"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:40:05.728408"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Afvigelse i nettoomkostninger, folkeskole F-9, (%) (N15001)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Net cost deviation, primary school F-9, (%) (N15001)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nettokostnadsavvikelse grundskola F-9, (%) (N15001)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:bad2368b2917f3aa3ebf40eb38adb1d071159bbe95b898a3b4e2bec924eb3023"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:bb66db94d2fdd5cb28ce8a1c662fb1f245512db8393df87b3500f355572275c4_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"dd8ab91b334b0ced12b2564244ba26ef"},{"@id":"_:bb66db94d2fdd5cb28ce8a1c662fb1f245512db8393df87b3500f355572275c4_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Karl McShane","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:karl.mcshane@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/b73bb90f-36b4-4acd-9d70-7674db31e175","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/b73bb90f-36b4-4acd-9d70-7674db31e175/resource/96da3f7c-3b2a-4172-b8c4-4c6ed9dc88c8"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/b73bb90f-36b4-4acd-9d70-7674db31e175/resource/c3cc2f39-801e-4506-ac97-29c5d9241723"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Viser fødeland for befolkningen opdelt i tre kategorier: Sverige, Andre\nnordiske lande og Andre lande. Variablen er opdelt efter køn. Data fra\nBefolkningsregisteret (RTB).\n\n**Variabelbeskrivelse**  \nDu finder det\n[her](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**API'er**  \nVed at bruge API-kaldet\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics_\nkan du hente alle datasæt, der indeholder statistiske data for Malmøs områder,\ni JSON-format.  \nI hver forekomst af result/results i JSON-resultatet er der en \"id\"-egenskab\nfor hver ressource. Værdien af ​​\"id\" kan bruges til at hente dataene for den\nrespektive statistikvariabel (i henhold til værdien af ​​egenskaben \"name\").\nAPI-kald til at hente statistikdataene:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-\nværdi]_\n\nBrug gerne tallene, men angiv \"Bykontoret, Malmö Kommune\" som kilde.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Shows country of birth for the population divided into three categories:\nSweden, Other Nordic countries and Other countries. The variable is divided by\ngender. Data from the Register of Total Population (RTB).\n\n**Variable description**  \nYou find it\n[here](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**APIs**  \nUsing the API call\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics,_\nyou can retrieve all data sets that contain statistical data for Malmö's areas\nin JSON format.  \nIn each instance of result/results in the JSON result, there is an \"id\"\nproperty for each resource. The value of \"id\" can be used to retrieve the data\nfor the respective statistics variable (according to the value of the \"name\"\nproperty). API call to retrieve the statistics data:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id\nvalue]_\n\nFeel free to use the numbers, but cite “City Office, Malmö City” as the\nsource.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visar födelseland för befolkningen uppdelat på tre kategorier: Sverige, Övriga Norden och Övriga länder. Variabeln finns uppdelad på kön. Data från Registret över Totalbefolkningen (RTB).\n\n__Variabelbeskrivning__  \nHittar du [här](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)!  \n                     \n__API__  \nMed hjälp av API-anropet *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistik* får man i JSON-format fram samtliga datamängder som innehåller statistikunderlag för Malmös områden.  \nI varje instans av result/results i JSON-resultatet finns för varje resurs en egenskap \"id\". Värdet för \"id\" kan användas för att hämta datan för respektive statistikvariabel (enligt värdet för egenskapen \"name\").\nAPI-anrop för att hämta statistikdatan: *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-värdet]*   \n\nAnvänd gärna siffrorna, men ange “Stadskontoret, Malmö stad” som källa."}],"dct:identifier":"b73bb90f-36b4-4acd-9d70-7674db31e175","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-16"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:02:50.457378"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:bb66db94d2fdd5cb28ce8a1c662fb1f245512db8393df87b3500f355572275c4_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Fødselsland - Statistiske data for Malmøs områder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Country of birth - Statistical data for Malmö's areas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Födelseland - Statistikunderlag för Malmös områden"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/b73bb90f-36b4-4acd-9d70-7674db31e175/resource/96da3f7c-3b2a-4172-b8c4-4c6ed9dc88c8","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/b73bb90f-36b4-4acd-9d70-7674db31e175/resource/96da3f7c-3b2a-4172-b8c4-4c6ed9dc88c8/download/fodelseland.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"2768449"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø statistik - Fødselsland\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Country of birth\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Födelseland"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:15:05.539460"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:02:50.475040"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Fødselsland"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Country of birth"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Födelseland"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:bb66db94d2fdd5cb28ce8a1c662fb1f245512db8393df87b3500f355572275c4_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/b73bb90f-36b4-4acd-9d70-7674db31e175/resource/c3cc2f39-801e-4506-ac97-29c5d9241723","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=96da3f7c-3b2a-4172-b8c4-4c6ed9dc88c8"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø statistik - Fødselsland\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Country of birth\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Födelseland"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:15:10.600268"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:15:24.791300"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Fødselsland"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Country of birth"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Födelseland"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:bb66db94d2fdd5cb28ce8a1c662fb1f245512db8393df87b3500f355572275c4"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:bb6ab59c63a74c47c872163ec805966bff5693e5d0671b9b76b3982a52976e80_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/abd7da407bcfbc956fd6c0e91189412f","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Fastighets- och gatukontoret","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:gis.fgk@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/af65d263-dfe9-408d-89e9-2aa11be87624","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/abd7da407bcfbc956fd6c0e91189412f"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/af65d263-dfe9-408d-89e9-2aa11be87624/resource/7bf46951-6280-4315-a74f-28a7d36815e6"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/af65d263-dfe9-408d-89e9-2aa11be87624/resource/99e3c9ba-4b1c-4294-ac25-c838303f464c"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","bus stop","kollektivtrafik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/WEEKLY"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"**Malmø bybusstoppesteder og deres stoppesteder**  \nDatasættet omfatter Torups rekreative område¹ og bruges som arbejdsdata af\nEjendoms- og Vejkontoret.  \nDataene indeholder stoppesteder, der er placeret inden for Malmø bys og Torups\nrekreationsområdes ydre grænser.\n\n**Attribut**\n\n`stop_id` [unikt ID for stop/stoplokation]  \n`stop_name` [stoppestedsnavn]  \n`location_type` [0 eller 1 (stoplokation eller stop)]  \n`parent_station` [id for det stop, som stoppositionen tilhører]  \n`platform_code` [betegnelse for stoplokation]  \n`date_processed` [dato for sidste behandling af Malmö City²]\n\n**Geometri**  \nType: Punkt  \nCRS: WGS84\n\n¹ I 1970 købte Malmø Kommune Torup-godsområdet for at sikre adgang til dette\nfriluftsområde. Området har været et naturreservat siden 2019. Malmø Kommunes\nEjendoms- og Vejkontor har aktiviteter, der arbejder med vedligeholdelse af\nbygninger, jord og organisering af arrangementer i Torup.  \n² Behandlede åbne data fra Samtrafiken/Trafiklab (trafiklab.se) er blevet\nbrugt til at producere dette datasæt.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"**Malmö city bus stops and their stop locations**  \nThe data set includes Torup's recreation area¹ and is used as working data by\nthe Real Estate and Street Office.  \nThe data contains stops that are located within the outer boundaries of the\ncity of Malmö and the Torup recreation area.\n\n**Attribute**\n\n`stop_id` [unique ID for stop/stop location]  \n`stop_name` [stop name]  \n`location_type` [0 or 1 (stop location or stop)]  \n`parent_station` [id of the stop to which the stop position belongs]  \n`platform_code` [stop location designation]  \n`date_processed` [date of last processing by Malmö City²]\n\n**Geometry**  \nType: Point  \nCRS: WGS84\n\n¹ In 1970, the City of Malmö purchased the Torup estate area to ensure access\nto this outdoor recreation area. The area has been a nature reserve since\n2019. The Property and Street Office of the City of Malmö has operations that\nwork with maintaining buildings, land and organizing events in Torup.  \n² Processed open data from Samtrafiken/Trafiklab (trafiklab.se) has been used\nto produce this dataset.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"__Malmö stads busshållplatser och deras hållplatslägen__   \nDatamängden innefattar Torups rekreationsområde¹ och används som arbetsunderlag av Fastighets- och gatukontoret.  \nDatan innehåller hållplatser som ligger inom Malmö stads och Torups rekreationsområdes yttre avgränsningar.  \n  \n__Attribut__   \n  \n`stop_id` [unikt id för hållplats/hållplatsläge]  \n`stop_name` [hållplatsnamn]  \n`location_type` [0 eller 1 (hållplatsläge eller hållplats)]  \n`parent_station` [id på hållplats som hållplatsläge tillhör]  \n`platform_code` [hållplatsläges beteckning]  \n`date_processed` [datum för senaste bearbetning gjord av Malmö stad²]  \n  \n__Geometri__  \nTyp: Point  \nCRS: WGS84  \n  \n¹ År 1970 köpte Malmö stad området Torups gods, för att säkerställa tillgången till detta frilufts- och rekreationsområde. Området är naturreservat sedan år 2019. Fastighets- och gatukontoret i Malmö stad har verksamheter som arbetar med att underhålla byggnader, mark och att anordna evenemang i Torup.  \n² Bearbetad öppen data från Samtrafiken/Trafiklab (trafiklab.se) har använts för att producera denna datamängd."}],"dct:identifier":"af65d263-dfe9-408d-89e9-2aa11be87624","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-04-09"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-12T03:00:13.068844"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:source":{"@id":"https://www.trafiklab.se/api/gtfs-datasets/gtfs-regional/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:bb6ab59c63a74c47c872163ec805966bff5693e5d0671b9b76b3982a52976e80_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Busstoppesteder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Bus stops"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Busshållplatser"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/af65d263-dfe9-408d-89e9-2aa11be87624/resource/7bf46951-6280-4315-a74f-28a7d36815e6","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/af65d263-dfe9-408d-89e9-2aa11be87624/resource/7bf46951-6280-4315-a74f-28a7d36815e6/download/malmohallplatser.geojson"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"385834"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Busstoppesteder\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Bus stops\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Busshållplatser"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/GEOJSON"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2025-04-15T07:57:04.857518"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-12T03:00:06.511925"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Busstoppesteder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Bus stops"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Busshållplatser"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/af65d263-dfe9-408d-89e9-2aa11be87624/resource/99e3c9ba-4b1c-4294-ac25-c838303f464c","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/af65d263-dfe9-408d-89e9-2aa11be87624/resource/99e3c9ba-4b1c-4294-ac25-c838303f464c/download/hallplatser.sld"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"2744"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"-\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"-\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"-"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2025-04-14T10:53:36.764381"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-03-18T20:25:27.419338"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Stilisering"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Stylization"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stilsättning"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:bb6ab59c63a74c47c872163ec805966bff5693e5d0671b9b76b3982a52976e80"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:bbbed7d6df7da317c62d8664e03c781a1cec609aa74717d39dddeba5d634ad0a_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/485fcc4c-34fd-4ded-afbd-8dc0e3bff993","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/485fcc4c-34fd-4ded-afbd-8dc0e3bff993/resource/979a0054-7af2-457e-8220-98e02177d531"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/EDUC"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Antal elever i 9. klasse, der er berettigede til naturvidenskabelige og\nteknologiske uddannelser, divideret med antallet af elever, der fik eller\nville have fået karakterer i mindst ét ​​fag i henhold til det mål- og\nvidensrelaterede karaktersystem i 9. klasse.\n\nStatistik i procenter i 2011.\n\n  * Dataene vedrører elever, der er registreret i kommunen.\n  * Studerende med ukendt baggrund er ikke inkluderet.\n  * Oplysningerne refererer til studieåret.\n\nKilde: Statistiska centralbanken og Skolstyrelsen.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Number of students in grade 9 who are eligible for the science and technology\nprograms divided by the number of students who received or would have received\ngrades in at least one subject according to the goal- and knowledge-related\ngrading system in grade 9.\n\nStatistics in percentages in 2011.\n\n  * The data refers to students registered in the municipality.\n  * Students with unknown backgrounds are not included.\n  * The information refers to the academic year.\n\nSource: Statistics Sweden and the Swedish National Agency for Education.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal elever i årskurs 9 som är behöriga till naturvetenskaps- och teknikprogrammen dividerat med antal elever som fått eller skulle ha fått betyg i minst ett ämne enligt det mål- och kunskapsrelaterade betygssystemet i årskurs 9.\n\nStatistik i procent i 2011.\n\n* Uppgiften avser elever folkbokförda i kommunen.  \n* Elever med okänd bakgrund ingår inte.  \n* Uppgiften avser läsår. \n\nKälla: SCB och Skolverket."}],"dct:identifier":"485fcc4c-34fd-4ded-afbd-8dc0e3bff993","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-15"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:38:49.690795"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:bbbed7d6df7da317c62d8664e03c781a1cec609aa74717d39dddeba5d634ad0a_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elever i 9. klasse, der er berettigede til naturvidenskabelige og teknologiske uddannelser, hjemkommune"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Students in grade 9 who are eligible for the science and technology programs, home municipality"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elever i årskurs 9 som är behöriga till naturvetenskaps- och teknikprogrammen, hemkommun"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/485fcc4c-34fd-4ded-afbd-8dc0e3bff993/resource/979a0054-7af2-457e-8220-98e02177d531","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N15425"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Antal elever i 9. klasse, der er berettigede til naturvidenskabelige og\nteknologiske uddannelser, divideret med antallet af elever, der fik eller\nville have fået karakterer i mindst ét ​​fag i henhold til det mål- og\nvidensrelaterede karaktersystem i 9. klasse. Dataene refererer til elever, der\ner registreret i kommunen. Elever med ukendt baggrund er ikke inkluderet.\nDataene refererer til skoleåret. Kilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Number of students in grade 9 who are eligible for the science and technology\nprograms divided by the number of students who received or would have received\ngrades in at least one subject according to the goal- and knowledge-related\ngrading system in grade 9. The data refers to students registered in the\nmunicipality. Students with unknown backgrounds are not included. The data\nrefers to the school year. Source: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal elever i årskurs 9 som är behöriga till naturvetenskaps- och teknikprogrammen dividerat med antal elever som fått eller skulle ha fått betyg i minst ett ämne enligt det mål- och kunskapsrelaterade betygssystemet i årskurs 9. Uppgiften avser elever folkbokförda i kommunen. Elever med okänd bakgrund ingår inte. Uppgiften avser läsår. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-15T07:26:58.651772"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:38:49.715172"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elever i 9. klasse, der er berettigede til naturvidenskabelige og teknologiske uddannelser, bopælskommune, procentdel (%) (N15425)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Students in grade 9 who are eligible for science and technology programs, municipality of residence, percentage (%) (N15425)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elever i åk 9 som är behöriga till naturvetenskaps- och teknikprogrammen, hemkommun,  andel (%) (N15425)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:bbbed7d6df7da317c62d8664e03c781a1cec609aa74717d39dddeba5d634ad0a"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:bd7e3059191db90f57ecbf52f06c2f4423689dd16cdee91b479ede91b7d12228_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/1afcf19d-cad8-4472-a3d9-7fcdbde8a13a","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/1afcf19d-cad8-4472-a3d9-7fcdbde8a13a/resource/b597cbfd-df5d-4a8c-9c25-0206ef31146f"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/EDUC"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Alle data refererer til elever i skoler med karakterer i henhold til det mål-\nog vidensrelaterede karaktersystem.\n\nStatistik i procenter fra 2013.\n\nBegrebet \"lokationskommune\" henviser til elever i både kommunale og friskoler\nbeliggende i kommunen, uanset hvor de er indskrevet.\n\nKilde: Den svenske statslige skolestyrelse (Siris)\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"All data refers to students in schools with grades according to the goal- and\nknowledge-related grading system.\n\nStatistics in percentages from 2013.\n\nThe term \"location municipality\" refers to students in both municipal and\nindependent schools located in the municipality, regardless of where they are\nregistered.\n\nSource: Swedish National Agency for Education (Siris)\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samtliga uppgifter avser elever i skolor med betyg enligt det mål- och kunskapsrelaterade betygssystemet. \n\nStatistik i procent från 2013.\n\nMed lägeskommun avses elever i både kommunala och fristående skolor belägna i kommunen oavsett var de är folkbokförda. \n\nKälla: Skolverket (Siris)"}],"dct:identifier":"1afcf19d-cad8-4472-a3d9-7fcdbde8a13a","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-15"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:16:15.800344"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:bd7e3059191db90f57ecbf52f06c2f4423689dd16cdee91b479ede91b7d12228_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elever i 9. klasse med minimum karakteren E i engelsk, placeringskommune"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Students in grade 9 with a minimum grade of E in English, location municipality"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elever i åk 9 med lägst betyget E  i engelska, lägeskommun"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/1afcf19d-cad8-4472-a3d9-7fcdbde8a13a/resource/b597cbfd-df5d-4a8c-9c25-0206ef31146f","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N15492"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Alle data refererer til elever i skoler med karakterer i henhold til det mål-\nog vidensrelaterede karaktersystem. Elever i 9. klasse med minimum karakteren\nE i engelsk, kommune, procentdel (%). Kommune refererer til elever i både\nkommunale og private skoler beliggende i kommunen, uanset hvor de er\nindskrevet. Kilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"All data refers to students in schools with grades according to the goal- and\nknowledge-related grading system. Students in grade 9 with a minimum grade of\nE in English, municipality of location, percentage (%). Municipality of\nlocation refers to students in both municipal and independent schools located\nin the municipality regardless of where they are registered. Source: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samtliga uppgifter avser elever i skolor med betyg enligt det mål- och kunskapsrelaterade betygssystemet. Elever i åk 9 med lägst betyget E  i engelska, lägeskommun, andel (%). Med lägeskommun avses elever i både kommunala och fristående skolor belägna i kommunen oavsett var de är folkbokförda. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-19T08:27:39.081688"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:16:15.821852"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elever i 9. klasse med minimumskarakteren E i engelsk, kommune, procentdel (%) (N15492)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Students in grade 9 with a minimum grade of E in English, municipality of location, percentage (%) (N15492)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elever i åk 9 med lägst betyget E  i engelska, lägeskommun, andel (%) (N15492)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:bd7e3059191db90f57ecbf52f06c2f4423689dd16cdee91b479ede91b7d12228"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:c1664a07035de238f5eed118c85782f47cf242679bd721e04628dfc93404af6c_b0n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Address","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#street-address":"Bergsgatan 17 Malmö"},{"@id":"_:c1664a07035de238f5eed118c85782f47cf242679bd721e04628dfc93404af6c_b1n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"686a8f6bff35e7cf6c45bef2e9f9aa133ce9a0e8"},{"@id":"_:c1664a07035de238f5eed118c85782f47cf242679bd721e04628dfc93404af6c_b2n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/r