blandt andet Malmøs befolkning,\nerhvervsliv, boligmarked og Malmö Citys drift. Publikationen indeholder også\nårsrapporter fra byens drift, deres regnskaber osv. Nogle af filerne er store\nog kan tage et stykke tid at indlæse.\n\nBemærk at der i årbøgerne fra 1951 og 1952 er en fejl i sidenummereringen,\nhvilket får det til at se ud som om der mangler sider før kapitlet\n\"Regnskaber\".\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"The Malmö City Yearbook contains statistics on, among other things, Malmö's\npopulation, business, housing market and Malmö City's operations. The\npublication also contains annual reports from the city's operations, their\naccounts, etc. Some of the files are large and may take a while to load.\n\nNote that in the 1951 and 1952 yearbooks there is an error in the page\nnumbering, which makes it appear that there are missing pages before the\nchapter \"Accounts\".\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö stads årsbok innehåller statistik om bland annat Malmös befolkning, näringsliv, bostadsmarknad och Malmö stads verksamheter. Publikationen innehåller även årsredogörelser från stadens verksamheter, deras räkenskaper med mera. Vissa av filerna är stora och kan ta ett tag att ladda.\n\nNotera att det i 1951 och 1952 års årsböcker är fel i sidnumreringen vilket gör att det framstår som att det saknas sidor innan kapitlet \"Räkenskaper\"."}],"dct:identifier":"420ff1c9-fc30-415b-85a9-b44bf8bc6929","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-19"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-03-25T15:30:04.441894"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:d6bef23a5fa471f601a8cec47b01d3e3952f5c7c8c44ca8266d0bc64d77a14d6_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:d6bef23a5fa471f601a8cec47b01d3e3952f5c7c8c44ca8266d0bc64d77a14d6_b1n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø Bys Årbog 1913 - 1960/1961"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö City Yearbook 1913 - 1960/1961"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö stads årsbok 1913 - 1960/1961"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/420ff1c9-fc30-415b-85a9-b44bf8bc6929/resource/0054728e-1578-4c9a-831f-63c0de24db91","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://mmostatfiler.malmo.se/arsbok/arsbok_1943.pdf"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"* * *\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"* * *\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"---"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/PDF"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-12-20T07:51:29.514684"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-03-18T20:34:44.723220"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø Bys Årbog 1943"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö City Yearbook 1943"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö stads årsbok 1943"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/420ff1c9-fc30-415b-85a9-b44bf8bc6929/resource/024e617e-2395-4cc7-88e0-d5a6facba1a7","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://mmostatfiler.malmo.se/arsbok/arsbok_1935.pdf"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"* * *\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"* * *\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"---"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/PDF"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-12-20T07:51:20.314642"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/pub