le":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Nabolag GeoPackage 4326"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Neighborhoods GeoPackage 4326"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stadsdelar GeoPackage 4326"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:e7e7df50b0472ad1162738c37e3925f944ed697ef7393e6d54856ae38fbaebbc"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:e87b18f2190aa30fc37d08ab73c9b0042b6b61480b0bceea2e4d5c0ed752b7fe_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"e83c8919fdcfe9f7f76a968186e64d51"},{"@id":"_:e87b18f2190aa30fc37d08ab73c9b0042b6b61480b0bceea2e4d5c0ed752b7fe_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Karl McShane","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:karl.mcshane@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/f1b264db-5b24-4522-975b-b4c308903433","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/f1b264db-5b24-4522-975b-b4c308903433/resource/09a9dcd1-6820-4c4f-b4ca-367bc17020d2"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/f1b264db-5b24-4522-975b-b4c308903433/resource/fb4dc51f-2587-4c75-a745-eb22b3da9b25"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Viser antallet af personbiler i trafikken, der er registreret på fysiske\npersoner i området. Data fra det svenske køretøjsregister.\n\n**Variabelbeskrivelse**  \nDu finder det\n[her](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**API'er**  \nVed at bruge API-kaldet\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics_\nkan du hente alle datasæt, der indeholder statistiske data for Malmøs områder,\ni JSON-format.  \nI hver forekomst af result/results i JSON-resultatet er der en \"id\"-egenskab\nfor hver ressource. Værdien af ​​\"id\" kan bruges til at hente dataene for den\nrespektive statistikvariabel (i henhold til værdien af ​​egenskaben \"name\").\nAPI-kald for at hente statistikdataene:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-\nværdi]_\n\nBrug gerne tallene, men angiv \"Bykontoret, Malmö Kommune\" som kilde.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Shows the number of passenger cars in traffic that are registered to natural\npersons in the area. Data from the Swedish Vehicle Register.\n\n**Variable description**  \nYou find it\n[here](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**APIs**  \nUsing the API call\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics,_\nyou can retrieve all data sets that contain statistical data for Malmö's areas\nin JSON format.  \nIn each instance of result/results in the JSON result, there is an \"id\"\nproperty for each resource. The value of \"id\" can be used to retrieve the data\nfor the respective statistics variable (according to the value of the \"name\"\nproperty). API call to retrieve the statistics data:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id\nvalue]_\n\nFeel free to use the numbers, but cite “City Office, Malmö City” as the\nsource.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visar antalet personbilar i trafik som finns registrerade på fysiska personer inom området. Data från Fordonsregistret.\n\n__Variabelbeskrivning__  \nHittar du [här](https://malmo.se/download/18.4968b1201a03e2e59771007/1791175330421/Variabelbeskrivning%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)!  \n                     \n__API__  \nMed hjälp av API-anropet *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistik* får man i JSON-format fram samtliga datamängder som innehåller statistikunderlag för Malmös områden.  \nI varje instans av result/results i JSON-resultatet finns för varje resurs en egenskap \"id\". Värdet för \"id\" kan användas för att hämta datan för respektive statistikvariabel (enligt värdet för egenskapen \"name\").\nAPI-anrop för att hämta statistikdatan: *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-värdet]*   \n\nAnvänd gärna siffrorna, men ange “Stadskontoret, Malmö stad” som källa."}],"dct:identifier":"f1b264db-5b24-4522-975b-b4c308903433","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-16"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:08:47.909109"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:e87b18f2190aa30fc37d08ab73c9b0042b6b61480b0bceea2e4d5c0ed752b7fe_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Biler i trafikken - Statistiske data for Malmøs områder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Cars in traffic - Statistical data for Malmö's areas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bilar i trafik - Statistikunderlag för Malmös områden"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/f1b264db-5b24-4522-975b-b4c308903433/resource/09a9dcd1-6820-4c4f-b4ca-367bc17020d2","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/f1b264db-5b24-4522-975b-b4c308903433/resource/09a9dcd1-6820-4c4f-b4ca-367bc17020d2/download/bilar-i-trafik.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"233346"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø statistik - Biler i trafikken\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö statistics - Cars in traffic\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö statistik - Bilar i trafik"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-10T07:21:22.487245"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-15T23:08:47.914927"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Biler i trafikken"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Cars in traffic"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bilar i trafik"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:e87b18f2190aa30fc37d08ab73c9b0042b6b61480b0bceea2e4d5c0ed752b7fe_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/f1b264db-5b24-4522-975b-b4c308903433/resource/fb4dc51f-2587-4c75-a745-eb22b3da9b25","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=09a9dcd1-6820-4c4f-b4ca-367bc17020d2"},"dct:description":[{"@langu