55-a7213e2ff71a"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fe874d5d-ab1d-46d9-8631-3e910e59cdba/resource/ae9be5ba-879d-40e3-93bb-93bcdb7fbe03"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fe874d5d-ab1d-46d9-8631-3e910e59cdba/resource/af49adb1-12d6-4c59-9afb-fbd31c33d341"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fe874d5d-ab1d-46d9-8631-3e910e59cdba/resource/ba7079a1-e8ab-4475-824c-c45c0d8d0727"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fe874d5d-ab1d-46d9-8631-3e910e59cdba/resource/ba7b59c5-debf-4731-8c35-eab78b3cac51"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fe874d5d-ab1d-46d9-8631-3e910e59cdba/resource/bfcdc21f-b693-407b-ac0f-b8566a045a64"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fe874d5d-ab1d-46d9-8631-3e910e59cdba/resource/c29e421d-ab8a-4826-93b3-83d55b697ff0"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fe874d5d-ab1d-46d9-8631-3e910e59cdba/resource/c80673a6-0b81-408a-9013-7e8d4e7c82b3"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fe874d5d-ab1d-46d9-8631-3e910e59cdba/resource/cfd406b8-0733-4406-934c-cbbdbcf6946e"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fe874d5d-ab1d-46d9-8631-3e910e59cdba/resource/d3436ddd-7dd1-4dd6-93c0-a1b480fc830e"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fe874d5d-ab1d-46d9-8631-3e910e59cdba/resource/eb891bbb-d16d-48b4-ab2a-38658b84e222"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fe874d5d-ab1d-46d9-8631-3e910e59cdba/resource/fb9fffd2-1d3e-44c7-9586-92c0f8b26401"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","solceller","solenergi","solkraft","solpaneler"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENER"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/MONTHLY"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø har solcelleanlæg på mange af sine bygninger i byen, for eksempel på\nskoler, plejehjem, museer og administrationskontorer.\n\nDette datasæt indeholder:  \n\\- Solcelleanlæg ejet af Malmø kommune.  \n\\- Produceret elektricitet i kilowatt-timer fra solcelleanlæggene. Opdelt på\nmåned, pr. system og time.\n\n**Attributter i ressource solcellesystemer**\n\n  * `Id [anläggnings-id]`\n  * `Name [populärnamn på anläggningen]`\n  * `ModuleArea [sammanlagd solpanelyta i kvadratmeter]`\n  * `StartupDate [installationsdatum]`\n  * `PanelCount [totalt antal solpaneler i anläggningen]`\n  * `PanelType [typ av solpanel]`\n  * `Enabled [aktiverad]`\n  * `MaxDisplayValue [installerad effekt (kWp)]`\n  * `Address [anläggningens placering, postadress]`\n  * `geometry [anläggningens placering, typ: Point, CRS: WGS84]`\n\nEn værdi på 0 eller -1 kan forekomme for PanelCount. Det betyder, at der\nmangler data.\n\n**Attributter i ressource Elproduktion**\n\n  * `Id [anläggnings-id]`\n  * `AggregationType [aggregationsgranularitet]`\n  * `ProductionData`  \n\\- `StartDate [datum och heltimme]`  \n\\- `Produced [producerad el i kWh sedan närmast föregående heltimme]`\n\nI løbet af foråret 2025 blev der foretaget en justering af ID'erne for en\nrække faciliteter.  \nFølgende tabel viser de gamle og nye ID'er for de berørte faciliteter:  \n`1005_A_AS1_SOL_E1 --> 1005_A_AS1_6390_ELM1_E1`  \n`1063_F_SOL_E1 --> 1063_F_6390_ELM1_E1`  \n`1601_A_AS3_ELM_SOL_E1 --> 1601_A_6390_ELM1_E1`  \n`1719_B_AS1_SOL_BYA_E1 --> 1719_A_AS1_6390_ELM1_E1`  \n`1719_B_AS1_SOL_BYB_E1 --> 1719_B_AS1_6390_ELM1_E1`  \n`1896_A_A1EE_SOLPANEL_E1 --> 1896_A_6390_ELM1_E1`  \n`1906_A_6390_EM1_E1 --> 1906_A_6390_ELM1_E1`\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"The city of Malmö has solar cell systems on many of its buildings in the city,\nfor example at schools, retirement homes, museums and administrative offices.\n\nThis dataset contains:  \n\\- Solar cell systems owned by the city of Malmö.  \n\\- Electricity produced in kilowatt hours from the solar cell systems. Divided\nby month, per system and hour.\n\n**Attributes in resource Solar cell systems**\n\n  * `Id [anläggnings-id]`\n  * `Name [populärnamn på anläggningen]`\n  * `ModuleArea [sammanlagd solpanelyta i kvadratmeter]`\n  * `StartupDate [installationsdatum]`\n  * `PanelCount [totalt antal solpaneler i anläggningen]`\n  * `PanelType [typ av solpanel]`\n  * `Enabled [aktiverad]`\n  * `MaxDisplayValue [installerad effekt (kWp)]`\n  * `Address [anläggningens placering, postadress]`\n  * `geometry [anläggningens placering, typ: Point, CRS: WGS84]`\n\nA value of 0 or -1 can occur for PanelCount. This means that data is missing.\n\n**Attributes in resource Electricity generation**\n\n  * `Id [anläggnings-id]`\n  * `AggregationType [aggregationsgranularitet]`\n  * `ProductionData`  \n\\- `StartDate [datum och heltimme]`  \n\\- `Produced [producerad el i kWh sedan närmast föregående heltimme]`\n\nDuring the spring of 2025, an adjustment was made to the IDs of a number of\nfacilities.  \nThe following table shows the old and new IDs for the affected facilities:  \n`1005_A_AS1_SOL_E1 --> 1005_A_AS1_6390_ELM1_E1`  \n`1063_F_SOL_E1 --> 1063_F_6390_ELM1_E1`  \n`1601_A_AS3_ELM_SOL_E1 --> 1601_A_6390_ELM1_E1`  \n`1719_B_AS1_SOL_BYA_E1 --> 1719_A_AS1_6390_ELM1_E1`  \n`1719_B_AS1_SOL_BYB_E1 --> 1719_B_AS1_6390_ELM1_E1`  \n`1896_A_A1EE_SOLPANEL_E1 --> 1896_A_6390_ELM1_E1`  \n`1906_A_6390_EM1_E1 --> 1906_A_6390_ELM1_E1`\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö stad har solcellsanläggningar på många av sina byggnader i staden, till exempel på skolor, äldreboenden, museum och förvaltningskontor.\n\nDenna datamängd innehåller:  \n- Solcellsanläggningar ägda av Malmö stad.  \n- Producerad el i kilowattimmar från solcellsanläggningarna. Uppdelat månadsvis, per anläggning och timme.  \n  \n __Attribut i resurs Solcellsanläggningar__  \n  \n+ `Id [anläggnings-id]`  \n+  `Name [populärnamn på anläggningen]`  \n+ `ModuleArea [sammanlagd solpanelyta i kvadratmeter]`  \n+ `StartupDate [installationsdatum]`  \n+ `PanelCount [totalt antal solpaneler i anläggningen]`  \n+ `PanelType [typ av solpanel]`  \n+ `Enabled [aktiverad]`  \n+ `MaxDisplayValue [installerad effekt (kWp)]`  \n+ `Address [anläggningens placering, postadress]`  \n+ `geometry [anläggningens placering, typ: Point, CRS: WGS84]`  \n  \nVärde 0 eller -1 kan förekomma för PanelCount. Det innebär att uppgift saknas.  \n  \n__Attribut i resurs Elproduktion__  \n  \n+ `Id [anläggnings-id]`  \n+ `AggregationType [aggregationsgranularitet]`  \n+ `ProductionData`  \n-&nbsp; `StartDate [datum och heltimme]`  \n-&nbsp; `Produced [producerad el i kWh sedan närmast föregående heltimme]`  \n\nUnder våren 2025 gjordes en justering av ett antal anläggningars id.  \nFöljande tabell visar gammalt respektive nytt id för de påverkade anläggningarna:  \n`1005_A_AS1_SOL_E1 --> 1005_A_AS1_6390_ELM1_E1`  \n`1063_F_SOL_E1 --> 1063_F_6390_ELM1_E1`  \n`1601_A_AS3_ELM_SOL_E1 --> 1601_A_6390_ELM1_E1`  \n`1719_B_AS1_SOL_BYA_E1 --> 1719_A_AS1_6390_ELM1_E1`  \n`1719_B_AS1_SOL_BYB_E1 --> 1719_B_AS1_6390_ELM1_E1`  \n`1896_A_A1EE_SOLPANEL_E1 --> 1896_A_6390_ELM1_E1`  \n`1906_A_6390_EM1_E1 --> 1906_A_6390_ELM1_E1`  \n"}],"dct:identifier":"fe874d5d-ab1d-46d9-8631-3e910e59cdba","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-02-14"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-10-01T04:01:43.125272"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:f40aaf8b90dac658b06f1cacf357f7821d4189dca8d0b691aa5286e034af65b9_b6n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:f40aaf8b90dac658b06f1cacf357f7821d4189dca8d0b691aa5286e034af65b9_b7n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Solcelleanlæg ejet af Malmø kommune, elproduktion (kWh)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Solar cell plants owned by the city of Malmö, electricity production (kWh)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Solcellsanläggningar ägda av Malmö stad, elproduktion (kWh)"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fe874d5d-ab1d-46d9-8631-3e910e59cdba/resource/0c52083f-1f39-4692-adc9-860b5f5de7c7","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fe874d5d-ab1d-46d9-8631-3e910e59cdba/resource/0c52083f-1f39-4692-adc9-860b5f5de7c7/download/elproduktion.json"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"1260752"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elproduktion i kilowatt-timer (kWh)\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Electricity production in kilowatt hours (kWh)\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elproduktion i kilowattimmar (kWh)"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2024-10-01T04:00:11.513664"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-03-18T21:54:18.402536"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elproduktion 2024-09"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Electricity production 2024-09"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elproduktion 2024-09"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fe874d5d-ab1d-46d9-8631-3e910e59cdba/resource/0d4591cb-9c84-4746-bf9c-e4c5c4ec1575","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/fe874d5d-ab1d-46d9-8631-3e910e59cdba/resource/0d4591cb-9c84-4746-bf9c-e4c5c4ec1575/download/elproduktion.json"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"2004682"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elproduktion i kilowatt-timer (kWh)\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Electricity production in kilowatt hours (kWh)\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"E