 the year as a share of tax and general government grants to the municipality"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Årets resultat som andel av skatt och generella statsbidrag kommun"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/71968723-a568-46ed-9800-f96d1374fe80/resource/710309d5-f476-4c2e-812f-988ea96e27e3","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N03102"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Årets overskud divideret med summen af ​​skatteindtægter, generelle offentlige\ntilskud og udligning, kommune. Kilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"The year's profit divided by the sum of tax revenue, general government grants\nand equalization, municipality. Source: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Årets resultat dividerat med summan av skatteintäkter, generella statsbidrag och utjämning, kommun. Källa: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-07-08T06:39:52.918189"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:41:55.414780"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Årets resultat som andel af skat og generelle offentlige tilskud, kommune (%) (N03102)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Profit for the year as a share of tax & general government grants, municipality, (%) (N03102)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Årets resultat som andel av skatt & generella statsbidrag kommun, (%) (N03102)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:f70dff23fa4a17570fab86bdb26b1917d2e3089df983363ba98a0360947e19b1"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:f76773fcd6c4f6b41f614c62738727e5f590cdbd5db5b3bc74923b8e1be9bdb9_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/71cd0d3d-c4ef-43ad-b9c5-fbaab848d6e3","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/71cd0d3d-c4ef-43ad-b9c5-fbaab848d6e3/resource/44431847-39d1-40c0-a402-fadad0c2b6dc"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/GOVE"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Samlet antal årsansatte. Både måneds- og timelønnede ansatte er inkluderet.\nAntallet af årsansatte beregnes ud fra den faktiske beskæftigelsesfrekvens for\nmånedslønnede og arbejdstimer for timelønnede. Årslønnede angiver, hvor mange\nansatte kommunen ville have haft, hvis den faktiske beskæftigelsesfrekvens for\nmånedslønnede og arbejdstimer for timelønnede blev summeret til\nfuldtidsbeskæftigelse. Henviser til kommunalt ansatte (HÖK) i november.\nAnsatte i kommunale foreninger/kommunale selskaber er ikke inkluderet.\n\nKilde: SKR's personalestatistik (novemberstatistik) (via Kolada)\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Total number of annual employees. Both monthly and hourly employees are\nincluded. The number of annual employees is calculated using the actual\nemployment rate for monthly employees and hours worked for hourly employees.\nAnnual employees indicate how many employees the municipality would have had\nif the actual employment rate for monthly employees and hours worked for\nhourly employees were summed to full-time employment. Refers to municipal\nemployees (HÖK) in November. Employees within municipal associations/municipal\ncompanies are not included.\n\nSource: SKR's personnel statistics (November statistics) (via Kolada)\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal årsarbetare totalt. Både månadsavlönade och timavlönade ingår. Antalet årsarbetare räknas fram med hjälp av den faktiska sysselsättningsgraden för månadsavlönade och arbetade timmar för timavlönade. Årsarbetare anger hur många anställda kommunen skulle ha haft om den faktiska sysselsättningsgraden för månadsavlönade och arbetade timmar för timavlönade summerades till heltidsanställningar. Avser kommunalt anställda (HÖK) i november månad. Anställda inom kommunalförbund/kommunala bolag ingår inte.  \n \n  \nKälla: SKR:s personalstatistik (novemberstatistiken) (via Kolada)"}],"dct:identifier":"71cd0d3d-c4ef-43ad-b9c5-fbaab848d6e3","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-01"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:48:50.301761"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:f76773fcd6c4f6b41f614c62738727e5f590cdbd5db5b3bc74923b8e1be9bdb9_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Samlet antal årlige medarbejdere, kommune"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Total annual workers, municipality, number"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Årsarbetare totalt, kommun, antal"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/71cd0d3d-c4ef-43ad-b9c5-fbaab848d6e3/resource/44431847-39d1-40c0-a402-fadad0c2b6dc","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N00098"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Samlet antal årsansatte. Både måneds- og timelønnede ansatte er inkluderet.\nAntallet af årsansatte beregnes ud fra den faktiske beskæftigelsesfrekvens for\nmånedslønnede og arbejdstimer for timelønnede. Årslønnede angiver, hvor mange\nansatte kommunen ville have haft, hvis den faktiske beskæftigelsesfrekvens for\nmånedslønnede og arbejdstimer for timelønnede blev summeret til\nfuldtidsbeskæftigelse. Henviser til kommunalt ansatte (HÖK) i november.\nAnsatte i kommunale foreninger/kommunale selskaber er ikke inkluderet.\n\nKilde: SKR's personalestatistik (novemberstatistik) (via Kolada)\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Total number of annual employees. Both monthly and hourly employees are\nincluded. The number of annual employees is calculated using the actual\nemployment rate for monthly employees and hours worked for hourly employees.\nAnnual employees indicate how many employees the municipality would have had\nif the actual employment rate for monthly employees and hours worked for\nhourly employees were summed to full-time employment. Refers to municipal\nemployees (HÖK) in November. Employees within municipal associations/municipal\ncompanies are not included.\n\nSource: SKR's personnel statistics (November statistics) (via Kolada)\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal årsarbetare totalt. Både månadsavlönade och timavlönade ingår. Antalet årsarbetare räknas fram med hjälp av den faktiska sysselsättningsgraden för månadsavlönade och arbetade timmar för timavlönade. Årsarbetare anger hur många anställda kommunen skulle ha haft om den faktiska sysselsättningsgraden för månadsavlönade och arbetade timmar för timavlönade summerades till heltidsanställningar. Avser kommunalt anställda (HÖK) i november månad. Anställda inom kommunalförbund/kommunala bolag ingår inte.  \n \n  \nKälla: SKR:s personalstatistik (novemberstatistiken) (via Kolada)"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-12-01T10:27:22.069025"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:48:50.306818"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Samlet antal årlige medarbejdere, kommune"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Total annual workers, municipality, number"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Årsarbetare totalt, kommun, antal"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:f76773fcd6c4f6b41f614c62738727e5f590cdbd5db5b3bc74923b8e1be9bdb9"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:f87918ee81c5f2f3923dbd987a7c4f819f5e170e84a54db1d8efeea87071aa89_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/1065c852-f37f-4c95-afde-cd56bbee4a77","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/1065c852-f37f-4c95-afde-cd56bbee4a77/resource/2735e03a-fc56-4753-86e4-ee577b1a1ba6"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","parental allowance"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@lang