":"_:faac6ea4d837f8b96880f7c6c1297ec223d653effac8e69c3dd6f82802f56966_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"285960387ae48362e6f3b97b75c1ec99"},{"@id":"_:faac6ea4d837f8b96880f7c6c1297ec223d653effac8e69c3dd6f82802f56966_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Karl McShane","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:karl.mcshane@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/e632e252-0467-4061-ad5f-37349b5ceda6","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/ce429264a6a97cd4bc8687f7a5b0847d"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/e632e252-0467-4061-ad5f-37349b5ceda6/resource/113b63a8-761d-44b3-8105-8972263ad0c1"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/e632e252-0467-4061-ad5f-37349b5ceda6/resource/5d167d00-e514-4d89-96f6-881230df4e80"}],"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","driving license","körkort"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Viser antallet af personer bosiddende i det valgte område, som har et kørekort\nmed B-tilladelse, eller B-tilladelse sammen med andre tilladelser, som er\nregistreret i Trafikstyrelsens kørekortregister.\n\n**Variabelbeskrivelse**  \nDu finder det\n[her](https://malmo.se/download/18.437d186119ed4baa5961316/1782711645043/Variabelbeskrivning,%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**API'er**  \nVed at bruge API-kaldet\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics_\nkan du hente alle datasæt, der indeholder statistiske data for Malmøs områder,\ni JSON-format.  \nI hver forekomst af result/results i JSON-resultatet er der en \"id\"-egenskab\nfor hver ressource. Værdien af ​​\"id\" kan bruges til at hente dataene for den\nrespektive statistikvariabel (i henhold til værdien af ​​egenskaben \"name\").\nAPI-kald til at hente statistikdataene:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-\nværdi]_\n\nBrug gerne tallene, men angiv \"Bykontoret, Malmö Kommune\" som kilde.\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Shows the number of people living in the selected area who have a driving\nlicense with B-permission, or B-permission together with other permissions,\nwhich is registered in the Swedish Transport Agency's driving license\nregister.\n\n**Variable description**  \nYou find it\n[here](https://malmo.se/download/18.437d186119ed4baa5961316/1782711645043/Variabelbeskrivning,%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)\n!\n\n**APIs**  \nUsing the API call\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistics,_\nyou can retrieve all data sets that contain statistical data for Malmö's areas\nin JSON format.  \nIn each instance of result/results in the JSON result, there is an \"id\"\nproperty for each resource. The value of \"id\" can be used to retrieve the data\nfor the respective statistics variable (according to the value of the \"name\"\nproperty). API call to retrieve the statistics data:\n_https://opendata%2dapi.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id\nvalue]_\n\nFeel free to use the numbers, but cite “City Office, Malmö City” as the\nsource.\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Visar antalet personer boende i det valda området som har körkort med B-behörighet, eller B-behörighet tillsammans med andra behörigheter, som finns registrerat i Transportstyrelsens körkortsregister.\n\n__Variabelbeskrivning__  \nHittar du [här](https://malmo.se/download/18.437d186119ed4baa5961316/1782711645043/Variabelbeskrivning,%20statistikunderlag%20f%C3%B6r%20Malm%C3%B6s%20omr%C3%A5den.pdf)!  \n                     \n__API__  \nMed hjälp av API-anropet *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/resource_search?query=description:malm%C3%B6%20statistik* får man i JSON-format fram samtliga datamängder som innehåller statistikunderlag för Malmös områden.  \nI varje instans av result/results i JSON-resultatet finns för varje resurs en egenskap \"id\". Värdet för \"id\" kan användas för att hämta datan för respektive statistikvariabel (enligt värdet för egenskapen \"name\").\nAPI-anrop för att hämta statistikdatan: *https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/3/action/datastore_search?resource_id=[id-värdet]*   \n\nAnvänd gärna siffrorna, men ange “Stadskontoret, Malmö stad” som källa."}],"dct:identifier":"e632e252-0467-4061-ad5f-37349b5ceda6","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-08-25"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-08-24T23:08:24.789980"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:faac6ea4d837f8b96880f7c6c1297ec223d653effac8e69c3dd6f82802f56966_b1n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Kørekortbesiddelse - Statistiske data for Malmøs områder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Driving license possession - Statistical data for Malmö's areas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Körkortsinnehav - Statistikunderlag för Malmös områden"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/e632e252-0467-4061-ad5f-37349b5ceda6/resource/113b63a8-761d-44b3-8105-8972263ad0c1","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/api/action/datastore_search?resource_id=5d167d00-e514-4d89-96f6-881230df4e80"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø Statistik - Besiddelse af kørekort\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö Statistics - Driving license possession\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö Statistik - Körkortsinnehav"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-10-13T10:20:57.576723"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-01T11:13:28.040769"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Besiddelse af kørekort"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Driving license possession"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Körkortsinnehav"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/e632e252-0467-4061-ad5f-37349b5ceda6/resource/5d167d00-e514-4d89-96f6-881230df4e80","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/e632e252-0467-4061-ad5f-37349b5ceda6/resource/5d167d00-e514-4d89-96f6-881230df4e80/download/korkortsinnehav.csv"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"340969"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Malmø Statistik - Besiddelse af kørekort\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Malmö Statistics - Driving license possession\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Malmö Statistik - Körkortsinnehav"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2024-02-26T00:00:00"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-zero"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-08-24T23:08:24.796554"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Besiddelse af kørekort"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Driving license possession"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Körkortsinnehav"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:faac6ea4d837f8b96880f7c6c1297ec223d653effac8e69c3dd6f82802f56966_b0n0"}}],"@id":"urn:source:faac6ea4d837f8b96880f7c6c1297ec223d653effac8e69c3dd6f82802f56966"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:faec1c9448c7f35fcc6455118253d85f0dfdf01c968cfdbcf3af6f9dc6761d1d_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((12.8850967451 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.6421476735,13.1517619812 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.5022773196,12.8850967451 55.6421476735))"}},{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"opendata@malmo.se","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:opendata@malmo.se"}},{"@id":"https://malmo.se/","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"foaf:name":"Malmö stad"},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/c05b5f73-1615-482b-add0-1bf234988b74","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/290/resource/0e01ba1a25b24ce4d82683ada08cb166"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/c05b5f73-1615-482b-add0-1bf234988b74/resource/f4cce4d1-f380-4a52-81a9-555dcbc60970"},"dcat:keyword":["Malmö stad","kolada","statistik"],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/EDUC"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Antal elever i 9. klasse, der er berettigede til en erhvervsuddannelse,\ndivideret med antallet af elever, der fik eller ville have fået en karakter i\nmindst ét ​​fag i henhold til det mål- og vidensrelaterede karaktersystem i 9.\nklasse.\n\nStatistik i procenter fra 1998.\n\nFor at være berettiget til optagelse på en erhvervsuddannelse i gymnasiet\nkræves der karakterer i svensk eller svensk som andetsprog, engelsk og\nmatematik samt i mindst 5 andre fag fra grundskolen. Indtil 2011 krævedes der\nkarakterer i svensk eller svensk som andetsprog, engelsk og matematik for at\nopnå minimumsadgangskravet til gymnasiet.\n\nBegrebet \"lokationskommune\" henviser til elever på skoler beliggende i\nkommunen, uanset deres folkeregistreringssted.\n\nOplysningerne refererer til skoleåret. Hvis det samlede antal elever er 40\neller mere, og antallet af IKKE-berettigede elever er 1-4 elever, vises\nprocentdelen af ​​berettigede elever som 95 procent.\n\nI 2016 blev studerende med ukendt baggrund udelukket.\n\nKilde: Den svenske statslige skolestyrelse (Siris).\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Number of students in grade 9 who are eligible for a vocational program\ndivided by the number of students who received or would have received a grade\nin at least one subject according to the goal- and knowledge-related grading\nsystem in grade 9.\n\nStatistics in percentages from 1998.\n\nTo be eligible for upper secondary school admission to a vocational program,\npassing grades in Swedish or Swedish as a second language, English and\nmathematics and in at least 5 other subjects from compulsory school are\nrequired. Until 2011, passing grades in Swedish or Swedish as a second\nlanguage, English and mathematics were required to achieve the minimum\neligibility for upper secondary school.\n\nThe term \"location municipality\" refers to students in schools located in the\nmunicipality, regardless of their place of population registration.\n\nThe information refers to the school year. If the total number of students is\n40 or more and the number of NOT eligible students is 1-4 students, the\npercentage of eligible students is shown as 95 percent.\n\nIn 2016, students with unknown backgrounds were excluded.\n\nSource: Swedish National Agency for Education (Siris).\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal elever i årskurs 9 som är behöriga till ett yrkesprogram dividerat med antal elever som fått eller skulle ha fått betyg i minst ett ämne enligt det mål- och kunskapsrelaterade betygssystemet i årskurs 9. \n\nStatistik i procent från 1998.\n\nFör att ha gymnasiebehörighet till ett yrkesprogram krävs godkända betyg i svenska eller svenska som andraspråk, engelska och matematik och i minst 5 andra ämnen från grundskolan. Fram till och med 2011 krävdes godkända betyg i svenska eller svenska som andraspråk, engelska och matematik för att uppnå lägsta behörighet till gymnasiet. \n\nMed lägeskommun avses elever i skolor belägna i kommunen oavsett folkbokföringsort. \n\nUppgiften avser läsår. Om det totala antalet elever är 40 eller fler och antalet EJ behöriga är 1-4 elever, så visas andelen behöriga som 95 procent. \n\n2016 exkluderades elever med okänd bakgrund. \n\nKälla: Skolverket (Siris)."}],"dct:identifier":"c05b5f73-1615-482b-add0-1bf234988b74","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-15"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:39:16.136818"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://malmo.se/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:faec1c9448c7f35fcc6455118253d85f0dfdf01c968cfdbcf3af6f9dc6761d1d_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://www.geonames.org/2692965/malmoe.html"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elever i 9. klasse, der er berettigede til erhvervsuddannelser, placeringskommune"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Students in grade 9 who are eligible for vocational programs, location municipality"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elever i årskurs 9 som är behöriga till yrkesprogram, lägeskommun"}]},{"@id":"https://opendata-api.malmo.se/dataset/c05b5f73-1615-482b-add0-1bf234988b74/resource/f4cce4d1-f380-4a52-81a9-555dcbc60970","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/data/municipality/1280/kpi/N15424"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Antal elever i 9. klasse, der er berettigede til en erhvervsuddannelse,\ndivideret med antallet af elever, der har opnået eller ville have opnået\nkarakterer i mindst ét ​​fag i henhold til det mål- og vidensrelaterede\nkaraktersystem i 9. klasse. For at være berettiget til en erhvervsuddannelse i\ngymnasiet kræves der beståede karakterer i svensk eller svensk som andetsprog,\nengelsk og matematik samt i mindst fem andre fag fra grundskolen. Indtil 2011\nkrævedes der beståede karakterer i svensk eller svensk som andetsprog, engelsk\nog matematik for at opnå minimumsberettigelsen til gymnasiet. Kommunen, hvor\neleverne er hjemmehørende, refererer til elever på skoler i kommunen, uanset\nfolkeregistreringssted. Dataene refererer til skoleåret. Hvis det samlede\nantal elever er 40 eller mere, og antallet af IKKE-berettigede er 1-4 elever,\nvises procentdelen af ​​berettigede elever som 95 procent. I 2016 blev elever\nmed ukendt baggrund ekskluderet. Kilde: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Number of students in grade 9 who are eligible for a vocational program\ndivided by the number of students who received or would have received grades\nin at least one subject according to the goal- and knowledge-related grading\nsystem in grade 9. In order to have upper secondary school eligibility for a\nvocational program, passing grades in Swedish or Swedish as a second language,\nEnglish and mathematics and in at least five other subjects from compulsory\nschool are required. Until 2011, passing grades in Swedish or Swedish as a\nsecond language, English and mathematics were required to achieve the minimum\neligibility for upper secondary school. The municipality of location refers to\nstudents in schools located in the municipality regardless of the place of\npopulation registration. The data refers to the academic year. If the total\nnumber of students is 40 or more and the number of NOT eligible is 1-4\nstudents, the percentage of eligible students is shown as 95 percent. In 2016,\nstudents with unknown backgrounds were excluded. Source: Kolada\n\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal elever i årskurs 9 som är behöriga till ett yrkesprogram dividerat med antal elever som fått eller skulle ha fått betyg i minst ett ämne enligt det mål- och kunskapsrelaterade betygssystemet i årskurs 9. För att ha gymnasiebehörighet till ett yrkesprogram krävs godkända betyg i svenska eller svenska som andraspråk, engelska och matematik och i minst fem andra ämnen från grundskolan. Fram t.o.m. 2011 krävdes godkända betyg i svenska eller svenska som andraspråk, engelska och matematik för att uppnå lägsta behörighet till gymnasiet. Med lägeskommun avses elever i skolor belägna i kommunen oavsett folkbokföringsort. Uppgiften avser läsår. Om det totala antalet elever är 40 eller fler och antalet EJ behöriga är 1-4 elever, så visas andelen behöriga som 95 procent. 2016 exkluderades elever med okänd bakgrund. \nKälla: Kolada"}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-08-12T12:53:46.670056"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-04-17T08:39:16.161134"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"da","@value":"Elever i 9. klasse, der er berettigede til erhvervsuddannelser, placering, kommune, procentdel (%) (N15424)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Students in year 9 who are eligible for vocational programs, location municipality, percentage (%) (N15424)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elever i år 9 som är behöriga till yrkesprogram, lägeskommun, andel (%) (N15424)"}]}],"@id":"urn:source:faec1c9448c7f35fcc6455118253d85f0dfdf01c968cfdbcf3af6f9dc6761d1d"}]}
